----------------------------
**प्रश्न:** गद्यांश का मुख्य विषय क्या है?', '"[\"राजनीति / Politics\",\"जलवायु परिवर्तन / Climate Change\",\"अर्थव्यवस्था / Economy\",\"शिक्षा / Education\"]"', '1.0', NULL, 2, 0, 56, 'Reading Comprehension', '**Direction: Read the passage:**
Climate change is one of the biggest challenges today. Due to global warming, glaciers are melting and sea levels are rising. This also impacts agriculture and human health. We must adopt renewable energy sources.

----------------------------
**Question:** What is the main theme of the passage?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mppsc');
