----------------------------
**प्रश्न:** सौर ऊर्जा कैसा स्रोत है?', '"[\"अनवीकरणीय / Non-renewable\",\"नवीकरणीय / Renewable\",\"खतरनाक / Dangerous\",\"महंगा / Expensive\"]"', '1.0', NULL, 2, 0, 56, 'Reading Comprehension', '**Direction: Read passage:**
Solar energy is a major source of renewable energy. It is eco-friendly and reduces carbon emissions. India has immense potential for solar energy. The government is providing subsidies to promote it.

----------------------------
**Question:** What kind of source is solar energy?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mppsc');
