Which one of the following is correct in respect of the above statements?', '{"verdict": "Option C is correct.", "core_concept": "Wildlife Protection and species dietary behavior.", "elimination_wisdom": "Statement I is correct; fruit bats, including the Indian Flying Fox, were historically placed in Schedule V (Vermin) of the WPA 1972 (though schedules were recently amended, the historical categorization holds for such statements). Statement II is incorrect; the Indian Flying Fox is a frugivore (eats fruit and nectar), not a hematophage (blood-drinking vampire bat).", "trap_alerts": "The term ''Flying Fox'' (a bat) is associated in pop culture with blood-sucking vampires, misleading the unaware candidate."}', 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"layoutType":"assertion_reason","contextStr":"निम्नलिखित कथनों पर विचार कीजिए :","contextStrEn":"Consider the following statements:","statementI":"स्विट्ज़रलैंड, मूल्य के आधार पर, स्वर्ण के अग्रणी निर्यातकों में से एक है।","statementIEn":"Switzerland is one of the leading exporters of gold in terms of value.","statementII":"स्विट्ज़रलैंड के पास विश्व का दूसरा विशालतम स्वर्ण निचय (रिज़र्व) है।","statementIIEn":"Switzerland has the second largest gold reserves in the world.","questionPrompt":"उपर्युक्त कथनों के बारे में, निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा एक सही है?","questionPromptEn":"Which one of the following is correct in respect of the above statements?"}', 'mppsc');
