LDEA NGIF ? RMQP TPUU', '"[\"1. PIKL\",\"2. PJMK\",\"3. OKJM\",\"4. PKML\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 83, 'General', 'Q. 83)
Which of the following terms will replace the question mark (?) in the given series?

LDEA NGIF ? RMQP TPUU', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["श्रृंखला के प्रत्येक अक्षर का स्थान चेक करें:","पहला अक्षर: L(12), N(14), ?, R(18), T(20) ➔ +2 का अंतर है। तो N(14) + 2 = P(16).","दूसरा अक्षर: D(4), G(7), ?, M(13), P(16) ➔ +3 का अंतर है। तो G(7) + 3 = J(10).","तीसरा अक्षर: E(5), I(9), ?, Q(17), U(21) ➔ +4 का अंतर है। तो I(9) + 4 = M(13).","चौथा अक्षर: A(1), F(6), ?, P(16), U(21) ➔ +5 का अंतर है। तो F(6) + 5 = K(11).","सबको मिलाएँ: P-J-M-K"],"chainEn":["Check position of each letter in the series:","1st letter: L(+2) N(+2) P(+2) R(+2) T. Missing is P.","2nd letter: D(+3) G(+3) J(+3) M(+3) P. Missing is J.","3rd letter: E(+4) I(+4) M(+4) Q(+4) U. Missing is M.","4th letter: A(+5) F(+5) K(+5) P(+5) U. Missing is K.","Combined result: PJMK."],"pattern":"+2, +3, +4, +5 letter shifting","elimination":"First letter is P, eliminating option 3. Second is J, eliminating option 1 and 4. Only Option 2 remains. Boom!","memoryTip":"पूरा वर्ड डिकोड करने की कभी जरूरत नहीं होती। पहला और दूसरा अक्षर निकालते ही ऑप्शन्स देखो, आंसर मिल जाएगा!"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('U-fje0_rLFnlptNnexicn', '4dkhPsq6U4p7qF_tVJe1J', 'Q. 84)
In a college election between two rivals, a candidate got 30% of the total votes polled. He was defeated by his rival by 200 votes. The total number of votes polled was:', '"[\"1. 400\",\"2. 500\",\"3. 600\",\"4. 800\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 84, 'General', 'Q. 84)
In a college election between two rivals, a candidate got 30% of the total votes polled. He was defeated by his rival by 200 votes. The total number of votes polled was:', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["माना कुल वोट = 100%.","हारने वाले को मिले = 30%.","तो जीतने वाले को मिले होंगे = 100% - 30% = 70%.","जीतने और हारने वाले के वोटों का अंतर = 70% - 30% = 40%.","प्रश्न के अनुसार, यह अंतर 200 वोटों का है।","40% = 200 ➔ 1% = 5","कुल वोट (100%) = 5 × 100 = 500."],"stepsEn":["Let total votes = 100%.","Loser got = 30%.","Winner got = 100% - 30% = 70%.","Difference in their vote percentages = 70% - 30% = 40%.","According to the question, this difference equals 200 votes.","40% = 200 => 1% = 5.","Total votes (100%) = 5 × 100 = 500."],"shortcut":"Gap is 70% - 30% = 40%. 40% is 200. Thus 100% is 200 / 0.4 = 500. Directly do it mentally.","trap":"Many students set 30% = 200. WRONG! 200 is the MARGIN of defeat, which is the difference between the winner and loser.","memoryTip":"चुनाव (Election) के सवालों में हमेशा जीतने और हारने वाले का ''अंतर'' (Difference) ही जीत/हार तय करता है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('zECZdircfTCPbK-dv5uji', '4dkhPsq6U4p7qF_tVJe1J', 'Q. 85)
142 is related to 92 following a certain logic. Following the same logic, 255 is related to 205. To which of the following is 457 related following the same logic?', '"[\"1. 417\",\"2. 357\",\"3. 407\",\"4. 427\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 85, 'General', 'Q. 85)
142 is related to 92 following a certain logic. Following the same logic, 255 is related to 205. To which of the following is 457 related following the same logic?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पहले जोड़े का अंतर देखें: 142 - 92 = 50.","दूसरे जोड़े का अंतर देखें: 255 - 205 = 50.","लॉजिक बिल्कुल साफ़ है: पहली संख्या में से 50 घटाने पर दूसरी संख्या मिल रही है।","अब इसे 457 पर लागू करें: 457 - 50 = 407."],"chainEn":["Find the difference in the first pair: 142 - 92 = 50.","Find the difference in the second pair: 255 - 205 = 50.","The logic is clear: Subtract 50 from the first number to get the second.","Apply to 457: 457 - 50 = 407."],"pattern":"Constant Subtraction (-50)","elimination":"457 - 50 ends in 7. Options 1, 2, 3, 4 end in 7. Just do normal subtraction. 45-5 = 40. Hence 407.","memoryTip":"जब भी एनालॉजी में बड़े numbers हों, सबसे पहले उनका अंतर (Difference) चेक करो!"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('QC3YFKAJjH9NqfavvVUZz', '4dkhPsq6U4p7qF_tVJe1J', 'Q. 86)
If the average of three numbers is 20, and the first two numbers are respectively 20 and 22, what is the third number?', '"[\"1. 16\",\"2. 18\",\"3. 20\",\"4. 22\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 86, 'General', 'Q. 86)
If the average of three numbers is 20, and the first two numbers are respectively 20 and 22, what is the third number?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["3 संख्याओं का औसत = 20।","3 संख्याओं का कुल योग = 20 × 3 = 60।","पहली दो संख्याओं का योग = 20 + 22 = 42।","तीसरी संख्या = कुल योग - पहली दो का योग","तीसरी संख्या = 60 - 42 = 18।"],"stepsEn":["Average of 3 numbers = 20.","Total sum of 3 numbers = 20 × 3 = 60.","Sum of the first two numbers = 20 + 22 = 42.","Third number = Total sum - Sum of first two.","Third number = 60 - 42 = 18."],"shortcut":"Deviation method: Average is 20. First number is 20 (deviation 0). Second is 22 (deviation +2). To balance the average to 20, the third number must have a deviation of -2. So, 20 - 2 = 18.","trap":"Don''t just randomly guess 20 or 22 based on the pattern.","memoryTip":"औसत (Average) मतलब ''सब बराबर''। जो ज़्यादा ले गया (+2), वो दूसरे का काटेगा (-2)।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('4wLvIvfZyw2A-0SCPx3Z7', '4dkhPsq6U4p7qF_tVJe1J', 'Q. 87)
