19, ?, 43, 55, 67', '"[\"1. 27\",\"2. 29\",\"3. 31\",\"4. 33\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 88, 'General', 'Q. 88)
Which of the following numbers will replace the question mark (?) in the given series?

19, ?, 43, 55, 67', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["श्रृंखला के पीछे से अंतर (Difference) चेक करें: 67 - 55 = 12.","55 - 43 = 12.","यहाँ 12 का स्थिर (constant) अंतर चल रहा है।","तो आगे भी यही होगा: 19 + 12 = 31.","क्रॉस-चेक करें: 31 + 12 = 43. (पैटर्न बिल्कुल सही है)।"],"chainEn":["Check differences from the end of the series: 67 - 55 = 12.","55 - 43 = 12.","There is a constant difference of +12.","Apply it to the start: 19 + 12 = 31.","Cross-verify: 31 + 12 = 43. The logic holds perfectly."],"pattern":"Constant Addition (+12)","elimination":"19 + 12 ends in 1. Only Option 3 matches this.","memoryTip":"अगर बीच में ''?'' हो, तो सीरीज को पीछे (Right) से डिकोड करना शुरू करो, पैटर्न जल्दी पकड़ में आएगा।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('UTnkO3st65gPBq84HTUyG', '4dkhPsq6U4p7qF_tVJe1J', 'Q. 89)
The state which receives maximum rainfall due to North-East monsoon is:', '"[\"1. Kerala (केरल)\",\"2. Tamil Nadu (तमिलनाडु)\",\"3. Andhra Pradesh (आंध्र प्रदेश)\",\"4. Karnataka (कर्नाटक)\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 89, 'General', 'Q. 89)
The state which receives maximum rainfall due to North-East monsoon is:', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["उत्तर-पूर्वी मानसून (North-East Monsoon) को ''लौटता हुआ मानसून'' (Retreating Monsoon) भी कहा जाता है।","यह मुख्य रूप से सर्दियों (अक्टूबर से दिसंबर) में आता है।","लौटते समय यह बंगाल की खाड़ी से नमी उठाता है और सबसे ज्यादा बारिश तमिलनाडु के तटीय क्षेत्रों (कोरोमंडल तट) में करता है।"],"factsEn":["The North-East Monsoon is also known as the Retreating Monsoon.","It primarily occurs during winter (October to December).","While retreating, the winds pick up moisture from the Bay of Bengal and cause maximum rainfall in Tamil Nadu (Coromandel Coast)."],"mnemonics":["TN -> Takes NE (Monsoon)."],"related":["South-West Monsoon causes maximum rainfall across the rest of India (starting from Kerala)."],"memoryTip":"सर्दियों में बाढ़ कहाँ आती है? चेन्नई (तमिलनाडु) में! बस यही उत्तर-पूर्वी मानसून का कमाल है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('tlb7Rk4IE5vKh0eWyyuv-', '4dkhPsq6U4p7qF_tVJe1J', 'Q. 90)
When you are walking, you saw a borewell pit which is not buried. You will-', '"[\"1. Ignore it and walk away. (उसे नज़रअंदाज़ करेंगे और चले जाएंगे।)\",\"2. Try to fill it with nearby soil completely. (आसपास की मिट्टी से उसे पूरी तरह भरने की कोशिश करेंगे।)\",\"3. Put a warning sign/object near it and inform local authorities. (उसके पास एक चेतावनी का बोर्ड/वस्तु रखेंगे और स्थानीय अधिकारियों को सूचित करेंगे।)\",\"4. Stand there all day to warn people. (लोगों को चेतावनी देने के लिए पूरा दिन वहीं खड़े रहेंगे।)\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 90, 'General', 'Q. 90)
When you are walking, you saw a borewell pit which is not buried. You will-', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["यह एक सिचुएशन रिएक्शन टेस्ट (SRT) है जो आपकी ज़िम्मेदारी परखता है।","इग्नोर करना (विकल्प 1) गैर-ज़िम्मेदाराना है, कोई बच्चा गिर सकता है।","खुद मिट्टी से भरना (विकल्प 2) व्यावहारिक नहीं है, क्योंकि बोरवेल बहुत गहरे होते हैं।","पूरा दिन वहाँ खड़े रहना (विकल्प 4) भी व्यावहारिक नहीं है।","सबसे अच्छा तरीका: तुरंत कोई निशान/बैरिकेड लगाएं और प्रशासन (पुलिस/नगर निगम) को बुलाएं।"],"chainEn":["This is an SRT question testing your civic sense and practical problem-solving.","Ignoring it (Opt 1) is irresponsible and dangerous for others.","Filling it yourself (Opt 2) is impractical because borewells are extremely deep.","Standing there all day (Opt 4) is practically impossible.","The best civic action: Secure the perimeter with a warning marker and immediately notify the authorities."],"pattern":"Situation Reaction Test - Civic Sense & Practicality","elimination":"Always pick the most ''practical'' and ''authoritative'' solution. You are a citizen, not a superman. Inform the right people.","memoryTip":"समस्या दिखे तो 2 काम करो: 1. तुरंत अस्थाई बचाव (Warning sign), 2. स्थाई समाधान के लिए Authorities को कॉल!"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('S9gZ2HoGmyluJeJXHfIXc', '4dkhPsq6U4p7qF_tVJe1J', 'Q. 91)
Madhya Pradesh has how many Lok Sabha constituencies?', '"[\"1. 25\",\"2. 29\",\"3. 11\",\"4. 230\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 91, 'General', 'Q. 91)
Madhya Pradesh has how many Lok Sabha constituencies?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मध्य प्रदेश में लोकसभा की कुल 29 सीटें हैं।","इन 29 सीटों में से 4 सीटें अनुसूचित जाति (SC) और 6 सीटें अनुसूचित जनजाति (ST) के लिए आरक्षित हैं।","राज्यसभा की 11 सीटें और विधानसभा की 230 सीटें हैं।"],"factsEn":["Madhya Pradesh has a total of 29 Lok Sabha constituencies.","Out of these 29 seats, 4 are reserved for SC (Scheduled Castes) and 6 are reserved for ST (Scheduled Tribes).","MP has 11 Rajya Sabha seats and 230 Legislative Assembly (Vidhan Sabha) seats."],"mnemonics":["29 Lok, 11 Rajya, 230 Vidhan."],"related":["Uttar Pradesh has the highest Lok Sabha seats (80)."],"memoryTip":"29 (Lok Sabha), 11 (Rajya Sabha), 230 (Vidhan Sabha). ये तीन नंबर MP के हर नागरिक को रटे होने चाहिए!"}}', 'mppolice');
