(c) कोल -- (iii) दण्डामी

(d) सहरिया -- (iv) भूमिया (भूमिका)', '"[{\"id\":\"A\",\"text\":\"(a)-iii, (b)-iv, (c)-ii, (d)-i\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-iii, (b)-iv, (c)-ii, (d)-i\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"text\":\"(a)-iv, (b)-iii, (c)-i, (d)-ii\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-iv, (b)-iii, (c)-i, (d)-ii\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"text\":\"(a)-i, (b)-ii, (c)-iii, (d)-iv\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-i, (b)-ii, (c)-iii, (d)-iv\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"text\":\"(a)-ii, (b)-iv, (c)-i, (d)-iii\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-ii, (b)-iv, (c)-i, (d)-iii\"}]"', '3.0', '[object Object]', 3, 1, 95, 'MP GK', 'Match the following tribes of Madhya Pradesh with their sub-tribes:

