(d) Saharia -- (iv) Bhumiya (Bhumika)', NULL, 45, 'matching', '[{"id":"1","left":"(a) बैगा","left_en":"(a) Baiga","right":"(ii) नरोतिया","right_en":"(ii) Narotia"},{"id":"2","left":"(b) भारिया","left_en":"(b) Bharia","right":"(iv) भूमिया (भूमिका)","right_en":"(iv) Bhumiya (Bhumika)"},{"id":"3","left":"(c) कोल","left_en":"(c) Kol","right":"(i) रोहिया","right_en":"(i) Rohia"},{"id":"4","left":"(d) सहरिया","left_en":"(d) Saharia","right":"(iii) दण्डामी","right_en":"(iii) Dandami"}]', NULL, NULL, 'mppsc');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('WQYIF9T5RvoVXWiv13j0Q', '96_6JkQybSxCkaseu_zts', 'मध्य प्रदेश में नर्मदापुरम जिले के आदमगढ़ पुरास्थल के विषय में निम्नांकित में से कौन-सा तथ्य असत्य है?', '"[{\"id\":\"A\",\"text\":\"यह पुरास्थल नर्मदा नदी के तट पर स्थित है।\",\"text_en\":\"This archaeological site is situated on the banks of the Narmada river.\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"text\":\"यहाँ पशुपालन के प्राचीनतम प्रमाण प्राप्त हुए हैं।\",\"text_en\":\"The oldest evidence of animal husbandry has been found here.\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"text\":\"इस पुरास्थल पर वी० एस० वाकणकर द्वारा पुरातात्विक उत्खनन किया गया था।\",\"text_en\":\"Archaeological excavation at this site was done by V.S. Wakankar.\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"text\":\"यहाँ बड़ी संख्या में पुरापाषाणयुगीन उपकरण एवं अस्थि अवशेष प्राप्त हुए हैं।\",\"text_en\":\"A large number of Paleolithic tools and bone remains have been found here.\"}]"', '2.0', '[object Object]', 3, 1, 96, 'History', 'Which of the following facts is false regarding the Adamgarh archaeological site of Narmadapuram district in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 45, 'standard', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mppsc');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('G6JFaf217W0Xezg1khWE2', '96_6JkQybSxCkaseu_zts', 'मध्य प्रदेश के निम्नांकित साहित्यकारों को उनकी कृतियों से सुमेलित कीजिए :

(साहित्यकार) -- (कृतियाँ)

(a) केशवदास -- (i) गंगालहरी

(b) भवानी प्रसाद मिश्र -- (ii) गुलाबी उर्दू

(c) पद्माकर -- (iii) गांधी पंचशती

(d) मुल्ला रमूजी -- (iv) कविप्रिया', '"[{\"id\":\"A\",\"text\":\"(a)-iv, (b)-iii, (c)-i, (d)-ii\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-iv, (b)-iii, (c)-i, (d)-ii\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"text\":\"(a)-ii, (b)-iv, (c)-iii, (d)-i\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-ii, (b)-iv, (c)-iii, (d)-i\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"text\":\"(a)-i, (b)-ii, (c)-iii, (d)-iv\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-i, (b)-ii, (c)-iii, (d)-iv\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"text\":\"(a)-iii, (b)-i, (c)-iv, (d)-ii\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-iii, (b)-i, (c)-iv, (d)-ii\"}]"', '0.0', '[object Object]', 3, 1, 97, 'MP GK', 'Match the following litterateurs of Madhya Pradesh with their works:

(Litterateurs) -- (Works)

(a) Keshavdas -- (i) Gangalahari

(b) Bhawani Prasad Mishra -- (ii) Gulabi Urdu

(c) Padmakar -- (iii) Gandhi Panchshati

(d) Mulla Ramuji -- (iv) Kavipriya', NULL, 40, 'matching', '[{"id":"1","left":"(a) केशवदास","left_en":"(a) Keshavdas","right":"(iv) कविप्रिया","right_en":"(iv) Kavipriya"},{"id":"2","left":"(b) भवानी प्रसाद मिश्र","left_en":"(b) Bhawani Prasad Mishra","right":"(iii) गांधी पंचशती","right_en":"(iii) Gandhi Panchshati"},{"id":"3","left":"(c) पद्माकर","left_en":"(c) Padmakar","right":"(i) गंगालहरी","right_en":"(i) Gangalahari"},{"id":"4","left":"(d) मुल्ला रमूजी","left_en":"(d) Mulla Ramuji","right":"(ii) गुलाबी उर्दू","right_en":"(ii) Gulabi Urdu"}]', NULL, NULL, 'mppsc');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('YRpTLbD7g3JRnpOZ6Oxr7', '96_6JkQybSxCkaseu_zts', 'निम्नांकित लोकगीतों को उनकी विशेषताओं से सुमेलित कीजिए :

(लोकगीत) -- (विशेषता)

(a) रेलो गीत -- (i) निर्गुणी दार्शनिक गीत

(b) सिंगाजी और दलूजी -- (ii) वीर गीत

(c) बम्बुलिया -- (iii) युवा-युवतियों का गीत

(d) आल्हा उदल -- (iv) धार्मिक गीत', '"[{\"id\":\"A\",\"text\":\"(a)-i, (b)-ii, (c)-iii, (d)-iv\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-i, (b)-ii, (c)-iii, (d)-iv\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"text\":\"(a)-iv, (b)-iii, (c)-i, (d)-ii\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-iv, (b)-iii, (c)-i, (d)-ii\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"text\":\"(a)-iii, (b)-i, (c)-iv, (d)-ii\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-iii, (b)-i, (c)-iv, (d)-ii\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"text\":\"(a)-i, (b)-iv, (c)-iii, (d)-ii\",\"text_en\":\"(a)-i, (b)-iv, (c)-iii, (d)-ii\"}]"', '2.0', '[object Object]', 3, 1, 98, 'MP GK', 'Match the following folk songs with their characteristics:

(Folk Song) -- (Characteristic)

(a) Relo Geet -- (i) Nirguni philosophical song

(b) Singaji and Daluji -- (ii) Heroic song

(c) Bambuliya -- (iii) Song of young men and women

(d) Alha Udal -- (iv) Religious song', NULL, 45, 'matching', '[{"id":"1","left":"(a) रेलो गीत","left_en":"(a) Relo Geet","right":"(iii) युवा-युवतियों का गीत","right_en":"(iii) Song of young men and women"},{"id":"2","left":"(b) सिंगाजी और दलूजी","left_en":"(b) Singaji and Daluji","right":"(i) निर्गुणी दार्शनिक गीत","right_en":"(i) Nirguni philosophical song"},{"id":"3","left":"(c) बम्बुलिया","left_en":"(c) Bambuliya","right":"(iv) धार्मिक गीत","right_en":"(iv) Religious song"},{"id":"4","left":"(d) आल्हा उदल","left_en":"(d) Alha Udal","right":"(ii) वीर गीत","right_en":"(ii) Heroic song"}]', NULL, NULL, 'mppsc');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('_xUzLcyLHIHT9K7nNuVCA', '96_6JkQybSxCkaseu_zts', 'बंकिम चन्द्र चटर्जी के उपन्यास ''आनंदमठ'' के अनुसार, किस पात्र के द्वारा ''वंदे मातरम्'' गीत गाया गया था ?', '"[{\"id\":\"A\",\"text\":\"महेन्द्र सिंह\",\"text_en\":\"Mahendra Singh\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"text\":\"कल्याणी\",\"text_en\":\"Kalyani\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"text\":\"सिपाही भवानंद\",\"text_en\":\"Sepoy Bhavananda\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"text\":\"शांति\",\"text_en\":\"Shanti\"}]"', '2.0', '[object Object]', 3, 1, 99, 'History', 'According to Bankim Chandra Chatterjee''s novel ''Anandamath'', which character sang the song ''Vande Mataram''?', NULL, 45, 'standard', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mppsc');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('O2UdDh5fuL_ffruB5F9kF', '96_6JkQybSxCkaseu_zts', 'मालवा की माच लोक रंगशैली को वर्तमान में प्रदर्शनकारी विधा के रूप में बदलने का श्रेय किसे दिया जाता है?', '"[{\"id\":\"A\",\"text\":\"सिद्धेश्वर सेन\",\"text_en\":\"Siddheshwar Sen\"},{\"id\":\"B\",\"text\":\"कौशल सिंह\",\"text_en\":\"Kaushal Singh\"},{\"id\":\"C\",\"text\":\"केसरी सिंह\",\"text_en\":\"Kesari Singh\"},{\"id\":\"D\",\"text\":\"रेवाराम कुलीवाला\",\"text_en\":\"Rewaram Kuliwala\"}]"', '0.0', '[object Object]', 3, 1, 100, 'MP GK', 'Who is credited with transforming the Maach folk theatre style of Malwa into a modern performing art form?', NULL, 35, 'standard', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mppsc');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('UCtgGG7Q8pX720zVJa4a7', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'दी गई श्रृंखला में अगला पद ज्ञात कीजिए: 8, 11, 20, 47, 128, ?', '"[\"1) 371 / 371\",\"2) 256 / 256\",\"3) 361 / 361\",\"4) 381 / 381\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'Find the next term in the given series: 8, 11, 20, 47, 128, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पदों के बीच का अंतर निकालें: 11 - 8 = 3","20 - 11 = 9","47 - 20 = 27","128 - 47 = 81","अंतर 3 की घात (powers of 3) में बढ़ रहा है: 3¹, 3², 3³, 3⁴।","अगला अंतर 3⁵ = 243 होगा।","अतः, 128 + 243 = 371"],"chainEn":["Find the difference between terms: 11 - 8 = 3","20 - 11 = 9","47 - 20 = 27","128 - 47 = 81","The difference is increasing in powers of 3: 3¹, 3², 3³, 3⁴.","The next difference will be 3⁵ = 243.","Thus, 128 + 243 = 371"],"pattern":"Difference is an increasing power of 3.","elimination":"The gap is growing exponentially. Adding 243 to 128 gives exactly 371.","memoryTip":"Whenever differences multiply by the same number (e.g., 3, 9, 27...), it is an exponential difference series."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('2zB1NPeL2Bmmzi6Iua4pz', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'यदि एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में ''TABLE'' को ''GZYOV'' लिखा जाता है, तो उसी कूट भाषा में ''CHAIR'' को क्या लिखा जाएगा?', '"[\"1) XSZIR / XSZIR\",\"2) XSZRI / XSZRI\",\"3) YSZRI / YSZRI\",\"4) XTZRI / XTZRI\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'If in a certain code language ''TABLE'' is written as ''GZYOV'', then how will ''CHAIR'' be written in that language?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["यह विपरीत अक्षरों (Opposite letters) का एक कूट है।","T का विपरीत G, A का Z, B का Y, L का O, और E का V है।","यही नियम ''CHAIR'' पर लागू करें:","C का विपरीत X, H का S, A का Z, I का R, और R का I है।","परिणाम: XSZRI"],"chainEn":["This is a code of opposite letters.","Opposite of T is G, A is Z, B is Y, L is O, and E is V.","Apply the same rule to ''CHAIR'':","Opposite of C is X, H is S, A is Z, I is R, and R is I.","Result: XSZRI"],"pattern":"Direct Opposite Letter Coding.","elimination":"C''s opposite is X, eliminating option 3. I''s opposite is R, and R''s opposite is I, so the end must be RI, not IR. This eliminates option 1.","memoryTip":"Memorize opposite pairs using words: CX (CraX), HS (High School), AZ (A to Z), IR (Indian Railways)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('6DEDvpv0XKF_M6knlHcKp', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'यदि P + Q का अर्थ है ''P, Q की बहन है'', P - Q का अर्थ है ''P, Q का भाई है'', P * Q का अर्थ है ''P, Q का पिता है'', और P / Q का अर्थ है ''P, Q की माता है''। व्यंजक ''A + B * C - D'' में, A, D से किस प्रकार संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) बहन / Sister\",\"2) बुआ / Paternal Aunt\",\"3) दादी / Grandmother\",\"4) माँ / Mother\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'If P + Q means ''P is the sister of Q'', P - Q means ''P is the brother of Q'', P * Q means ''P is the father of Q'', and P / Q means ''P is the mother of Q''. In the expression ''A + B * C - D'', how is A related to D?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["व्यंजक को बाएँ से दाएँ हल करें:","A + B: A, B की बहन है।","B * C: B, C का पिता है।","C - D: C, D का भाई है।","चूँकि C, D का भाई है और B उनका पिता है, इसका मतलब B, D का भी पिता है।","A, पिता (B) की बहन है। पिता की बहन को बुआ (Paternal Aunt) कहते हैं।"],"chainEn":["Solve the expression from left to right:","A + B: A is the sister of B.","B * C: B is the father of C.","C - D: C is the brother of D.","Since C is D''s brother and B is their father, B is also D''s father.","A is the sister of the father (B). Father''s sister is a Paternal Aunt."],"pattern":"Coded Blood Relation Equation.","elimination":"A is the sister of D''s father. She is one generation above D, so she cannot be a sister. Father''s sister is strictly an Aunt (बुआ).","memoryTip":"Draw the tree top-down: A(female) and B(male) in the same row. C and D below B. A is B''s sister, making her D''s aunt."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('9YrUgeDfks76J1PWn39hB', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'रमेश उत्तर की ओर 20 मीटर चलता है, फिर बायीं ओर मुड़कर 15 मीटर चलता है। वह फिर से बायीं ओर मुड़ता है और 20 मीटर चलता है। अंत में, वह दायीं ओर मुड़ता है और 10 मीटर चलता है। वह प्रारंभिक बिंदु से कितनी दूर और किस दिशा में है?', '"[\"1) 25 मीटर पश्चिम / 25m West\",\"2) 25 मीटर पूर्व / 25m East\",\"3) 15 मीटर पश्चिम / 15m West\",\"4) 30 मीटर उत्तर / 30m North\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'Ramesh walks 20m North, turns left and walks 15m. He turns left again and walks 20m. Finally, he turns right and walks 10m. How far and in which direction is he from the starting point?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["प्रारंभिक बिंदु से: रमेश 20m उत्तर जाता है।","बायीं ओर मुड़ता है (पश्चिम की ओर) और 15m चलता है।","फिर बायीं ओर मुड़ता है (दक्षिण की ओर) और 20m चलता है। यह 20m दक्षिण पहले के 20m उत्तर को रद्द कर देता है।","अब वह प्रारंभिक बिंदु के ठीक 15m पश्चिम में है।","अंत में वह दायीं ओर मुड़ता है (दक्षिण से दायीं ओर मतलब फिर से पश्चिम) और 10m चलता है।","कुल क्षैतिज दूरी = 15m (पश्चिम) + 10m (पश्चिम) = 25m पश्चिम।"],"chainEn":["From start: Ramesh goes 20m North.","Turns left (West) and walks 15m.","Turns left again (South) and walks 20m. This 20m South cancels the initial 20m North.","He is now exactly 15m West of his starting point.","Finally, he turns right (Right from South is West again) and walks 10m.","Total horizontal distance = 15m (West) + 10m (West) = 25m West."],"pattern":"Path cancellation and additive direction.","elimination":"The North and South 20m movements cancel completely. He moved 15m West, then 10m West. Total is 25m West.","memoryTip":"When a person moves equal distances in opposite directions (North then South), they return to their original axis. Just add the remaining horizontal vectors."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('a4Q3JeZcrtRlSpTkzTlyv', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'कथन: 1. सभी आम सेब हैं। 2. कुछ सेब अंगूर हैं।
निष्कर्ष: I. कुछ आम अंगूर हैं। II. सभी अंगूर सेब हैं।', '"[\"1) केवल निष्कर्ष I सही है / Only conclusion I follows\",\"2) केवल निष्कर्ष II सही है / Only conclusion II follows\",\"3) दोनों सही हैं / Both follow\",\"4) कोई सही नहीं है / None follows\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'Statements: 1. All mangoes are apples. 2. Some apples are grapes.
Conclusions: I. Some mangoes are grapes. II. All grapes are apples.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["आम का पूरा वृत्त सेब के वृत्त के अंदर है।","सेब का वृत्त अंगूर के वृत्त के साथ जुड़ता (intersect) है।","हालाँकि, यह आवश्यक नहीं है कि अंगूर का वृत्त आम के वृत्त को छुए। इसलिए, ''कुछ आम अंगूर हैं'' एक संभावना है, लेकिन निश्चित सत्य नहीं (निष्कर्ष I गलत है)।","कथन कहता है ''कुछ सेब अंगूर हैं'', यह ''सभी अंगूर सेब हैं'' की गारंटी नहीं देता (निष्कर्ष II गलत है)।","अतः कोई भी निष्कर्ष सत्य नहीं है।"],"chainEn":["The entire Mango circle is inside the Apple circle.","The Apple circle intersects with the Grapes circle.","However, it''s not guaranteed that the Grapes circle touches the Mango circle. So, ''Some mangoes are grapes'' is a possibility, but not a definite truth (Conclusion I is false).","The statement says ''Some apples are grapes'', this does not guarantee ''All grapes are apples'' (Conclusion II is false).","Hence, neither conclusion follows."],"pattern":"A + I Syllogism Rule (No definite conclusion).","elimination":"Intersection with an outer boundary (Apples) does not mean intersection with the inner core (Mangoes).","memoryTip":"A(All) + I(Some) typically yields NO definite relation between the first and third elements in standard syllogism."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('iEj6me5DYyhig65Fx1c32', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'अक्षर श्रृंखला को पूरा करें: B, E, I, N, T, ?', '"[\"1) Z / Z\",\"2) A / A\",\"3) Y / Y\",\"4) B / B\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'Complete the alphabet series: B, E, I, N, T, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["अक्षरों के स्थानीय मान लिखें: B=2, E=5, I=9, N=14, T=20","अंतर निकालें: 5-2 = +3","9-5 = +4","14-9 = +5","20-14 = +6","अंतर +3, +4, +5, +6 के रूप में बढ़ रहा है। अगला अंतर +7 होगा।","20 + 7 = 27। चूँकि वर्णमाला में 26 अक्षर होते हैं, 27वाँ अक्षर A (27 - 26 = 1) होगा।"],"chainEn":["Write the positional values: B=2, E=5, I=9, N=14, T=20","Find differences: 5-2 = +3","9-5 = +4","14-9 = +5","20-14 = +6","The gap is increasing as +3, +4, +5, +6. The next gap will be +7.","20 + 7 = 27. Since there are 26 letters, the 27th letter is A (27 - 26 = 1)."],"pattern":"Increasing letter gap (+3, +4, +5, +6, +7).","elimination":"T + 7 shifts past Z. Z is 26, so 27 is A.","memoryTip":"Whenever a calculation exceeds 26 in the alphabet, simply subtract 26 to find the correct letter position."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('7BFwOXj1nRW860VDLA84A', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'आप एक ट्रैफिक चौराहे पर ड्यूटी पर हैं। एक प्रभावशाली स्थानीय नेता की कार शराब पीकर गाड़ी चलाने (Drunk Driving) के संदेह में पकड़ी जाती है। नेता आप पर कार छोड़ने का दबाव डालता है और तबादले की धमकी देता है। आपकी सही कार्रवाई क्या होनी चाहिए?', '"[\"1) तबादले के डर से कार को तुरंत जाने देंगे / Let the car go immediately out of fear of transfer\",\"2) नेता से बहस करेंगे और उन्हें भी गिरफ्तार कर लेंगे / Argue with the leader and arrest them too\",\"3) विनम्रता से दृढ़ रहेंगे, उच्च अधिकारियों को सूचित करेंगे और कानून के अनुसार मेडिकल जांच/चालान की प्रक्रिया पूरी करेंगे / Remain politely firm, inform higher authorities, and complete the medical check/challan process strictly as per law\",\"4) मामले को निपटाने के लिए रिश्वत मांगेंगे / Ask for a bribe to settle the matter\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'You are on duty at a traffic intersection. A prominent local leader''s car is caught on suspicion of Drunk Driving. The leader pressures you to let the car go and threatens you with a transfer. What should be your correct course of action?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["ड्यूटी पर एक पुलिसकर्मी का कर्तव्य कानून को बिना किसी डर या पक्षपात के लागू करना है।","शराब पीकर गाड़ी चलाना एक गंभीर अपराध है जिससे जनता की जान को खतरा होता है।","धमकी के आगे झुकना (विकल्प 1) या रिश्वत लेना (विकल्प 4) भ्रष्टाचार और कायरता है।","अनावश्यक बहस या आक्रामकता (विकल्प 2) स्थिति को खराब कर सकती है।","सही दृष्टिकोण पेशेवर बने रहना, प्रक्रिया का पालन करना और वरिष्ठ अधिकारियों को लूप में रखना है।"],"chainEn":["A police officer''s duty is to enforce the law without fear or favor.","Drunk driving is a serious offense that endangers public lives.","Bowing to threats (Option 1) or taking bribes (Option 4) is corruption and cowardice.","Unnecessary argument or aggression (Option 2) can escalate the situation.","The correct approach is to remain professional, follow the legal procedure, and keep senior officers in the loop."],"pattern":"Police Ethics / VIP Pressure SRT.","elimination":"Options 1, 2, and 4 represent extremes of cowardice, aggression, and corruption. Option 3 embodies standard professional operating procedure.","memoryTip":"In SRTs involving VIPs, always choose the option that combines ''Politeness/Respect'' with ''Firm adherence to the Law''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('tG_SoBpZGSf2xfZgwb0hu', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'दी गई श्रृंखला में प्रश्न चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आएगा: 5, 13, 29, 61, 125, ?', '"[\"1) 253 / 253\",\"2) 251 / 251\",\"3) 249 / 249\",\"4) 255 / 255\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'What will come in place of the question mark (?) in the series: 5, 13, 29, 61, 125, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पैटर्न (n × 2) + 3 का अनुसरण कर रहा है।","5 × 2 + 3 = 10 + 3 = 13","13 × 2 + 3 = 26 + 3 = 29","29 × 2 + 3 = 58 + 3 = 61","61 × 2 + 3 = 122 + 3 = 125","अगला पद: 125 × 2 + 3 = 250 + 3 = 253"],"chainEn":["The pattern is following (n × 2) + 3.","5 × 2 + 3 = 10 + 3 = 13","13 × 2 + 3 = 26 + 3 = 29","29 × 2 + 3 = 58 + 3 = 61","61 × 2 + 3 = 122 + 3 = 125","Next term: 125 × 2 + 3 = 250 + 3 = 253"],"pattern":"(×2 + 3) multiplier series.","elimination":"125 × 2 is 250. Adding 3 yields exactly 253, eliminating other close numbers.","memoryTip":"If a series roughly doubles at every step, find the exact difference between the doubled value and the actual next term. It is usually a constant like +1, +2, or +3."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('9SWneJUNCRSH1jYbERIXJ', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'यदि ''RED'' को 27 और ''BLUE'' को 40 के रूप में कूटबद्ध किया गया है, तो ''BLACK'' को कैसे कूटबद्ध किया जाएगा?', '"[\"1) 31 / 31\",\"2) 29 / 29\",\"3) 30 / 30\",\"4) 28 / 28\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'If ''RED'' is coded as 27 and ''BLUE'' as 40, how will ''BLACK'' be coded?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["यह शब्दों के अक्षरों के स्थानीय मानों (Place Values) का योग है।","R(18) + E(5) + D(4) = 27","B(2) + L(12) + U(21) + E(5) = 40","यही नियम ''BLACK'' पर लागू करें:","B(2) + L(12) + A(1) + C(3) + K(11)","योग: 2 + 12 + 1 + 3 + 11 = 29"],"chainEn":["This is the sum of the positional values of the letters in the words.","R(18) + E(5) + D(4) = 27","B(2) + L(12) + U(21) + E(5) = 40","Apply the same rule to ''BLACK'':","B(2) + L(12) + A(1) + C(3) + K(11)","Sum: 2 + 12 + 1 + 3 + 11 = 29"],"pattern":"Direct Sum of Positional Values.","elimination":"Adding 2+12+1+3+11 yields exactly 29.","memoryTip":"Always quickly write down the numbers above the letters during the exam. B=2, L=12, A=1, C=3, K=11."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('r1IPIWioTZcfyn43__W6q', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'कथन: 1. कोई मोबाइल लैपटॉप नहीं है। 2. सभी लैपटॉप कंप्यूटर हैं।
निष्कर्ष: I. कुछ कंप्यूटर मोबाइल नहीं हैं। II. कोई कंप्यूटर मोबाइल नहीं है।', '"[\"1) केवल निष्कर्ष I सही है / Only conclusion I follows\",\"2) केवल निष्कर्ष II सही है / Only conclusion II follows\",\"3) दोनों सही हैं / Both follow\",\"4) कोई सही नहीं है / None follows\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'Statements: 1. No mobile is a laptop. 2. All laptops are computers.
Conclusions: I. Some computers are not mobiles. II. No computer is a mobile.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["सभी लैपटॉप कंप्यूटर के अंदर हैं।","कोई भी लैपटॉप मोबाइल नहीं हो सकता (लैपटॉप और मोबाइल पूरी तरह अलग हैं)।","चूँकि लैपटॉप कंप्यूटर का हिस्सा हैं, इसलिए कंप्यूटर का वह हिस्सा जो लैपटॉप है, कभी मोबाइल नहीं हो सकता।","इसलिए, ''कुछ कंप्यूटर (जो लैपटॉप हैं) मोबाइल नहीं हैं'' यह निष्कर्ष 100% सत्य है (निष्कर्ष I सही)।","हालाँकि, कंप्यूटर का वह हिस्सा जो लैपटॉप नहीं है, वह मोबाइल हो भी सकता है और नहीं भी। इसलिए हम यह नहीं कह सकते कि ''कोई कंप्यूटर मोबाइल नहीं है'' (निष्कर्ष II गलत है)।"],"chainEn":["All laptops are inside computers.","No laptop can be a mobile (Laptop and Mobile are completely disjoint).","Since laptops are part of computers, that specific part of computers which is laptops can NEVER be mobiles.","Therefore, ''Some computers (which are laptops) are not mobiles'' is 100% true (Conclusion I follows).","However, the part of computers outside laptops could potentially intersect with mobiles. So we cannot definitively say ''No computer is a mobile'' (Conclusion II is false)."],"pattern":"E + A = O Reverse (Some Not) Syllogism.","elimination":"Universal negative (No computer is mobile) is too strong of an assumption. Only the ''Some not'' portion is mathematically guaranteed.","memoryTip":"If A is strictly separated from B, and A is inside C, then C contains a part (A) that is separated from B. Hence, ''Some C are not B''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('g3XtTX0eRGdyeSTK1p2_z', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'एक महिला की ओर इशारा करते हुए एक आदमी कहता है, ''इसके पति मेरी पिता की पत्नी के इकलौते बेटे हैं।'' वह महिला उस आदमी से किस प्रकार संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) बहन / Sister\",\"2) पत्नी / Wife\",\"3) माँ / Mother\",\"4) बेटी / Daughter\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 11, 'General', 'Pointing to a woman, a man says, ''Her husband is the only son of my father''s wife.'' How is the woman related to the man?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["आदमी कह रहा है: ''मेरे पिता की पत्नी'' -> इसका मतलब उसकी माँ।","''मेरी माँ का इकलौता बेटा'' -> एक आदमी के लिए उसकी माँ का इकलौता बेटा वह स्वयं (Man himself) होता है।","इसलिए, वाक्य का अर्थ है: ''इस महिला का पति मैं स्वयं हूँ''।","यदि वह आदमी उस महिला का पति है, तो वह महिला उस आदमी की पत्नी (Wife) है।"],"chainEn":["The man says: ''my father''s wife'' -> This means his mother.","''only son of my mother'' -> For a man, the only son of his mother is himself.","Therefore, the sentence translates to: ''Her husband is me''.","If the man is her husband, then the woman must be his wife."],"pattern":"Self-referencing dialogue Blood Relation.","elimination":"The ''only son'' identifies the speaker himself. The woman''s husband is the speaker. Therefore, she is the wife.","memoryTip":"Resolve relation chains backwards. Father''s wife = Mother. Mother''s only son = Myself. Her husband = Myself."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('BFh_yP7ddW8eV-bSCw26Q', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'एक व्यक्ति उत्तर की ओर मुँह करके खड़ा है। वह 45° दक्षिणावर्त (Clockwise) दिशा में मुड़ता है, और फिर 135° वामावर्त (Anti-clockwise) दिशा में मुड़ता है। अंत में, वह फिर से 90° दक्षिणावर्त मुड़ता है। अब वह किस दिशा की ओर मुँह किये हुए है?', '"[\"1) उत्तर / North\",\"2) पूर्व / East\",\"3) पश्चिम / West\",\"4) दक्षिण / South\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 12, 'General', 'A person is facing North. He turns 45° in the clockwise direction, then 135° in the anti-clockwise direction. Finally, he turns 90° clockwise again. Which direction is he facing now?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["प्रारंभिक दिशा: उत्तर (North)।","कुल दक्षिणावर्त (Clockwise) घुमाव: 45° + 90° = 135°","कुल वामावर्त (Anti-clockwise) घुमाव: 135°","नेट (Net) घुमाव: 135° (CW) - 135° (ACW) = 0°","चूँकि नेट घुमाव 0° है, व्यक्ति अपनी प्रारंभिक दिशा में ही रहेगा।","अतः वह अभी भी उत्तर (North) की ओर मुँह किये हुए है।"],"chainEn":["Initial direction: North.","Total Clockwise turn: 45° + 90° = 135°","Total Anti-clockwise turn: 135°","Net turn: 135° (CW) - 135° (ACW) = 0°","Since the net rotation is 0°, the person remains in their original direction.","Hence, he is still facing North."],"pattern":"Angular Net Zero Rotation.","elimination":"The sum of Clockwise turns equals the Anti-clockwise turns. They cancel each other out completely. No direction change happens.","memoryTip":"Group all clockwise angles and all anti-clockwise angles separately. Find the difference before making any turns on paper."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('HJ9y4WCEVYs4hiM3GBFig', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'त्यौहार के दौरान, एक धार्मिक जुलूस के मार्ग को लेकर दो समुदायों के बीच तनाव बढ़ जाता है और पथराव शुरू हो जाता है। आप मौके पर पहुंचने वाले पहले कांस्टेबल हैं। आपकी प्राथमिक कार्रवाई क्या होगी?', '"[\"1) स्थिति को नियंत्रित करने के लिए अकेले ही लाठीचार्ज शुरू कर देंगे / Start lathi-charge alone to control the situation\",\"2) अपनी जान बचाने के लिए मौके से भाग जाएंगे / Run away from the scene to save your life\",\"3) तुरंत नियंत्रण कक्ष (Control Room) को सूचित कर अतिरिक्त बल (बैकअप) मांगेंगे और सुरक्षित दूरी से भीड़ को तितर-बितर करने की कोशिश करेंगे / Immediately inform the Control Room asking for backup and try to disperse the crowd from a safe distance\",\"4) किसी एक समुदाय का पक्ष लेकर दूसरे पर हमला करेंगे / Take the side of one community and attack the other\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 13, 'General', 'During a festival, tension escalates between two communities over a religious procession route and stone-pelting begins. You are the first constable to arrive at the scene. What will be your primary action?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["दंगे या हिंसक भीड़ की स्थिति में, एक अकेला कांस्टेबल भीड़ को शारीरिक रूप से नियंत्रित नहीं कर सकता।","अकेले लाठीचार्ज करना आत्महत्या के समान है और स्थिति को और भड़का सकता है।","सबसे पहला और सबसे महत्वपूर्ण कदम उच्च अधिकारियों और नियंत्रण कक्ष को स्थिति की गंभीरता से अवगत कराना और बैकअप बुलाना है।","उसके बाद, बल प्रयोग किए बिना जितना संभव हो स्थिति को शांत करने (de-escalate) का प्रयास करना चाहिए।"],"chainEn":["In a riot or violent mob situation, a single constable cannot physically control the crowd.","Starting a lathi-charge alone is suicidal and will escalate the violence.","The first and most critical step is to alert higher authorities and the Control Room about the severity of the situation and call for backup.","Subsequently, one should try to de-escalate the situation as much as possible without using lethal force."],"pattern":"Mob Violence Protocol / SRT.","elimination":"Options 1, 2, and 4 are tactically disastrous, cowardly, and completely illegal, respectively. Option 3 is standard riot control procedure for a first responder.","memoryTip":"In massive crowd violence SRTs, a first responder''s primary weapon is communication (calling backup), not direct combat."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('lhMFib0IIk4fHW_IgQQkW', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'निम्नलिखित श्रृंखला में प्रश्न चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर कौन सा पद आएगा: C3, F6, I9, L12, ?', '"[\"1) O15 / O15\",\"2) P16 / P16\",\"3) M13 / M13\",\"4) N14 / N14\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 14, 'General', 'Which term will replace the question mark (?) in the following series: C3, F6, I9, L12, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["यह एक मिश्रित (अक्षर-संख्या) श्रृंखला है।","अक्षर श्रृंखला: C, F, I, L... (यहाँ +3 का अंतर है: C(3)->F(6)->I(9)->L(12)). अगला अक्षर L(12)+3 = O(15) होगा।","संख्या श्रृंखला: 3, 6, 9, 12... (यहाँ भी +3 का अंतर है)। अगली संख्या 12 + 3 = 15 होगी।","अक्षरों के साथ उनकी वास्तविक वर्णमाला स्थिति (Place value) जुड़ी हुई है।","अतः, सही पद O15 है।"],"chainEn":["This is an alphanumeric series.","Letter series: C, F, I, L... (+3 difference: C(3)->F(6)->I(9)->L(12)). Next letter is L(12)+3 = O(15).","Number series: 3, 6, 9, 12... (+3 difference here as well). Next number is 12 + 3 = 15.","The letters are simply paired with their actual alphabetical positional values.","Hence, the correct term is O15."],"pattern":"Alphanumeric Positional Series.","elimination":"The gap is strictly +3. After L comes M, N, O. And 12+3 is 15. Only O15 fits both.","memoryTip":"When you see letters combined with numbers, always check if the number is simply the alphabetical rank of that letter."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('tUmIEiInCNUU4K3tgCN5I', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'एक विशिष्ट कूट भाषा में, ''134'' का अर्थ ''good and tasty'' है, ''478'' का अर्थ ''see good pictures'' है, और ''729'' का अर्थ ''pictures are faint'' है। इस कूट भाषा में ''see'' के लिए कौन सा अंक प्रयुक्त हुआ है?', '"[\"1) 4 / 4\",\"2) 7 / 7\",\"3) 8 / 8\",\"4) 9 / 9\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 15, 'General', 'In a certain code language, ''134'' means ''good and tasty'', ''478'' means ''see good pictures'', and ''729'' means ''pictures are faint''. Which digit is used for ''see'' in this language?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["वाक्य 1 (''134'' = good and tasty) और वाक्य 2 (''478'' = see good pictures) की तुलना करें: दोनों में ''good'' और ''4'' उभयनिष्ठ (common) है। अतः good = 4.","वाक्य 2 (''478'' = see good pictures) और वाक्य 3 (''729'' = pictures are faint) की तुलना करें: दोनों में ''pictures'' और ''7'' उभयनिष्ठ है। अतः pictures = 7.","अब वाक्य 2 (''478'' = see good pictures) को देखें।","हमें good(4) और pictures(7) मिल गया है।","बचा हुआ शब्द ''see'' है और बचा हुआ अंक ''8'' है। अतः see = 8."],"chainEn":["Compare sentence 1 (''134'' = good and tasty) and sentence 2 (''478'' = see good pictures): ''good'' and ''4'' are common. Thus, good = 4.","Compare sentence 2 (''478'' = see good pictures) and sentence 3 (''729'' = pictures are faint): ''pictures'' and ''7'' are common. Thus, pictures = 7.","Now look at sentence 2 (''478'' = see good pictures).","We found good(4) and pictures(7).","The remaining word is ''see'' and the remaining digit is ''8''. Thus, see = 8."],"pattern":"Intersection of Artificial Code Words.","elimination":"Since 4 is ''good'' and 7 is ''pictures'', the only digit left for ''see'' in 478 is 8.","memoryTip":"Find the target word first (''see''). Then find which sentence contains it. Eliminate the other words in that sentence by finding them in other sentences."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('zMLNCINoDdxZC0ZV5rLtv', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'दी गई श्रृंखला में अगला पद ज्ञात कीजिए: 11, 13, 17, 19, 23, 29, ?', '"[\"1) 33 / 33\",\"2) 31 / 31\",\"3) 35 / 35\",\"4) 37 / 37\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 16, 'General', 'Find the next term in the given series: 11, 13, 17, 19, 23, 29, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["श्रृंखला को ध्यान से देखें: 11, 13, 17, 19, 23, 29।","ये सभी अभाज्य संख्याएँ (Prime Numbers) हैं।","इनके बीच कोई निश्चित गणितीय अंतर नहीं है (+2, +4, +2, +4, +6)। यह अंतर पैटर्न नहीं है।","29 के बाद अगली अभाज्य संख्या (वह संख्या जो केवल 1 और स्वयं से विभाजित होती है) 31 है।"],"chainEn":["Observe the series carefully: 11, 13, 17, 19, 23, 29.","These are all Prime Numbers.","There is no fixed mathematical difference between them (+2, +4, +2, +4, +6). It''s not a difference pattern.","The next prime number (a number divisible only by 1 and itself) after 29 is 31."],"pattern":"Consecutive Prime Numbers.","elimination":"33 is divisible by 3 and 11. 35 is divisible by 5 and 7. Only 31 and 37 are primes. 31 comes immediately after 29.","memoryTip":"Always memorize prime numbers up to 100. If a series looks random but has no even numbers and no multiples of 3/5, it''s a prime series."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('8IHwZJlW1zFdxBcYeuoQd', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'P, Q का पिता है। R, Q की बहन है। S, R की माता है। S, P से किस प्रकार संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) बहन / Sister\",\"2) पत्नी / Wife\",\"3) भाभी / Sister-in-law\",\"4) बेटी / Daughter\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 17, 'General', 'P is the father of Q. R is the sister of Q. S is the mother of R. How is S related to P?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["R और Q भाई-बहन हैं (चूँकि R, Q की बहन है)।","P, Q का पिता है, इसका मतलब P, R का भी पिता है।","S, R की माता है, इसका मतलब S, Q की भी माता है।","चूँकि P पिता है और S माता है (उन्हीं बच्चों की), तो P और S पति-पत्नी हैं।","अतः, S, P की पत्नी (Wife) है।"],"chainEn":["R and Q are siblings (since R is the sister of Q).","P is the father of Q, which means P is also the father of R.","S is the mother of R, which means S is also the mother of Q.","Since P is the father and S is the mother (of the same children), P and S are husband and wife.","Therefore, S is the wife of P."],"pattern":"Spousal deduction via common children.","elimination":"Since S is the mother of P''s children, S must be P''s wife.","memoryTip":"If A is the father of a child and B is the mother of the same child, A and B are a married couple."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('BoxaC1GPPtFM6xcchJbhM', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'एक सुबह, सूर्योदय के बाद, अमित और सुमित एक-दूसरे के आमने-सामने खड़े होकर बात कर रहे थे। यदि अमित की परछाई ठीक उसके दायीं ओर पड़ रही थी, तो सुमित का मुँह किस दिशा में था?', '"[\"1) उत्तर / North\",\"2) दक्षिण / South\",\"3) पूर्व / East\",\"4) पश्चिम / West\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 18, 'General', 'One morning after sunrise, Amit and Sumit were talking to each other face to face. If Amit''s shadow was falling exactly to his right, which direction was Sumit facing?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["सुबह के समय, सूर्य पूर्व (East) दिशा में होता है।","इसलिए, परछाई हमेशा पश्चिम (West) दिशा की ओर पड़ती है।","प्रश्न कहता है कि परछाई अमित के दायीं (Right) ओर पड़ रही है। इसका अर्थ है अमित का दायां हाथ पश्चिम दिशा में है।","यदि किसी व्यक्ति का दायां हाथ पश्चिम में है, तो वह दक्षिण (South) की ओर देख रहा होगा। (अमित दक्षिण की ओर देख रहा है)।","चूँकि दोनों आमने-सामने (face to face) खड़े हैं, सुमित अमित की विपरीत दिशा में देख रहा है।","अतः, सुमित उत्तर (North) की ओर देख रहा है।"],"chainEn":["In the morning, the sun is in the East.","Therefore, the shadow always falls towards the West.","The question says the shadow falls to Amit''s right. This means Amit''s right hand points to the West.","If a person''s right hand points West, they must be facing South. (Amit is facing South).","Since they are facing each other, Sumit is facing the exact opposite direction of Amit.","Thus, Sumit is facing North."],"pattern":"Morning Shadow Directionality.","elimination":"Morning shadow is West. Right=West means facing South. Amit faces South. Sumit faces the opposite, which is North.","memoryTip":"Morning rule: Shadow Left = Facing North. Shadow Right = Facing South. (Reverse this rule for evening)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('TwBqg66kObeDaZVLdt5Rh', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'एक ही पासे की तीन स्थितियाँ दी गई हैं।
स्थिति 1: फलक 1, 4, 6
स्थिति 2: फलक 3, 4, 6
स्थिति 3: फलक 3, 5, 6
फलक 4 के विपरीत कौन सी संख्या है?', '"[\"1) 1 / 1\",\"2) 2 / 2\",\"3) 5 / 5\",\"4) 3 / 3\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 19, 'General', 'Three positions of a single dice are given.
Position 1: Faces 1, 4, 6
Position 2: Faces 3, 4, 6
Position 3: Faces 3, 5, 6
Which number is opposite to face 4?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["नियम: यदि दो पासों में दो फलक समान हैं, तो शेष तीसरा फलक एक-दूसरे के विपरीत होता है।","स्थिति 1 (1, 4, 6) और स्थिति 2 (3, 4, 6) की तुलना करें: ''4 और 6'' उभयनिष्ठ (common) हैं। अतः 1 के विपरीत 3 है।","स्थिति 2 (3, 4, 6) और स्थिति 3 (3, 5, 6) की तुलना करें: ''3 और 6'' उभयनिष्ठ हैं। अतः 4 के विपरीत 5 है।","चूँकि हमें 4 के विपरीत संख्या ज्ञात करनी है, उत्तर 5 है।"],"chainEn":["Rule: If two faces are common in two dice positions, the remaining third faces are opposite to each other.","Compare Position 1 (1, 4, 6) and Position 2 (3, 4, 6): ''4 and 6'' are common. Thus, 1 is opposite 3.","Compare Position 2 (3, 4, 6) and Position 3 (3, 5, 6): ''3 and 6'' are common. Thus, 4 is opposite 5.","Since we need to find the number opposite to 4, the answer is 5."],"pattern":"Two-Common Face Dice Rule.","elimination":"By looking at positions 2 and 3, ''3'' and ''6'' remain constant while ''4'' changes to ''5''. This guarantees 4 and 5 are on opposite sides.","memoryTip":"When two dice images share exactly two numbers, the odd ones out are always perfectly opposite each other."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('MUkmHj6pLW8DvAMehb6hd', '_5-lhVySvooORBxtWLSYF', 'एक कागज को मोड़कर एक घनाकार पासा (Cube) बनाया जाता है। यदि खुले पासे में A, C के एकांतर (alternate) है, B, D के एकांतर है, और E, F के एकांतर है, तो निम्नलिखित में से कौन सा सत्य है?', '"[\"1) A और C एक साथ (adjacent) दिखाई दे सकते हैं / A and C can appear adjacent\",\"2) B और D विपरीत फलक (opposite faces) हैं / B and D are opposite faces\",\"3) E और F एक ही कोने (corner) पर मिल सकते हैं / E and F can meet at the same corner\",\"4) कोई भी फलक विपरीत नहीं है / No faces are opposite\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 20, 'General', 'A cubical dice is formed by folding a paper. If in the open dice A is alternate to C, B is alternate to D, and E is alternate to F, then which of the following is true?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["खुले पासे के नियम के अनुसार, एक सीधी रेखा में एकांतर फलक (एक छोड़कर एक) हमेशा एक-दूसरे के विपरीत (Opposite) होते हैं।","चूँकि B, D के एकांतर है, इसलिए B और D एक-दूसरे के विपरीत फलक होंगे।","विपरीत फलक कभी भी निकटवर्ती (adjacent) नहीं हो सकते और न ही वे कभी किसी कोने पर मिल सकते हैं।","इसलिए, विकल्प 1 (A और C निकटवर्ती) और विकल्प 3 (E और F कोने पर मिलना) गलत हैं।","केवल विकल्प 2 सही है क्योंकि B और D विपरीत हैं।"],"chainEn":["According to the open dice rule, alternate faces in a straight line are always opposite to each other.","Since B is alternate to D, B and D will be opposite faces.","Opposite faces can never be adjacent, nor can they ever share a corner.","Therefore, Option 1 (A and C adjacent) and Option 3 (E and F meeting at a corner) are false.","Only Option 2 is logically true because B and D are indeed opposite."],"pattern":"Open Dice Conceptual Rules.","elimination":"Alternate faces = Opposite faces. Opposite faces can never be adjacent. Option 2 directly states the rule.","memoryTip":"In an open 2D dice structure, blocks separated by one block in the middle form opposite sides of the folded 3D cube."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('SbBmcLArhV5LQXyIgrY5L', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'वर्तमान में मध्य प्रदेश में कुल कितने ''रामसर स्थल'' (Ramsar Sites) हैं?', '"[\"1) 3\",\"2) 4\",\"3) 5\",\"4) 6\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'Currently, how many ''Ramsar Sites'' are there in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मध्य प्रदेश में अब कुल 5 रामसर स्थल (आर्द्रभूमि) हैं।","ये 5 स्थल हैं: भोज वेटलैंड (भोपाल), साख्य सागर (शिवपुरी), सिरपुर तालाब (इंदौर), यशवंत सागर (इंदौर) और तवा जलाशय (नर्मदापुरम)।","तवा जलाशय (Tawa Reservoir) राज्य का पांचवां और सबसे नवीनतम रामसर स्थल है।"],"factsEn":["There are now a total of 5 Ramsar sites (wetlands) in Madhya Pradesh.","These 5 sites are: Bhoj Wetland (Bhopal), Sakhya Sagar (Shivpuri), Sirpur Lake (Indore), Yashwant Sagar (Indore), and Tawa Reservoir (Narmadapuram).","Tawa Reservoir is the fifth and newest Ramsar site of the state."],"mnemonics":["BST-YY (Bhoj, Sakhya, Tawa, Yashwant, Sirpur - 5 Sites)"],"related":["भोज वेटलैंड (Bhoj Wetland - First in MP, 2002)","रामसर सम्मेलन (Ramsar Convention - 1971)"],"memoryTip":"हाथ की 5 उंगलियों की तरह मध्य प्रदेश में अब 5 रामसर साइट्स हो गई हैं।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('jDcLFatsmSx1YW5AEZhAP', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश विधानसभा के प्रथम अध्यक्ष (Speaker) कौन थे?', '"[\"1) कुंजीलाल दुबे / Kunjilal Dubey\",\"2) तेजलाल टेंभरे / Tejlal Tembhre\",\"3) काशी प्रसाद पांडे / Kashi Prasad Pandey\",\"4) सीताशरण शर्मा / Sitasharan Sharma\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'Who was the first Speaker of the Madhya Pradesh Legislative Assembly?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["पंडित कुंजीलाल दुबे 1956 में नवगठित मध्य प्रदेश विधानसभा के प्रथम अध्यक्ष बने थे।","वे सबसे लंबे समय तक (लगभग 11 वर्ष) विधानसभा अध्यक्ष के पद पर रहे।","उन्हें मध्य प्रदेश का ''विधि पुरुष'' (Man of Law) भी कहा जाता है।"],"factsEn":["Pandit Kunjilal Dubey became the first Speaker of the newly formed MP Legislative Assembly in 1956.","He served as the Speaker of the Assembly for the longest time (about 11 years).","He is also known as the ''Vidhi Purush'' (Man of Law) of Madhya Pradesh."],"mnemonics":["Vidhan Sabha ki Kunji (Kunji - Key to Assembly)"],"related":["विधि पुरुष (Vidhi Purush)","प्रथम मुख्यमंत्री (First CM - Pt. Ravi Shankar Shukla)"],"memoryTip":"विधानसभा का ताला खोलने के लिए सबसे पहले ''कुंजी'' (Kunjilal) की जरूरत पड़ी।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Dfl3MWQbSZxusxxesKozP', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'भारतीय मानक समय रेखा (IST - 82.5° E) मध्य प्रदेश के किस एकमात्र जिले से होकर गुजरती है?', '"[\"1) रीवा / Rewa\",\"2) सीधी / Sidhi\",\"3) सिंगरौली / Singrauli\",\"4) अनूपपुर / Anuppur\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'The Indian Standard Time line (IST - 82.5° E) passes through which sole district of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["भारतीय मानक समय रेखा (82.5° पूर्वी देशांतर) मध्य प्रदेश के केवल सिंगरौली जिले से होकर गुजरती है।","सिंगरौली मध्य प्रदेश का सबसे पूर्वी जिला है।","इस कारण से मध्य प्रदेश के सबसे पूर्वी (सिंगरौली) और सबसे पश्चिमी (अलीराजपुर) जिलों के बीच लगभग 34 मिनट का समय अंतराल होता है।"],"factsEn":["The Indian Standard Time line (82.5° East Longitude) passes only through the Singrauli district of MP.","Singrauli is the easternmost district of Madhya Pradesh.","Due to this, there is a time difference of about 34 minutes between the easternmost (Singrauli) and westernmost (Alirajpur) districts."],"mnemonics":["Time starts from Singrauli in MP"],"related":["सबसे पूर्वी जिला (Easternmost District)","ऊर्जा राजधानी (Energy Capital - Singrauli)"],"memoryTip":"सूरज सबसे पहले पूरब में उगता है, और MP का पूरब सिंगरौली है जहाँ से ''समय'' (IST) मापा जाता है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('7sllxlIZpOzGGCh7Ir0bd', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'प्रसिद्ध ''बाघ प्रिंट'' (Bagh Print) जो एक पारंपरिक हथकरघा छपाई कला है, मध्य प्रदेश के किस जिले से संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) धार / Dhar\",\"2) झाबुआ / Jhabua\",\"3) उज्जैन / Ujjain\",\"4) खरगोन / Khargone\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'The famous ''Bagh Print'', which is a traditional handloom printing art, is associated with which district of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["बाघ प्रिंट (Bagh Print) धार जिले के बाघ नामक कस्बे की एक प्रसिद्ध लकड़ी के ठप्पे (Block print) से छपाई की कला है।","इसमें मुख्य रूप से प्राकृतिक रंगों (विशेषकर लाल और काले) का उपयोग किया जाता है।","इसे मध्य प्रदेश का भौगोलिक संकेत (GI Tag) भी प्राप्त है।"],"factsEn":["Bagh Print is a famous wooden block printing art from the town of Bagh in the Dhar district.","It mainly uses natural colors (especially red and black).","It has also received the Geographical Indication (GI Tag) of Madhya Pradesh."],"mnemonics":["Dhar ka Bagh (Bagh Caves and Bagh Print both in Dhar)"],"related":["जीआई टैग (GI Tag)","बाघ की गुफाएं (Bagh Caves - Also in Dhar)"],"memoryTip":"बाघ (Tiger) के प्रिंट (धारियां) ''धार'' जिले में मिलती हैं।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('X4DS4y6_hxZRriG6WEvQh', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश का सबसे बड़ा कोयला क्षेत्र (Coalfield) कौन सा है?', '"[\"1) सिंगरौली / Singrauli\",\"2) सुहागपुर / Sohagpur\",\"3) पेंच-कान्हन घाटी / Pench-Kanhan Valley\",\"4) उमरिया / Umaria\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'Which is the largest coalfield in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["सुहागपुर कोयला क्षेत्र (Sohagpur Coalfield) मध्य प्रदेश का सबसे बड़ा कोयला क्षेत्र है।","यह मुख्य रूप से शहडोल जिले में फैला हुआ है।","सिंगरौली कोयला क्षेत्र दूसरी सबसे बड़ी खदान है, लेकिन वहाँ कोयले की सबसे मोटी परत (Thickest seam) पाई जाती है।"],"factsEn":["Sohagpur Coalfield is the largest coalfield in Madhya Pradesh.","It is mainly spread across the Shahdol district.","Singrauli coalfield is the second largest, but it has the thickest coal seam."],"mnemonics":["Bada Suhag (Sohagpur is the Largest)"],"related":["शहडोल (Shahdol)","सिंगरौली (Singrauli - Thickest Seam)"],"memoryTip":"कोयला भले ही काला है, लेकिन मध्य प्रदेश के राजस्व के लिए यह ''सुहाग'' (सुहागपुर) की तरह है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('be3zKX677rr2OlJJ7UXUz', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश में प्रतिवर्ष ''लोकरंग महोत्सव'' (Lokrang Festival) कहाँ आयोजित किया जाता है?', '"[\"1) ग्वालियर / Gwalior\",\"2) खजुराहो / Khajuraho\",\"3) भोपाल / Bhopal\",\"4) उज्जैन / Ujjain\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'Where is the ''Lokrang Festival'' organized every year in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["लोकरंग महोत्सव प्रतिवर्ष गणतंत्र दिवस (26 जनवरी) के अवसर पर भोपाल में आयोजित किया जाता है।","यह 5 दिनों तक चलने वाला सांस्कृतिक उत्सव है जिसका आयोजन मध्य प्रदेश आदिवासी लोक कला अकादमी द्वारा किया जाता है।","इसमें भारत भर के लोक और जनजातीय नृत्यों का प्रदर्शन होता है।"],"factsEn":["Lokrang Festival is organized every year in Bhopal on the occasion of Republic Day (26th January).","It is a 5-day cultural festival organized by the MP Adivasi Lok Kala Academy.","It features folk and tribal dances from all over India."],"mnemonics":["Bhopal me Lok-Rang (People''s colors in Capital)"],"related":["आदिवासी लोक कला अकादमी (Tribal Folk Art Academy)","रवींद्र भवन (Ravindra Bhavan)"],"memoryTip":"राजधानी (भोपाल) में 26 जनवरी को सभी ''लोगों'' का ''रंग'' (लोकरंग) देखने को मिलता है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('g7kiO4vDXPeTMcTHnby7p', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'विश्व प्रसिद्ध ''सांची के स्तूप'' की खोज वर्ष 1818 में किसने की थी?', '"[\"1) अलेक्जेंडर कनिंघम / Alexander Cunningham\",\"2) जनरल टेलर / General Taylor\",\"3) जॉन मार्शल / John Marshall\",\"4) वी. एस. वाकणकर / V. S. Wakankar\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'Who discovered the world-famous ''Sanchi Stupa'' in the year 1818?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["सांची के स्तूप की खोज 1818 में ब्रिटिश अधिकारी जनरल टेलर (General Taylor) ने की थी।","बाद में सर जॉन मार्शल के निर्देशन में यहाँ एक पुरातात्विक संग्रहालय स्थापित किया गया।","सांची स्तूप का निर्माण मूलतः सम्राट अशोक ने करवाया था।"],"factsEn":["The Sanchi Stupa was discovered in 1818 by a British officer, General Taylor.","Later, an archaeological museum was established here under the direction of Sir John Marshall.","The Sanchi Stupa was originally built by Emperor Ashoka."],"mnemonics":["Sanchi ke kapde Taylor ne sile (Sanchi - General Taylor)"],"related":["जॉन मार्शल (John Marshall)","अशोक (Ashoka)"],"memoryTip":"अलेक्जेंडर कनिंघम ने भरहुत खोजा था, और ''टेलर'' ने सांची को।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('F_XejT_2RCfWMrIoW-9Hs', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश राज्य निर्वाचन आयोग (State Election Commission) के प्रथम आयुक्त (Commissioner) कौन थे?', '"[\"1) एन. बी. लोहानी / N. B. Lohani\",\"2) बसंत प्रताप सिंह / Basant Pratap Singh\",\"3) आर. परशुराम / R. Parasuram\",\"4) गोपाल भाार्गव / Gopal Bhargava\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'Who was the first Commissioner of the Madhya Pradesh State Election Commission?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मध्य प्रदेश राज्य निर्वाचन आयोग के प्रथम चुनाव आयुक्त एन. बी. लोहानी (N. B. Lohani) थे।","मध्य प्रदेश राज्य निर्वाचन आयोग का गठन 1 फरवरी 1994 को हुआ था।","मध्य प्रदेश 73वें संविधान संशोधन (पंचायती राज) को लागू करने और चुनाव कराने वाला देश का पहला राज्य था।"],"factsEn":["The first Election Commissioner of the MP State Election Commission was N. B. Lohani.","The MP State Election Commission was formed on February 1, 1994.","MP was the first state in the country to implement the 73rd Constitutional Amendment (Panchayati Raj) and hold elections."],"mnemonics":["Election me Loha lena padta hai (Lohani)"],"related":["अनुच्छेद 243K (Article 243K)","स्थापना 1994 (Established 1994)"],"memoryTip":"चुनाव कराना ''लोहे'' (Lohani) के चने चबाने जैसा है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ycr1eP64hhfSq9nds_-3_', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'कौन सी नदी मध्य प्रदेश की ''उत्तरी सीमा'' (Northern Boundary) का निर्धारण करती है?', '"[\"1) बेतवा / Betwa\",\"2) चंबल / Chambal\",\"3) ताप्ती / Tapti\",\"4) नर्मदा / Narmada\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'Which river determines the ''Northern Boundary'' of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["चंबल नदी मध्य प्रदेश की उत्तरी सीमा का निर्धारण करती है और मध्य प्रदेश व राजस्थान के बीच प्राकृतिक सीमा बनाती है।","इसका उद्गम इंदौर के महू (जानापाव पहाड़ी) से होता है।","ताप्ती नदी राज्य की दक्षिणी सीमा (महाराष्ट्र के साथ) का निर्धारण करती है।"],"factsEn":["The Chambal River determines the northern boundary of MP and forms a natural border between MP and Rajasthan.","It originates from Mhow (Janapav hill) in Indore.","The Tapti River determines the southern boundary (with Maharashtra) of the state."],"mnemonics":["North ka Bal - Chambal"],"related":["बीहड़ निर्माण (Ravine Formation)","ताप्ती नदी (Tapti - Southern Boundary)"],"memoryTip":"उत्तर में चंबल (डाकुओं का क्षेत्र) राज्य की रक्षा एक सीमा के रूप में करता था।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('U8SgQVo39ukbPmp08R_JK', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश सरकार द्वारा दिया जाने वाला ''एकलव्य पुरस्कार'' (Eklavya Award) किसे प्रदान किया जाता है?', '"[\"1) वरिष्ठ खिलाड़ियों को / To senior sportspersons\",\"2) खेल प्रशिक्षकों (कोच) को / To sports coaches\",\"3) 19 वर्ष से कम आयु के जूनियर खिलाड़ियों को / To junior sportspersons under 19 years of age\",\"4) जीवनपर्यंत खेल सेवा के लिए / For lifetime achievement in sports\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'To whom is the ''Eklavya Award'' given by the Madhya Pradesh Government?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["एकलव्य पुरस्कार मध्य प्रदेश सरकार द्वारा 19 वर्ष से कम आयु (Junior Category) के उत्कृष्ट खिलाड़ियों को दिया जाता है।","इसकी शुरुआत 1994 में की गई थी।","खेल प्रशिक्षकों (Coaches) को ''विश्वामित्र पुरस्कार'' और सीनियर खिलाड़ियों को ''विक्रम पुरस्कार'' दिया जाता है।"],"factsEn":["The Eklavya Award is given by the MP Government to outstanding players under 19 years of age (Junior Category).","It was instituted in 1994.","Sports coaches are given the ''Vishwamitra Award'' and senior players are given the ''Vikram Award''."],"mnemonics":["Eklavya = Student/Junior"],"related":["विक्रम पुरस्कार (Vikram Award - Seniors)","विश्वामित्र पुरस्कार (Vishwamitra Award - Coaches)"],"memoryTip":"महाभारत में ''एकलव्य'' एक युवा (Junior) शिष्य था, और ''विश्वामित्र'' गुरु (Coach) थे।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('SZCf-g-YhouIj5vg3NB5-', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'आधुनिक ''भोपाल रियासत'' (Bhopal State) का संस्थापक किसे माना जाता है?', '"[\"1) राजा भोज / Raja Bhoj\",\"2) दोस्त मोहम्मद खान / Dost Mohammad Khan\",\"3) यार मोहम्मद खान / Yar Mohammad Khan\",\"4) नवाब हमीदुल्लाह खान / Nawab Hamidullah Khan\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 11, 'General', 'Who is considered the founder of the modern ''Bhopal State''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["आधुनिक भोपाल रियासत की स्थापना एक अफगान सैनिक ''दोस्त मोहम्मद खान'' ने 1723-24 के आसपास की थी।","उसने जगदीशपुर नामक जगह पर कब्जा करके उसका नाम ''इस्लामनगर'' रखा था।","प्राचीन भोपाल (भोजपाल) की स्थापना परमार राजा भोज ने की थी।"],"factsEn":["The modern Bhopal state was founded by an Afghan soldier ''Dost Mohammad Khan'' around 1723-24.","He captured a place called Jagdishpur and renamed it ''Islamnagar''.","Ancient Bhopal (Bhojpal) was founded by the Parmara King Bhoj."],"mnemonics":["Bhopal ka Dost (Dost Mohammad Khan)"],"related":["नवाब हमीदुल्लाह (Nawab Hamidullah - Last Nawab)","इस्लामनगर (Islamnagar)"],"memoryTip":"भोपाल के नवाबों का शासन एक ''दोस्त'' (Dost Mohammad Khan) से शुरू हुआ था।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ry05dXSjMxw5egKszOcd4', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश की पहली महिला ''मुख्य सचिव'' (Chief Secretary) कौन थीं?', '"[\"1) सरला ग्रेवाल / Sarla Grewal\",\"2) उमा भारती / Uma Bharti\",\"3) निर्मला बुच / Nirmala Buch\",\"4) जमुना देवी / Jamuna Devi\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 12, 'General', 'Who was the first woman ''Chief Secretary'' of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["श्रीमती निर्मला बुच मध्य प्रदेश की पहली (और अब तक की एकमात्र) महिला मुख्य सचिव थीं।","उन्होंने 1991 से 1993 के बीच इस पद पर कार्य किया।","सरला ग्रेवाल मध्य प्रदेश की पहली महिला राज्यपाल थीं।"],"factsEn":["Smt. Nirmala Buch was the first (and so far the only) woman Chief Secretary of Madhya Pradesh.","She served in this position between 1991 and 1993.","Sarla Grewal was the first woman Governor of Madhya Pradesh."],"mnemonics":["Nirmal Sachiv (Nirmala - Chief Secretary)"],"related":["सरला ग्रेवाल (Sarla Grewal - First Woman Governor)","मुख्य सचिव (Chief Secretary)"],"memoryTip":"मुख्य सचिव का काम प्रशासन को ''निर्मल'' (स्वच्छ) रखना होता है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('yS5IsBY7qzi92rmKWBHpk', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'भारीया (Bhariya) जनजाति का प्रसिद्ध निवास स्थान ''पातालकोट'' (Patalkot) मध्य प्रदेश के किस जिले में स्थित है?', '"[\"1) डिंडोरी / Dindori\",\"2) छिंदवाड़ा / Chhindwara\",\"3) मंडला / Mandla\",\"4) बालाघाट / Balaghat\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 13, 'General', 'The famous residence of the Bhariya tribe ''Patalkot'' is located in which district of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["पातालकोट एक गहरी घाटी है जो मध्य प्रदेश के छिंदवाड़ा जिले (तामिया तहसील) में स्थित है।","यहाँ मुख्य रूप से ''भारिया'' (Bhariya) जनजाति निवास करती है, जो कई सदियों तक बाहरी दुनिया से कटी रही।","भारिया जनजाति को ''जंगलियों के भी जंगली'' (Wildest of the wild) कहा गया था।"],"factsEn":["Patalkot is a deep valley located in the Chhindwara district (Tamia tehsil) of MP.","The ''Bhariya'' tribe mainly resides here, which remained cut off from the outside world for centuries.","The Bhariya tribe was termed as the ''wildest of the wild''."],"mnemonics":["Patal me Chhed (Patalkot in Chhindwara)"],"related":["भारिया जनजाति (Bhariya Tribe)","तामिया (Tamia)"],"memoryTip":"जमीन में एक बड़ा ''छेद'' (छिंदवाड़ा) है जो पाताल (पातालकोट) तक जाता है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('03a9D4VQoTcTcUPKWXDn3', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश का प्रसिद्ध लोक पर्व ''गणगौर'' (Gangaur) मुख्य रूप से किस क्षेत्र में मनाया जाता है?', '"[\"1) बुंदेलखंड / Bundelkhand\",\"2) बघेलखंड / Baghelkhand\",\"3) निमाड़ / Nimar\",\"4) चंबल / Chambal\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 14, 'General', 'The famous folk festival of Madhya Pradesh ''Gangaur'' is mainly celebrated in which region?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["गणगौर (Gangaur) मुख्य रूप से निमाड़ क्षेत्र (खंडवा, खरगोन, बड़वानी) और मालवा के कुछ हिस्सों में मनाया जाने वाला प्रमुख त्योहार है।","यह पर्व भगवान शिव (रणुबाई / ईसर) और माता पार्वती (गौर) की आराधना का पर्व है।","इस दौरान विशेष रूप से गणगौर नृत्य किया जाता है।"],"factsEn":["Gangaur is a major festival celebrated mainly in the Nimar region (Khandwa, Khargone, Barwani) and parts of Malwa.","It is a festival of worshiping Lord Shiva (Isar) and Goddess Parvati (Gaur).","Gangaur dance is specifically performed during this time."],"mnemonics":["Nimar ki Gauri (Nimar - Gangaur)"],"related":["निमाड़ क्षेत्र (Nimar Region)","काठी नृत्य (Kathi Dance - Nimar)"],"memoryTip":"निमाड़ राजस्थान से सटा है, और गणगौर मूल रूप से राजस्थानी संस्कृति का बड़ा हिस्सा है जो निमाड़ में भी आया।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('gbF7YeoN6D_GDxvxanzWG', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश का पहला प्रस्तावित परमाणु ऊर्जा संयंत्र (Nuclear Power Plant) ''चुटका गांव'' (Chutka) किस जिले में है?', '"[\"1) मंडला / Mandla\",\"2) सिवनी / Seoni\",\"3) शिवपुरी / Shivpuri\",\"4) खंडवा / Khandwa\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 15, 'General', 'In which district is ''Chutka village'', the first proposed Nuclear Power Plant of Madhya Pradesh located?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मध्य प्रदेश का पहला परमाणु ऊर्जा संयंत्र (Nuclear Power Plant) मंडला जिले के ''चुटका'' (Chutka) गाँव में प्रस्तावित/निर्माणाधीन है।","यहाँ 700 मेगावाट की दो इकाइयां (कुल 1400 मेगावाट) स्थापित की जा रही हैं।","मध्य प्रदेश का दूसरा परमाणु संयंत्र शिवपुरी के ''भीमपुर'' में प्रस्तावित है।"],"factsEn":["MP''s first Nuclear Power Plant is proposed/under construction in ''Chutka'' village of Mandla district.","Two units of 700 MW (total 1400 MW) are being established here.","MP''s second nuclear plant is proposed at ''Bhimpur'' in Shivpuri."],"mnemonics":["Mandla ka Chutka (M-C)"],"related":["भीमपुर परमाणु संयंत्र (Bhimpur Nuclear Plant - Shivpuri)","बरगी बांध (Bargi Dam - Source of water)"],"memoryTip":"परमाणु ऊर्जा का ''चुटका'' (छोटा हिस्सा) बहुत सारी बिजली देता है। (चुटका - मंडला)"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('mwcXDKVwYjMmIGlXwFxig', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश का पहला ''सीमेंट कारखाना'' (Cement Factory) वर्ष 1922 में कहाँ स्थापित किया गया था?', '"[\"1) कटनी / Katni\",\"2) बानमोर (मुरैना) / Banmore (Morena)\",\"3) कैमूर (सतना) / Kymore (Satna)\",\"4) जावद (नीमच) / Jawad (Neemuch)\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 16, 'General', 'Where was the first ''Cement Factory'' of Madhya Pradesh established in the year 1922?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मध्य प्रदेश का प्रथम सीमेंट कारखाना 1922 में एसीसी (ACC) द्वारा मुरैना जिले के ''बानमोर'' (Banmore) में स्थापित किया गया था।","कैमूर (Kymore) सीमेंट फैक्ट्री 1923 में कटनी में स्थापित हुई थी।","बानमोर में कत्था बनाने का कारखाना भी स्थित है।"],"factsEn":["The first cement factory in MP was established in 1922 by ACC at ''Banmore'' in the Morena district.","Kymore cement factory was established in 1923 in Katni.","Banmore also has a catechu (kattha) manufacturing factory."],"mnemonics":["Ban-More Cement (First they Made-More cement)"],"related":["कैमूर (Kymore - 1923)","मुरैना जिला (Morena District)"],"memoryTip":"सबसे पहले सीमेंट से इमारत ''बनाई'' (बानमोर)।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('GdngR_PI16I3EvH-7_QEa', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'जनजातियों में प्रचलित ''घोटुल प्रथा'' (Ghotul Tradition) जो एक युवा गृह (Youth Dormitory) है, मुख्य रूप से किस जनजाति से संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) भील / Bhil\",\"2) सहरिया / Sahariya\",\"3) गोंड (मुरिया) / Gond (Muria)\",\"4) कोरकू / Korku\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 17, 'General', 'The ''Ghotul Tradition'' prevalent among tribes, which is a youth dormitory, is mainly associated with which tribe?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["घोटुल (Ghotul) एक पारंपरिक युवा गृह (Youth Dormitory) है जो मुख्य रूप से गोंड और उसकी उपजाति ''मुरिया'' (Muria) में पाया जाता है।","यहाँ गाँव के अविवाहित युवक और युवतियां शाम को इकट्ठा होते हैं और अपनी संस्कृति, नृत्य और जीवनसाथी चुनने की परंपरा सीखते हैं।","इस प्रथा पर वेरियर एल्विन ने ''द मुरिया एंड देयर घोटुल'' नामक प्रसिद्ध पुस्तक लिखी है।"],"factsEn":["Ghotul is a traditional youth dormitory found mainly in the Gond and its sub-tribe ''Muria''.","Unmarried youths of the village gather here in the evening to learn their culture, dance, and the tradition of choosing a life partner.","Verrier Elwin wrote the famous book ''The Muria and Their Ghotul'' on this practice."],"mnemonics":["Muria ka Ghotul (M-G)"],"related":["वेरियर एल्विन (Verrier Elwin)","मुड़िया जनजाति (Muria Tribe)"],"memoryTip":"गोंड (Gond) जनजाति घोटुल (Ghotul) में जाकर अपनी संस्कृति सीखती है (G-G)।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('yQ-t-D_roLZXwO86e6XsZ', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश सरकार की प्रसिद्ध ''भावांतर भुगतान योजना'' (Bhavantar Bhugtan Yojana) का संबंध किस क्षेत्र से है?', '"[\"1) उद्योग (MSME) / Industry (MSME)\",\"2) शिक्षा छात्रवृत्ति / Education Scholarship\",\"3) कृषि (किसानों की उपज) / Agriculture (Farmers'' Produce)\",\"4) स्वास्थ्य बीमा / Health Insurance\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 18, 'General', 'The famous ''Bhavantar Bhugtan Yojana'' of the Madhya Pradesh government is related to which sector?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["भावांतर भुगतान योजना का संबंध कृषि क्षेत्र (Agriculture) से है।","यह योजना 2017 में मध्य प्रदेश में शुरू की गई थी।","इसके तहत, यदि बाज़ार में फसल का मूल्य सरकार द्वारा तय न्यूनतम समर्थन मूल्य (MSP) से कम है, तो सरकार किसानों को उस मूल्य अंतर (Price Deficit) का भुगतान सीधे उनके खाते में करती है।"],"factsEn":["The Bhavantar Bhugtan Yojana is related to the agriculture sector.","This scheme was launched in MP in 2017.","Under this, if the market price of the crop is lower than the MSP decided by the govt, the govt pays that price deficit directly into the farmers'' accounts."],"mnemonics":["Bhav + Antar (Price + Difference for Farmers)"],"related":["न्यूनतम समर्थन मूल्य (MSP)","खरीफ फसल (Kharif Crops)"],"memoryTip":"किसानों को उनकी फसल का सही ''भाव'' (Price) दिलाने के लिए यह योजना लाई गई थी।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('3zc11WkdJwEN0zkULai2v', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'प्रतिवर्ष आयोजित होने वाला भारत का सबसे बड़ा शास्त्रीय नृत्य समारोह ''खजुराहो नृत्य समारोह'' (Khajuraho Dance Festival) किस वर्ष शुरू हुआ था?', '"[\"1) 1956\",\"2) 1976\",\"3) 1984\",\"4) 1990\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 19, 'General', 'In which year did India''s largest classical dance festival ''Khajuraho Dance Festival'', organized annually, begin?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["खजुराहो नृत्य समारोह की शुरुआत वर्ष 1976 में की गई थी।","यह प्रतिवर्ष फरवरी-मार्च के महीने में मध्य प्रदेश के छतरपुर जिले (खजुराहो) में आयोजित किया जाता है।","यह समारोह मध्य प्रदेश कला परिषद द्वारा आयोजित होता है और इसमें कथक, भरतनाट्यम, ओडिसी आदि शास्त्रीय नृत्यों की प्रस्तुति होती है।"],"factsEn":["The Khajuraho Dance Festival was started in the year 1976.","It is organized annually in the month of Feb-March in the Chhatarpur district (Khajuraho) of MP.","This festival is organized by the MP Kala Parishad and features classical dances like Kathak, Bharatanatyam, Odissi, etc."],"mnemonics":["76 ka Dance (1976 Khajuraho)"],"related":["कंदारिया महादेव मंदिर (Kandariya Mahadeva Temple)","छतरपुर जिला (Chhatarpur District)"],"memoryTip":"खजुराहो के मंदिर जितने पुराने हैं, उनका नृत्य समारोह उतना ही ''76'' (छियत्तर) है (मजेदार तुकबंदी)।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('W8ypxraigXzpxm1YZHD-Y', '-UfGokS9b-2hFyVxMxuvk', 'मध्य प्रदेश की दूसरी सबसे महत्वपूर्ण नदी ''सोन नदी'' (Son River) का उद्गम कहाँ से होता है?', '"[\"1) पचमढ़ी (होशंगाबाद) / Pachmarhi (Hoshangabad)\",\"2) अमरकंटक (अनूपपुर) / Amarkantak (Anuppur)\",\"3) मुलताई (बैतूल) / Multai (Betul)\",\"4) जानापाव (इंदौर) / Janapav (Indore)\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 20, 'General', 'Where does Madhya Pradesh''s second most important river, ''Son River'', originate?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["सोन नदी का उद्गम भी नर्मदा नदी की तरह अनूपपुर जिले के ''अमरकंटक'' से ही होता है।","यह उत्तर की ओर बहती हुई बिहार में पटना के पास गंगा नदी में मिल जाती है।","प्रसिद्ध ''बाणसागर बांध'' (Bansagar Dam) इसी नदी पर स्थित है।"],"factsEn":["Like the Narmada River, the Son River also originates from ''Amarkantak'' in the Anuppur district.","It flows northwards and joins the Ganges river near Patna in Bihar.","The famous ''Bansagar Dam'' is situated on this river."],"mnemonics":["Amarkantak ke Do Anmol Ratan - Narmada & Son"],"related":["बाणसागर बांध (Bansagar Dam)","गंगा की सहायक (Tributary of Ganga)"],"memoryTip":"अमरकंटक की चोटी से एक तरफ से नर्मदा (पश्चिम) और दूसरी तरफ से सोन (उत्तर) निकलती है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ZF28RtOBmx3Ko0IHyfJ0_', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', '15 आदमी 8 घंटे प्रतिदिन काम करके एक काम को 20 दिनों में पूरा कर सकते हैं। 20 आदमी 10 घंटे प्रतिदिन काम करके उसी काम को कितने दिनों में पूरा करेंगे?', '"[\"1) 10 दिन / 10 Days\",\"2) 12 दिन / 12 Days\",\"3) 14 दिन / 14 Days\",\"4) 15 दिन / 15 Days\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', '15 men working 8 hours a day can complete a work in 20 days. In how many days will 20 men working 10 hours a day complete the same work?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["M1 × D1 × H1 = M2 × D2 × H2 सूत्र का उपयोग करें।","M1 = 15, D1 = 20, H1 = 8","M2 = 20, H2 = 10, D2 = ?","15 × 20 × 8 = 20 × D2 × 10","D2 = (15 × 20 × 8) / (20 × 10)","20 से 20 कट गया। D2 = 120 / 10 = 12 दिन।"],"stepsEn":["Use the formula: M1 × D1 × H1 = M2 × D2 × H2.","M1 = 15, D1 = 20, H1 = 8","M2 = 20, H2 = 10, D2 = ?","15 × 20 × 8 = 20 × D2 × 10","D2 = (15 × 20 × 8) / (20 × 10)","20 gets cancelled. D2 = 120 / 10 = 12 days."],"shortcut":"(15 × 20 × 8) / (20 × 10) = 12 सीधा उत्तर।","trap":"छात्र M1D1 = M2D2 याद रखते हैं और घंटों (Hours) को अनदेखा कर सकते हैं। / Students might remember M1D1=M2D2 and ignore the Hours.","memoryTip":"असली मसाला (MDH) सूत्र याद रखें: (M1 × D1 × H1) / W1 = (M2 × D2 × H2) / W2 / Remember the MDH spices formula: MDH/W."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('0z6oYHnV_RsvbPoQVZZJj', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', '33 मीटर कपड़ा बेचने पर, एक व्यक्ति को 11 मीटर कपड़े के विक्रय मूल्य के बराबर लाभ होता है। उसका लाभ प्रतिशत क्या है?', '"[\"1) 25%\",\"2) 33.33%\",\"3) 40%\",\"4) 50%\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'By selling 33 meters of cloth, a person gains the selling price of 11 meters of cloth. What is his profit percentage?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["लाभ का सूत्र = विक्रय मूल्य (SP) - क्रय मूल्य (CP)","प्रश्न के अनुसार: लाभ = 11 SP","11 SP = 33 SP - 33 CP","पक्षांतरण करने पर: 33 CP = 33 SP - 11 SP","33 CP = 22 SP => SP / CP = 33 / 22 = 3 / 2","यहाँ CP = 2 और SP = 3 है। लाभ = 1।","लाभ प्रतिशत = (1 / 2) × 100 = 50%"],"stepsEn":["Profit Formula = Selling Price (SP) - Cost Price (CP)","As per question: Profit = 11 SP","11 SP = 33 SP - 33 CP","Transposing: 33 CP = 33 SP - 11 SP","33 CP = 22 SP => SP / CP = 33 / 22 = 3 / 2","Here CP = 2 and SP = 3. Profit = 1.","Profit percentage = (1 / 2) × 100 = 50%"],"shortcut":"यदि लाभ SP के बराबर है: लाभ % = (लाभ की मात्रा) / (बेची गई मात्रा - लाभ की मात्रा) × 100 = 11 / (33 - 11) = 11/22 = 50%。","trap":"छात्र 11/33 × 100 = 33.33% कर सकते हैं, जो तब होता है जब लाभ CP के बराबर हो। / Students might do 11/33 × 100 = 33.33%, which applies when profit is equal to CP.","memoryTip":"SP के बराबर लाभ हो तो (N - P) करें, CP के बराबर लाभ हो तो सीधा (P / N) करें। / Profit equal to SP -> use (N-P). Profit equal to CP -> use (P/N)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('u2EUp5R08qV0HFj1zmeuZ', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'कोई धनराशि साधारण ब्याज पर 5 वर्षों में स्वयं की दोगुनी हो जाती है। समान दर पर वह कितने वर्षों में स्वयं की 5 गुनी हो जाएगी?', '"[\"1) 15 वर्ष / 15 Years\",\"2) 20 वर्ष / 20 Years\",\"3) 25 वर्ष / 25 Years\",\"4) 30 वर्ष / 30 Years\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'A sum of money doubles itself in 5 years at simple interest. In how many years will it become 5 times itself at the same rate?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["पहला मामला: राशि दोगुनी (2P) होती है, तो साधारण ब्याज (SI) = P। समय = 5 वर्ष।","SI = PRT/100 => P = (P × R × 5) / 100 => R = 20%","दूसरा मामला: राशि 5 गुनी (5P) होनी चाहिए, तो नया SI = 4P।","4P = (P × 20 × T) / 100","4 = T / 5 => T = 20 वर्ष"],"stepsEn":["Case 1: Amount doubles (2P), so Simple Interest (SI) = P. Time = 5 years.","SI = PRT/100 => P = (P × R × 5) / 100 => R = 20%","Case 2: Amount should become 5 times (5P), so new SI = 4P.","4P = (P × 20 × T) / 100","4 = T / 5 => T = 20 years"],"shortcut":"T1 / (n1 - 1) = T2 / (n2 - 1) => 5 / (2 - 1) = T2 / (5 - 1) => 5/1 = T2/4 => T2 = 20 वर्ष।","trap":"छात्र सोच सकते हैं कि 2 गुनी होने में 5 साल, तो 5 गुनी होने में 2.5 × 5 = 12.5 साल लगेंगे। / Students might use direct proportion: double in 5, so 5 times in 2.5×5 = 12.5 yrs.","memoryTip":"ब्याज हमेशा ''n - 1'' होता है। वर्षों की तुलना हमेशा (n - 1) से करें। / Interest is always ''n - 1''. Always compare years with (n - 1)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('qStplHVqGWp6r45Sgcgyk', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'किसी निश्चित धनराशि पर 2 वर्ष का साधारण ब्याज ₹400 और चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज ₹410 है। ब्याज की वार्षिक दर क्या है?', '"[\"1) 4%\",\"2) 5%\",\"3) 8%\",\"4) 10%\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'The simple interest on a certain sum for 2 years is ₹400 and the compound interest is ₹410. What is the annual rate of interest?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["2 वर्ष का साधारण ब्याज (SI) = ₹400","1 वर्ष का साधारण ब्याज = 400 / 2 = ₹200","चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज (CI) और साधारण ब्याज (SI) का अंतर = 410 - 400 = ₹10","यह ₹10 का अंतर पहले वर्ष के ब्याज (₹200) पर मिलने वाला ब्याज है।","दर (R) = (ब्याज का अंतर / 1 वर्ष का SI) × 100","R = (10 / 200) × 100 = 5%"],"stepsEn":["Simple Interest (SI) for 2 years = ₹400","Simple Interest for 1 year = 400 / 2 = ₹200","Difference between CI and SI = 410 - 400 = ₹10","This difference of ₹10 is the interest earned on the 1st year''s interest (₹200).","Rate (R) = (Difference in interest / SI of 1 year) × 100","R = (10 / 200) × 100 = 5%"],"shortcut":"दर = [ 2 × (CI - SI) / SI ] × 100 = (2 × 10 / 400) × 100 = 20 / 4 = 5%。","trap":"छात्र दर निकालने के लिए 400 या 410 को मूलधन (Principal) मान सकते हैं। / Students might take 400 or 410 as Principal to find the rate.","memoryTip":"2 वर्षों के लिए: दर (Rate) = दूसरे वर्ष का अतिरिक्त ब्याज / पहले वर्ष का ब्याज। / For 2 years: Rate = Extra interest of 2nd year / 1st year''s interest."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('V_lU7Zj14Cn8EOJ0lO5yC', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'यदि 5 अंकों की संख्या 247x8, 8 से पूर्णतः विभाज्य है, तो ''x'' का न्यूनतम मान क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 0\",\"2) 1\",\"3) 2\",\"4) 4\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'If the 5-digit number 247x8 is completely divisible by 8, what will be the minimum value of ''x''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["8 की विभाज्यता का नियम: संख्या के अंतिम 3 अंक 8 से विभाज्य होने चाहिए।","अंतिम 3 अंक 7x8 हैं।","x के न्यूनतम मान (0 से) रखकर जांचें:","यदि x = 0: 708 / 8 = 88.5 (विभाज्य नहीं)","यदि x = 1: 718 / 8 = 89.75 (विभाज्य नहीं)","यदि x = 2: 728 / 8 = 91 (पूर्णतः विभाज्य है)","अतः x का न्यूनतम मान 2 होगा।"],"stepsEn":["Divisibility rule of 8: The last 3 digits of the number must be divisible by 8.","Last 3 digits are 7x8.","Check by putting minimum values of x (from 0):","If x = 0: 708 / 8 = 88.5 (Not divisible)","If x = 1: 718 / 8 = 89.75 (Not divisible)","If x = 2: 728 / 8 = 91 (Completely divisible)","Hence, the minimum value of x is 2."],"shortcut":"700/8 करने पर शेष 4 आता है। 40 की लाइन में 8 का गुणज 48 है। इसलिए 728 होगा। x=2।","trap":"छात्र अंकों का योग (Rule of 3 and 9) लगा सकते हैं। / Students might apply the sum of digits rule (applicable for 3 and 9).","memoryTip":"2 के लिए अंतिम 1 अंक, 4 के लिए अंतिम 2 अंक, और 8 के लिए अंतिम 3 अंक चेक करें। / Check last 1 digit for 2, last 2 for 4, and last 3 for 8."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('6o6mc1Jfc0b3UR0tZBBad', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', '10 व्यक्तियों के समूह में से 60 किग्रा वजन वाले एक व्यक्ति के स्थान पर नए व्यक्ति के आने से समूह के औसत वजन में 2 किग्रा की वृद्धि हो जाती है। नए व्यक्ति का वजन क्या है?', '"[\"1) 70 किग्रा / 70 kg\",\"2) 75 किग्रा / 75 kg\",\"3) 80 किग्रा / 80 kg\",\"4) 85 किग्रा / 85 kg\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'In a group of 10 persons, when a person weighing 60 kg is replaced by a new person, the average weight of the group increases by 2 kg. What is the weight of the new person?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["औसत में 2 किग्रा की वृद्धि हुई है।","कुल वृद्धि = कुल व्यक्ति × औसत में वृद्धि","कुल वृद्धि = 10 × 2 = 20 किग्रा","चूंकि औसत बढ़ा है, नए व्यक्ति का वजन जाने वाले व्यक्ति से 20 किग्रा अधिक होना चाहिए।","नए व्यक्ति का वजन = जाने वाले का वजन + कुल वृद्धि","नए व्यक्ति का वजन = 60 + 20 = 80 किग्रा।"],"stepsEn":["The average has increased by 2 kg.","Total increase = Total persons × Increase in average","Total increase = 10 × 2 = 20 kg","Since average increased, the new person must weigh 20 kg more than the person who left.","Weight of new person = Weight of replaced person + Total increase","Weight of new person = 60 + 20 = 80 kg."],"shortcut":"नया = पुराना ± (कुल संख्या × औसत अंतर) = 60 + (10 × 2) = 80।","trap":"छात्र 60 में सिर्फ 2 जोड़कर 62 उत्तर सोच सकते हैं। / Students might just add 2 to 60 and think 62 is the answer.","memoryTip":"प्रतिस्थापन (Replacement) में: नया वजन = पुराना वजन + (कुल सदस्य × औसत वृद्धि)। / In replacement: New = Old + (Total Members × Avg Increase)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('cri3INJE7qQhuznHdacK9', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', '120 मीटर और 180 मीटर लंबी दो ट्रेनें क्रमशः 50 किमी/घंटा और 32 किमी/घंटा की गति से एक ही दिशा (Same direction) में चल रही हैं। तेज ट्रेन धीमी ट्रेन को कितने समय में पार करेगी?', '"[\"1) 30 सेकंड / 30 Seconds\",\"2) 45 सेकंड / 45 Seconds\",\"3) 60 सेकंड / 60 Seconds\",\"4) 75 सेकंड / 75 Seconds\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'Two trains 120m and 180m long are running in the same direction at 50 km/hr and 32 km/hr respectively. In what time will the faster train cross the slower train?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["पार करते समय कुल दूरी = दोनों ट्रेनों की लंबाई का योग = 120 + 180 = 300 मीटर।","एक ही दिशा में सापेक्ष गति (Relative Speed) = दोनों गतियों का अंतर = 50 - 32 = 18 किमी/घंटा।","गति को मीटर/सेकंड में बदलें: 18 × (5/18) = 5 मीटर/सेकंड।","समय = दूरी / गति = 300 / 5 = 60 सेकंड।"],"stepsEn":["Total distance while crossing = Sum of lengths of both trains = 120 + 180 = 300 m.","Relative speed in the same direction = Difference of speeds = 50 - 32 = 18 km/hr.","Convert speed to m/s: 18 × (5/18) = 5 m/s.","Time = Distance / Speed = 300 / 5 = 60 seconds."],"shortcut":"समय = (120+180) / ((50-32)×5/18) = 300 / 5 = 60 सेकंड।","trap":"छात्र समान दिशा होने पर भी गतियों को जोड़ (50+32=82) सकते हैं। / Students might add the speeds (50+32=82) despite the same direction.","memoryTip":"समान दिशा (Same Direction) = गति घटेगी (-)। विपरीत दिशा (Opposite) = गति जुड़ेगी (+)। / Same Direction = Speeds subtract (-). Opposite Direction = Speeds add (+)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('8W0sTu-vrq8bw2lUmaKKE', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'एक थैले में ₹1, 50 पैसे और 25 पैसे के सिक्कों के मूल्यों (Values) का अनुपात 4:5:6 है। यदि कुल सिक्कों की संख्या 760 है, तो 50 पैसे के सिक्कों की संख्या क्या होगी?', '"[\"1) 100\",\"2) 150\",\"3) 200\",\"4) 250\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'A bag contains coins of ₹1, 50 paise and 25 paise, the ratio of their values is 4:5:6. If the total number of coins is 760, what will be the number of 50 paise coins?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["यहाँ मूल्यों (Values) का अनुपात दिया गया है: 4 : 5 : 6","सिक्कों की संख्या का अनुपात निकालने के लिए:","₹1 में ₹1 का 1 सिक्का होता है = 4 × 1 = 4","₹1 में 50 पैसे के 2 सिक्के होते हैं = 5 × 2 = 10","₹1 में 25 पैसे के 4 सिक्के होते हैं = 6 × 4 = 24","सिक्कों का नया अनुपात = 4x : 10x : 24x","कुल सिक्के = 4x + 10x + 24x = 38x","दिया है: 38x = 760 => x = 20","50 पैसे के सिक्के = 10x = 10 × 20 = 200"],"stepsEn":["Here the ratio of Values is given: 4 : 5 : 6","To find the ratio of Number of Coins:","₹1 has 1 coin of ₹1 = 4 × 1 = 4","₹1 has 2 coins of 50p = 5 × 2 = 10","₹1 has 4 coins of 25p = 6 × 4 = 24","New ratio of coins = 4x : 10x : 24x","Total coins = 4x + 10x + 24x = 38x","Given: 38x = 760 => x = 20","Number of 50p coins = 10x = 10 × 20 = 200"],"shortcut":"सिक्कों का अनुपात = 4:10:24। योग = 38। 38 = 760 (1 = 20)। 50 पैसे के सिक्के 10 × 20 = 200।","trap":"छात्र 4:5:6 को ही सिक्कों की संख्या का अनुपात मानकर 15=760 कर सकते हैं। / Students might take 4:5:6 as the ratio of coins and equate 15=760.","memoryTip":"यदि ''मूल्य'' का अनुपात दिया हो, तो सिक्कों की संख्या निकालने के लिए गुणा करें (×2, ×4)। यदि ''सिक्कों'' का अनुपात दिया हो, तो भाग करें (/2, /4)। / Value ratio given -> Multiply to get coins. Coins ratio given -> Divide to get value."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('zbmK_gCaitYNvxZrLR-At', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'एक बर्तन में दूध और पानी का अनुपात 7:3 है। मिश्रण का कितना भाग निकालकर उतना ही पानी मिला दिया जाए कि मिश्रण में दूध और पानी का अनुपात 1:1 हो जाए?', '"[\"1) 1/5\",\"2) 2/7\",\"3) 1/7\",\"4) 1/4\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'In a vessel, the ratio of milk and water is 7:3. What part of the mixture should be taken out and replaced with water so that the ratio of milk and water becomes 1:1?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["प्रारंभिक दूध = 7 और पानी = 3 (कुल 10)","अंतिम अनुपात 1:1 है, जिसका अर्थ है दूध 5 और पानी 5 होना चाहिए।","दूध की मात्रा 7 से घटकर 5 हो रही है। (अर्थात 2 इकाई दूध निकाला गया)","कुल मिश्रण में दूध का अंश 7 था। अतः निकाला गया भाग = 2 / 7।"],"stepsEn":["Initial milk = 7 and water = 3 (Total 10)","Final ratio is 1:1, which means milk should be 5 and water 5.","Milk quantity drops from 7 to 5. (Meaning 2 units of milk is removed)","Total share of milk in mixture was 7. Hence, part replaced = 2 / 7."],"shortcut":"सूत्र: निकाले गए भाग = (अनुपातों का अंतर) / (2 × बड़ा अनुपात) = (7 - 3) / (2 × 7) = 4 / 14 = 2/7।","trap":"छात्र पानी को 3 से 5 होते देख 2/10 (यानी 1/5) उत्तर दे सकते हैं। / Students might see water increase from 3 to 5 and answer 2/10 (1/5).","memoryTip":"1:1 अनुपात बनाने के लिए हमेशा (Difference) / (2 × Max Part) ट्रिक का उपयोग करें। / To make 1:1 ratio, always use (Difference) / (2 × Max Part) trick."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('bpSfXeUHcq4UO2TbF5oQL', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'एक क्रिकेट खिलाड़ी का 15 पारियों का कुछ औसत है। 16वीं पारी में वह शून्य (0) पर आउट हो जाता है, जिससे उसका औसत 3 रन कम हो जाता है। उसका नया औसत क्या है?', '"[\"1) 42\",\"2) 45\",\"3) 48\",\"4) 51\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'A cricket player has a certain average for 15 innings. In the 16th inning, he gets out on zero (0), which decreases his average by 3 runs. What is his new average?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मान लें कि 15 पारियों का औसत ''x'' है।","15 पारियों के कुल रन = 15x","16वीं पारी का स्कोर 0 है। तो 16 पारियों के कुल रन = 15x + 0 = 15x","16 पारियों के बाद नया औसत = x - 3","समीकरण: 15x = 16(x - 3)","15x = 16x - 48","x = 48 (यह पुराना औसत है)।","नया औसत = x - 3 = 48 - 3 = 45।"],"stepsEn":["Let the average for 15 innings be ''x''.","Total runs in 15 innings = 15x","16th inning score is 0. So total runs in 16 innings = 15x + 0 = 15x","New average after 16 innings = x - 3","Equation: 15x = 16(x - 3)","15x = 16x - 48","x = 48 (This is old average).","New average = x - 3 = 48 - 3 = 45."],"shortcut":"नया औसत = स्कोर + (पुरानी पारियां × कमी) = 0 + (15 × 3) = 45। (ध्यान दें: यदि औसत बढ़ता है तो घटाते हैं, कम होता है तो जोड़ते हैं)।","trap":"छात्र 48 निकाल कर उसी को नया औसत मान सकते हैं। / Students might find 48 and assume it is the new average.","memoryTip":"शॉर्टकट में हमेशा ''पुरानी'' पारियों (15) से गुणा करें। / Always multiply by ''old'' innings (15) in the shortcut."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('mu_kNtgwRTVzw4JOM_VCB', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'एक तार को एक वर्ग के रूप में मोड़ा जाता है जिसका क्षेत्रफल 121 वर्ग सेमी है। यदि उसी तार को एक वृत्त (Circle) के रूप में मोड़ा जाए, तो वृत्त का क्षेत्रफल क्या होगा? (π = 22/7)', '"[\"1) 132 cm²\",\"2) 144 cm²\",\"3) 154 cm²\",\"4) 168 cm²\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 11, 'General', 'A wire is bent in the form of a square of area 121 sq cm. If the same wire is bent in the form of a circle, what will be the area of the circle? (π = 22/7)', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["वर्ग का क्षेत्रफल = भुजा² = 121","वर्ग की भुजा = √121 = 11 सेमी","तार की कुल लंबाई = वर्ग का परिमाप = 4 × 11 = 44 सेमी","जब इसे वृत्त में मोड़ा जाता है, तो वृत्त की परिधि = 44 सेमी होगी।","2πr = 44 => 2 × (22/7) × r = 44 => 44/7 × r = 44 => r = 7 सेमी","वृत्त का क्षेत्रफल = πr² = (22/7) × 7 × 7 = 154 सेमी²"],"stepsEn":["Area of square = Side² = 121","Side of square = √121 = 11 cm","Total length of wire = Perimeter of square = 4 × 11 = 44 cm","When bent into a circle, Circumference of circle = 44 cm.","2πr = 44 => 2 × (22/7) × r = 44 => 44/7 × r = 44 => r = 7 cm","Area of circle = πr² = (22/7) × 7 × 7 = 154 cm²"],"shortcut":"जब समान परिमाप होता है, तो वृत्त का क्षेत्रफल वर्ग से अधिक होता है। परिधि 44 का मतलब r=7, और r=7 पर क्षेत्रफल 154 होता है।","trap":"छात्र तार की लंबाई को ही क्षेत्रफल समझ सकते हैं। / Students might confuse the wire length with the area.","memoryTip":"2D आकृतियों को मोड़ने पर उनका ''परिमाप'' (Perimeter) समान रहता है, न कि क्षेत्रफल। / When bending 2D shapes, their ''Perimeter'' remains constant, not Area."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('amxFPO4pf-Pws9dS_qeVS', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'एक बेलन (Cylinder) और एक शंकु (Cone) की आधार त्रिज्या और ऊंचाई समान है। बेलन और शंकु के आयतन का अनुपात क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 1:3\",\"2) 2:1\",\"3) 3:1\",\"4) 1:2\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 12, 'General', 'A cylinder and a cone have the same base radius and height. What will be the ratio of the volume of the cylinder to that of the cone?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["बेलन का आयतन (V1) = πr²h","शंकु का आयतन (V2) = (1/3)πr²h","अनुपात V1 : V2 ज्ञात करना है।","V1 / V2 = (πr²h) / (1/3 πr²h)","πr²h कट जाएगा, बचेगा 1 / (1/3) = 3 / 1","अनुपात = 3:1"],"stepsEn":["Volume of Cylinder (V1) = πr²h","Volume of Cone (V2) = (1/3)πr²h","We need to find the ratio V1 : V2.","V1 / V2 = (πr²h) / (1/3 πr²h)","πr²h gets cancelled, leaving 1 / (1/3) = 3 / 1","Ratio = 3:1"],"shortcut":"समान आधार और ऊंचाई के लिए, बेलन का आयतन हमेशा शंकु के आयतन का 3 गुना होता है। 3:1।","trap":"छात्र 1:3 (शंकु से बेलन का अनुपात) चुन सकते हैं। क्रम का ध्यान रखें। / Students might choose 1:3 (Cone to Cylinder ratio). Pay attention to the order.","memoryTip":"एक बेलन (Cylinder) के अंदर 3 समान शंकु (Cones) आ सकते हैं। इसलिए बेलन 3 और शंकु 1 है। / A cylinder can fit 3 identical cones. So Cylinder is 3 and Cone is 1."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('6POmdvDqFnPha2U-O7PXN', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'यदि x + (1/x) = 5 है, तो x³ + (1/x³) का मान क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 110\",\"2) 115\",\"3) 120\",\"4) 125\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 13, 'General', 'If x + (1/x) = 5, what will be the value of x³ + (1/x³)?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["सर्वसमिका का उपयोग करें: (x + 1/x)³ = x³ + 1/x³ + 3(x)(1/x)(x + 1/x)","यहाँ (x + 1/x) = 5 दिया गया है।","5³ = x³ + 1/x³ + 3(1)(5)","125 = x³ + 1/x³ + 15","x³ + 1/x³ = 125 - 15 = 110"],"stepsEn":["Use identity: (x + 1/x)³ = x³ + 1/x³ + 3(x)(1/x)(x + 1/x)","Here (x + 1/x) = 5 is given.","5³ = x³ + 1/x³ + 3(1)(5)","125 = x³ + 1/x³ + 15","x³ + 1/x³ = 125 - 15 = 110"],"shortcut":"यदि x + 1/x = a है, तो x³ + 1/x³ = a³ - 3a होता है। यहाँ 5³ - 3(5) = 125 - 15 = 110।","trap":"छात्र केवल घन (cube) करके 125 उत्तर दे सकते हैं। / Students might just cube it and answer 125.","memoryTip":"प्लस से प्लस के घन (cube) में जाने पर 3a घटाया जाता है। (a³ - 3a)। / Going from plus to plus cube, subtract 3a. (a³ - 3a)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('tHbnDdklBL5IjlZhEiKSZ', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'एक चुनाव में दो उम्मीदवार थे। 10% मतदाताओं ने अपना वोट नहीं डाला और 10% वोट अवैध (Invalid) घोषित किए गए। जीतने वाले उम्मीदवार को वैध (Valid) वोटों का 60% मिला और वह 1620 वोटों से जीता। मतदाता सूची में कुल कितने नाम थे?', '"[\"1) 8000\",\"2) 9000\",\"3) 10000\",\"4) 12000\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 14, 'General', 'In an election there were two candidates. 10% voters did not cast their vote and 10% votes were declared invalid. The winner got 60% of the valid votes and won by 1620 votes. How many names were there in the voter list?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मान लें कि कुल मतदाता x हैं।","पड़े हुए वोट = x का 90% = 0.9x","वैध वोट = पड़े हुए वोटों का 90% (क्योंकि 10% अवैध हैं) = 0.9x × 0.9 = 0.81x","विजेता को वैध वोटों का 60% मिला, इसलिए हारने वाले को 40% मिला होगा।","जीत का अंतर = वैध वोटों का (60% - 40%) = 20%","0.81x का 20% = 1620","0.81x × 0.20 = 1620 => 0.162x = 1620 => x = 1620 / 0.162 = 10000"],"stepsEn":["Let total voters be x.","Votes cast = 90% of x = 0.9x","Valid votes = 90% of cast votes (as 10% are invalid) = 0.9x × 0.9 = 0.81x","Winner gets 60% of valid, so loser gets 40%.","Winning margin = (60% - 40%) = 20% of valid votes.","20% of 0.81x = 1620","0.81x × 0.20 = 1620 => 0.162x = 1620 => x = 1620 / 0.162 = 10000"],"shortcut":"x × (9/10) × (9/10) × (20/100) = 1620 => x × (81/100) × (1/5) = 1620 => x = 10000।","trap":"छात्र विजेता के 60% को सीधे कुल वोटों (x) पर लागू कर सकते हैं। / Students might apply winner''s 60% directly on total votes (x).","memoryTip":"चुनाव के प्रश्नों में चेन मेथड (Chain method) का इस्तेमाल करें: x × (Valid Cast Fraction) × (Margin Fraction) = जीतने के वोट।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('7rAjvzPVovDaZAELphHlT', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', '81 × 82 × 83 × 84 × 85 × 86 × 87 × 88 × 89 के गुणनफल का इकाई अंक (Unit Digit) क्या है?', '"[\"1) 0\",\"2) 2\",\"3) 4\",\"4) 5\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 15, 'General', 'What is the unit digit of the product of 81 × 82 × 83 × 84 × 85 × 86 × 87 × 88 × 89?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["इकाई अंक निकालने के लिए, केवल अंतिम अंकों का गुणा करना होता है: 1 × 2 × 3 × 4 × 5 × 6 × 7 × 8 × 9","इस गुणनफल में 2 और 5 शामिल हैं।","जब 2 और 5 का गुणा होता है, तो 10 बनता है (जिसका इकाई अंक 0 है)।","किसी भी संख्या को 0 से गुणा करने पर इकाई अंक हमेशा 0 ही रहेगा।"],"stepsEn":["To find the unit digit, only the last digits need to be multiplied: 1 × 2 × 3 × 4 × 5 × 6 × 7 × 8 × 9","This product includes 2 and 5.","When 2 and 5 are multiplied, they form 10 (which has a unit digit of 0).","Multiplying any number by 0 will always result in a unit digit of 0."],"shortcut":"5 के साथ कोई भी सम संख्या (Even number) आने पर इकाई अंक हमेशा 0 हो जाता है।","trap":"छात्र सभी अंकों को क्रमानुसार गुणा करने में समय बर्बाद कर सकते हैं। / Students might waste time multiplying all digits sequentially.","memoryTip":"सीरीज में अगर कहीं भी ''5'' और कोई ''सम संख्या (2,4,6,8)'' दिख जाए, तो बिना सोचे उत्तर ''0'' लगा दें। / In a series, if you spot ''5'' and any ''even number'', mark ''0'' without thinking."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('_A78VjscbrthXEC7oWhMs', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'A, B और C किसी काम को क्रमशः 10, 15 और 30 दिनों में कर सकते हैं। वे एक साथ काम करते हैं और उन्हें पूरे काम के लिए ₹3000 मिलते हैं। A का हिस्सा क्या है?', '"[\"1) ₹1000\",\"2) ₹1200\",\"3) ₹1500\",\"4) ₹2000\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 16, 'General', 'A, B and C can do a piece of work in 10, 15 and 30 days respectively. They work together and get ₹3000 for the whole work. What is A''s share?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["कुल काम = 10, 15 और 30 का LCM = 30 इकाई।","A की क्षमता = 30 / 10 = 3 इकाई/दिन","B की क्षमता = 30 / 15 = 2 इकाई/दिन","C की क्षमता = 30 / 30 = 1 इकाई/दिन","मजदूरी उनकी क्षमताओं के अनुपात (3 : 2 : 1) में बांटी जाएगी।","कुल अनुपात = 3 + 2 + 1 = 6 भाग। 6 भाग = ₹3000, 1 भाग = ₹500।","A का हिस्सा = 3 भाग = 3 × 500 = ₹1500।"],"stepsEn":["Total work = LCM of 10, 15 and 30 = 30 units.","A''s efficiency = 30 / 10 = 3 units/day","B''s efficiency = 30 / 15 = 2 units/day","C''s efficiency = 30 / 30 = 1 unit/day","Wages will be distributed in ratio of their efficiencies (3 : 2 : 1).","Total ratio = 3 + 2 + 1 = 6 parts. 6 parts = ₹3000, 1 part = ₹500.","A''s share = 3 parts = 3 × 500 = ₹1500."],"shortcut":"क्षमताओं का अनुपात = 1/10 : 1/15 : 1/30 = 3 : 2 : 1। A का हिस्सा = (3/6) × 3000 = ₹1500।","trap":"छात्र मजदूरी को दिनों के अनुपात (10:15:30) में बांट सकते हैं, जो गलत है। / Students might divide wages in the ratio of days (10:15:30), which is wrong.","memoryTip":"मजदूरी (Wages) हमेशा काम करने की क्षमता (Efficiency) के अनुपात में बंटती है, समय के नहीं। / Wages are always divided in proportion to Efficiency, not time."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('_SvJp4syjNs7iEsrI5HoU', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'पिता और पुत्र की वर्तमान आयु का योग 60 वर्ष है। 6 वर्ष पूर्व, पिता की आयु पुत्र की आयु की 5 गुनी थी। 6 वर्ष बाद पुत्र की आयु क्या होगी?', '"[\"1) 14 वर्ष / 14 Years\",\"2) 20 वर्ष / 20 Years\",\"3) 22 वर्ष / 22 Years\",\"4) 26 वर्ष / 26 Years\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 17, 'General', 'The sum of present ages of a father and son is 60 years. 6 years ago, the father''s age was 5 times the age of the son. What will be the son''s age after 6 years?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मान लें 6 वर्ष पूर्व पुत्र की आयु x थी, तो पिता की आयु 5x थी।","उनकी वर्तमान आयु: पुत्र = x + 6, पिता = 5x + 6","वर्तमान आयु का योग 60 है: (x + 6) + (5x + 6) = 60","6x + 12 = 60 => 6x = 48 => x = 8","पुत्र की वर्तमान आयु = 8 + 6 = 14 वर्ष।","6 वर्ष बाद पुत्र की आयु = 14 + 6 = 20 वर्ष।"],"stepsEn":["Let 6 years ago son''s age be x, then father''s age was 5x.","Their present ages: Son = x + 6, Father = 5x + 6","Sum of present ages is 60: (x + 6) + (5x + 6) = 60","6x + 12 = 60 => 6x = 48 => x = 8","Present age of son = 8 + 6 = 14 years.","Son''s age after 6 years = 14 + 6 = 20 years."],"shortcut":"6 वर्ष पूर्व दोनों की आयु का योग 60 - 12 = 48 था। अनुपात 5:1। 6 इकाई = 48 (1 इकाई = 8)। पुत्र 6 साल पहले 8 का था। 6 साल बाद मतलब आज से 6 साल आगे = 8 + 6 (वर्तमान) + 6 = 20।","trap":"छात्र वर्तमान आयु (14) निकालकर उसे उत्तर मान सकते हैं, जबकि ''6 वर्ष बाद'' पूछा गया है। / Students might find present age (14) and assume it as answer, while it asks for ''after 6 years''.","memoryTip":"आयु के योग को हमेशा उस समय (Past/Future) में ले जाएं जहां अनुपात (Ratio) दिया गया हो। / Always shift the sum of ages to the time (Past/Future) where the ratio is given."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('JQgEDuEFU-5x77HyZzYIM', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'A, B और C एक वृत्ताकार स्टेडियम के चारों ओर एक ही समय पर दौड़ना शुरू करते हैं। A एक चक्कर 24 सेकंड में, B 30 सेकंड में और C 36 सेकंड में पूरा करता है। वे शुरुआती बिंदु पर कितने समय (मिनटों में) बाद फिर मिलेंगे?', '"[\"1) 4 मिनट / 4 Mins\",\"2) 5 मिनट / 5 Mins\",\"3) 6 मिनट / 6 Mins\",\"4) 10 मिनट / 10 Mins\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 18, 'General', 'A, B and C start running around a circular stadium at the same time. A completes one round in 24 seconds, B in 30 seconds and C in 36 seconds. After what time (in minutes) will they meet again at the starting point?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["शुरुआती बिंदु पर एक साथ मिलने का समय उनके द्वारा लिए गए समय का LCM होगा।","24, 30 और 36 का LCM निकालें।","24 = 2³ × 3","30 = 2 × 3 × 5","36 = 2² × 3²","LCM = 2³ × 3² × 5 = 8 × 9 × 5 = 360 सेकंड।","समय को मिनटों में बदलें: 360 / 60 = 6 मिनट।"],"stepsEn":["The time to meet together at the starting point will be the LCM of their individual times.","Find the LCM of 24, 30 and 36.","24 = 2³ × 3","30 = 2 × 3 × 5","36 = 2² × 3²","LCM = 2³ × 3² × 5 = 8 × 9 × 5 = 360 seconds.","Convert time to minutes: 360 / 60 = 6 minutes."],"shortcut":"LCM(24, 30, 36) = 360 सेकंड। 360/60 = 6 मिनट।","trap":"छात्र उत्तर 360 निकाल कर विकल्पों में ढूंढ सकते हैं (वे सेकंड को मिनट में बदलना भूल सकते हैं)। / Students might get 360 and look for it in options (forgetting to convert to minutes).","memoryTip":"वृत्ताकार ट्रैक पर एक साथ मिलने का प्रश्न हमेशा LCM से हल होता है। / Questions about meeting together on a circular track are always solved using LCM."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('2c4MtIkPvCdyFbMrvVVHa', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'एक परीक्षा में 70% उम्मीदवार अंग्रेजी में और 80% गणित में उत्तीर्ण हुए। 10% दोनों विषयों में अनुत्तीर्ण रहे। यदि 144 उम्मीदवार दोनों विषयों में उत्तीर्ण हुए, तो कुल उम्मीदवारों की संख्या क्या थी?', '"[\"1) 200\",\"2) 240\",\"3) 300\",\"4) 360\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 19, 'General', 'In an exam 70% candidates passed in English and 80% passed in Mathematics. 10% failed in both subjects. If 144 candidates passed in both subjects, what was the total number of candidates?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["सभी प्रतिशत को ''उत्तीर्ण (Pass)'' में बदलें। दोनों में अनुत्तीर्ण = 10%, इसका अर्थ है कम से कम एक विषय में उत्तीर्ण = 100% - 10% = 90%।","सूत्र: n(A ∪ B) = n(A) + n(B) - n(A ∩ B)","यहाँ n(A ∪ B) = 90% (कम से कम एक में पास), n(A) = 70%, n(B) = 80%","90 = 70 + 80 - दोनों में पास","दोनों में पास = 150 - 90 = 60%","दिया है 60% = 144 उम्मीदवार। 1% = 144 / 60 = 2.4","कुल उम्मीदवार (100%) = 2.4 × 100 = 240"],"stepsEn":["Convert all percentages to ''Pass''. Failed in both = 10%, meaning passed in at least one = 100% - 10% = 90%.","Formula: n(A ∪ B) = n(A) + n(B) - n(A ∩ B)","Here n(A ∪ B) = 90% (passed in at least one), n(A) = 70%, n(B) = 80%","90 = 70 + 80 - Passed in both","Passed in both = 150 - 90 = 60%","Given 60% = 144 candidates. 1% = 144 / 60 = 2.4","Total candidates (100%) = 2.4 × 100 = 240"],"shortcut":"दोनों में पास % = (70 + 80) - (100 - 10) = 150 - 90 = 60%। 60% = 144, तो 100% = 240।","trap":"छात्र 70+80-10 = 140% कर सकते हैं, जो वेन आरेख का गलत अनुप्रयोग है (पास और फेल को मिलाना)। / Students might do 70+80-10 = 140%, which is wrong application (mixing pass and fail).","memoryTip":"वेन आरेख में हमेशा या तो ''सब कुछ पास'' में रखें या ''सब कुछ फेल'' में। / In Venn diagram, keep everything in ''Pass'' format or everything in ''Fail'' format."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('mAkeC722Arh1-Uw1wDWil', 'lzTzaiqtM50IoH9CessBh', 'एक दुकानदार अपने माल पर क्रय मूल्य से 20% अधिक मूल्य अंकित करता है। वह आधी वस्तुओं को अंकित मूल्य पर, एक चौथाई को 20% छूट पर और शेष को 40% छूट पर बेचता है। उसका कुल लाभ प्रतिशत क्या है?', '"[\"1) 2%\",\"2) 5%\",\"3) 8%\",\"4) 10%\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 20, 'General', 'A shopkeeper marks his goods 20% above the cost price. He sells half the goods at the marked price, one-fourth at a 20% discount and the rest at a 40% discount. What is his total profit percentage?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मान लें 100 वस्तुएं हैं और प्रत्येक का क्रय मूल्य (CP) ₹100 है। कुल CP = ₹10,000।","अंकित मूल्य (MP) = 100 + 20% = ₹120 प्रति वस्तु।","1) आधी वस्तुएं (50) MP पर बेचीं: 50 × 120 = ₹6000","2) एक चौथाई (25) 20% छूट पर (120 का 80% = 96): 25 × 96 = ₹2400","3) शेष (25) 40% छूट पर (120 का 60% = 72): 25 × 72 = ₹1800","कुल विक्रय मूल्य (SP) = 6000 + 2400 + 1800 = ₹10,200","लाभ = 10200 - 10000 = 200। लाभ % = (200 / 10000) × 100 = 2%"],"stepsEn":["Let there be 100 items, CP of each = ₹100. Total CP = ₹10,000.","Marked Price (MP) = 100 + 20% = ₹120 per item.","1) Half items (50) sold at MP: 50 × 120 = ₹6000","2) One-fourth (25) at 20% discount (80% of 120 = 96): 25 × 96 = ₹2400","3) Rest (25) at 40% discount (60% of 120 = 72): 25 × 72 = ₹1800","Total SP = 6000 + 2400 + 1800 = ₹10,200","Profit = 10200 - 10000 = 200. Profit % = (200 / 10000) × 100 = 2%"],"shortcut":"कुल SP% = 1/2(120) + 1/4(96) + 1/4(72) = 60 + 24 + 18 = 102। 100 से 102 मतलब 2% लाभ।","trap":"छात्र औसत छूट निकालकर उसे अंकित मूल्य पर लागू कर सकते हैं, जिससे गलत उत्तर आ सकता है। / Students might find average discount and apply on MP, leading to wrong answer.","memoryTip":"ऐसे टुकड़ों वाले प्रश्नों में हमेशा 100 वस्तुएं ₹100 की मानकर हल करना सबसे सुरक्षित होता है। / In such fractional questions, assuming 100 items for ₹100 each is the safest method."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('WUasFW91_edKGNI8C1Uss', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'दी गई श्रृंखला में अगला पद ज्ञात कीजिए: 2, 8, 18, 32, 50, ?', '"[\"1) 72 / 72\",\"2) 64 / 64\",\"3) 68 / 68\",\"4) 76 / 76\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'Find the next term in the given series: 2, 8, 18, 32, 50, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पैटर्न 2 × (n²) पर आधारित है।","2 × (1²) = 2","2 × (2²) = 8","2 × (3²) = 18","2 × (4²) = 32","2 × (5²) = 50","अगला पद: 2 × (6²) = 2 × 36 = 72"],"chainEn":["The pattern is based on 2 × (n²).","2 × (1²) = 2","2 × (2²) = 8","2 × (3²) = 18","2 × (4²) = 32","2 × (5²) = 50","Next term: 2 × (6²) = 2 × 36 = 72"],"pattern":"2n² mathematical series.","elimination":"Alternatively, check differences: +6, +10, +14, +18. Next difference is +22. 50 + 22 = 72. Both logics give exactly 72.","memoryTip":"Whenever you see 18, 32, 50 together, immediately think of doubled squares (9x2, 16x2, 25x2)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('JBzCEZHTjKvJel7RQh6tJ', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'दी गई अक्षर श्रृंखला को पूरा करें: A, D, H, M, S, ?', '"[\"1) Z / Z\",\"2) Y / Y\",\"3) X / X\",\"4) W / W\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'Complete the given alphabet series: A, D, H, M, S, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["अक्षरों के स्थानीय मान लिखें: A=1, D=4, H=8, M=13, S=19","पदों के बीच का अंतर निकालें: 4-1 = +3","8-4 = +4","13-8 = +5","19-13 = +6","अंतर +3, +4, +5, +6 के रूप में बढ़ रहा है। अगला अंतर +7 होगा।","19 + 7 = 26, जो ''Z'' का स्थानीय मान है।"],"chainEn":["Write the positional values: A=1, D=4, H=8, M=13, S=19","Calculate the differences: 4-1 = +3","8-4 = +4","13-8 = +5","19-13 = +6","The gap increases as +3, +4, +5, +6. Next gap is +7.","19 + 7 = 26, which is the positional value of ''Z''."],"pattern":"Increasing incremental gap (+3, +4, +5, +6, +7).","elimination":"S(19) + 7 equals exactly 26. The 26th letter is Z, eliminating all other options.","memoryTip":"Translate letters to numbers first. Number series are much easier to solve mentally than letter gaps."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('_Pdsy8y77XeZ1dJEoGtUJ', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'यदि एक विशिष्ट कूट में ''WATER'' को ''XCWIW'' लिखा जाता है, तो ''EARTH'' को क्या लिखा जाएगा?', '"[\"1) FCUXM / FCUXM\",\"2) FCVXM / FCVXM\",\"3) GDTYN / GDTYN\",\"4) FDUXM / FDUXM\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'If in a certain code ''WATER'' is written as ''XCWIW'', how will ''EARTH'' be written?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["प्रत्येक अक्षर में बढ़ते क्रम में वृद्धि की गई है: +1, +2, +3, +4, +5।","W(+1)=X, A(+2)=C, T(+3)=W, E(+4)=I, R(+5)=W","यही नियम ''EARTH'' पर लागू करें:","E(+1)=F, A(+2)=C, R(+3)=U, T(+4)=X, H(+5)=M","परिणाम: FCUXM"],"chainEn":["Each letter is shifted in an increasing order: +1, +2, +3, +4, +5.","W(+1)=X, A(+2)=C, T(+3)=W, E(+4)=I, R(+5)=W","Apply the same rule to ''EARTH'':","E(+1)=F, A(+2)=C, R(+3)=U, T(+4)=X, H(+5)=M","Result: FCUXM"],"pattern":"Progressive Forward Shift (+1, +2, +3, +4, +5).","elimination":"The second letter A+2 is C, eliminating options 3 and 4. The third letter R+3 is U, eliminating option 2.","memoryTip":"If the first and last letters have different shift gaps, it''s usually a progressive series (+1, +2, +3...)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('LmUNTMUFGOEi_GnUkHoU1', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'यदि ''PEN'' = 35 और ''EGG'' = 19 है, तो ''PAGE'' का मान क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 29 / 29\",\"2) 28 / 28\",\"3) 31 / 31\",\"4) 27 / 27\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'If ''PEN'' = 35 and ''EGG'' = 19, what will be the value of ''PAGE''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["अक्षरों के वर्णमाला स्थानीय मान (Place Values) को जोड़ें।","P(16) + E(5) + N(14) = 16 + 5 + 14 = 35","E(5) + G(7) + G(7) = 5 + 7 + 7 = 19","यही नियम ''PAGE'' पर लागू करें:","P(16) + A(1) + G(7) + E(5)","योग: 16 + 1 + 7 + 5 = 29"],"chainEn":["Add the alphabetical place values of the letters.","P(16) + E(5) + N(14) = 16 + 5 + 14 = 35","E(5) + G(7) + G(7) = 5 + 7 + 7 = 19","Apply the same rule to ''PAGE'':","P(16) + A(1) + G(7) + E(5)","Sum: 16 + 1 + 7 + 5 = 29"],"pattern":"Direct Sum of Alphabetical Place Values.","elimination":"The pure arithmetic sum is exactly 29. No other modifiers are applied.","memoryTip":"Always verify your logic with the second example word before calculating the final answer."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('UeigOnUReJhg06Hbl_Kfw', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'एक आदमी की ओर इशारा करते हुए एक महिला ने कहा, ''वह मेरे चाचा की बेटी का भाई है।'' वह आदमी उस महिला से किस प्रकार संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) चचेरा भाई / Cousin\",\"2) सगा भाई / Brother\",\"3) भतीजा / Nephew\",\"4) चाचा / Uncle\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'Pointing to a man, a woman said, ''He is the brother of my uncle''s daughter.'' How is the man related to the woman?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["महिला कहती है: ''मेरे चाचा की बेटी'' (my uncle''s daughter)।","चाचा की बेटी को चचेरी बहन (Cousin) कहा जाता है।","अब, ''मेरी चचेरी बहन का भाई'' (brother of cousin)।","चचेरी बहन का भाई भी चचेरा भाई (Cousin) ही होता है।","अतः वह आदमी महिला का चचेरा भाई है।"],"chainEn":["The woman says: ''my uncle''s daughter''.","An uncle''s daughter is a Cousin.","Now, ''brother of my cousin''.","The brother of a cousin is also a Cousin.","Therefore, the man is the woman''s cousin."],"pattern":"Indirect lateral relation tracing.","elimination":"Uncle''s kids are cousins. The gender is male (brother), so he is a male cousin.","memoryTip":"Uncle''s son or daughter = Cousin. Their siblings are also Cousins."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('oZrN7QUS164CnSiLjsQnr', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'यदि P % Q का अर्थ है ''P, Q की माता है'', P $ Q का अर्थ है ''P, Q का पिता है'', और P # Q का अर्थ है ''P, Q की बहन है''। तो व्यंजक P % Q # R में P, R से किस प्रकार संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) बहन / Sister\",\"2) माँ / Mother\",\"3) मौसी / Aunt\",\"4) दादी / Grandmother\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'If P % Q means ''P is the mother of Q'', P $ Q means ''P is the father of Q'', and P # Q means ''P is the sister of Q''. How is P related to R in the expression P % Q # R?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["व्यंजक को बाएँ से दाएँ हल करें: P % Q का अर्थ है P, Q की माता है।","Q # R का अर्थ है Q, R की बहन है।","चूँकि Q और R भाई-बहन हैं (Q बहन है), और P, Q की माता है।","अतः P, R की भी माता होगी।"],"chainEn":["Solve the expression left to right: P % Q means P is the mother of Q.","Q # R means Q is the sister of R.","Since Q and R are siblings (Q is sister), and P is the mother of Q.","Therefore, P must also be the mother of R."],"pattern":"Coded Blood Relation (Sequential).","elimination":"Since Q is the sister of R, they share the same parents. P is Q''s mother, so she is R''s mother too.","memoryTip":"If A is mother of B, and B is sibling of C, then A is mother of C. Do not overcomplicate."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('OjMUYn1h8_SPFfRi_LNIh', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'एक व्यक्ति उत्तर की ओर मुँह करके खड़ा है। वह 135° दक्षिणावर्त (Clockwise) दिशा में मुड़ता है, और फिर 45° वामावर्त (Anti-clockwise) दिशा में मुड़ता है। अब वह किस दिशा की ओर मुँह किये हुए है?', '"[\"1) पूर्व / East\",\"2) दक्षिण-पूर्व / South-East\",\"3) पश्चिम / West\",\"4) दक्षिण / South\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'A person is facing North. He turns 135° in the clockwise direction, and then 45° in the anti-clockwise direction. Which direction is he facing now?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["प्रारंभिक दिशा: उत्तर (North)।","कुल दक्षिणावर्त घुमाव = +135°","कुल वामावर्त घुमाव = -45°","नेट घुमाव = +135° - 45° = +90°","+90° का अर्थ है उत्तर से 90° दक्षिणावर्त (Clockwise) मुड़ना।","उत्तर से 90° दायीं ओर मुड़ने पर पूर्व (East) दिशा प्राप्त होती है।"],"chainEn":["Initial direction: North.","Total clockwise turn = +135°","Total anti-clockwise turn = -45°","Net turn = +135° - 45° = +90°","+90° means a 90° turn clockwise from North.","Turning 90° right from North gives the East direction."],"pattern":"Net Angle Rotation Computation.","elimination":"A net 90° clockwise rotation from North strictly points to East.","memoryTip":"Never rotate step-by-step. Always find the Net Angle (CW - ACW) first to save time."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Wq5bUSgtKyg04OYgtSXoh', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'एक आदमी दक्षिण की ओर 30 मीटर चलता है, फिर बायीं ओर मुड़कर 40 मीटर चलता है। वह अपने प्रारंभिक बिंदु से कितनी दूर है?', '"[\"1) 70 मीटर / 70m\",\"2) 50 मीटर / 50m\",\"3) 10 मीटर / 10m\",\"4) 60 मीटर / 60m\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'A man walks 30m South, then turns left and walks 40m. How far is he from his starting point?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["यह एक समकोण त्रिभुज (Right-angled triangle) बनाता है।","दक्षिण की ओर लंब (Perpendicular) = 30m","बाएं मुड़ने पर (पूर्व की ओर) आधार (Base) = 40m","पाइथागोरस प्रमेय का प्रयोग करें: कर्ण² = लंब² + आधार²","दूरी² = 30² + 40² = 900 + 1600 = 2500","दूरी = √2500 = 50 मीटर"],"chainEn":["This forms a right-angled triangle.","Perpendicular towards South = 30m","Base after turning left (East) = 40m","Use Pythagoras Theorem: Hypotenuse² = Perpendicular² + Base²","Distance² = 30² + 40² = 900 + 1600 = 2500","Distance = √2500 = 50 meters"],"pattern":"Pythagorean Triplet (3-4-5 scaled by 10).","elimination":"70m is the total distance walked, not the shortest distance. 50m perfectly fits the 3-4-5 triangle rule.","memoryTip":"Memorize the 3, 4, 5 triplet. Any multiples like 30, 40, 50 or 6, 8, 10 also form right triangles."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('GhA01jbpJRwMf0VOQBkDF', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'कथन: 1. सभी दरवाजे खिड़कियाँ हैं। 2. कुछ खिड़कियाँ दीवारें हैं।
निष्कर्ष: I. कुछ दीवारें दरवाजे हैं। II. सभी दीवारें खिड़कियाँ हैं।', '"[\"1) केवल निष्कर्ष I सही है / Only conclusion I follows\",\"2) केवल निष्कर्ष II सही है / Only conclusion II follows\",\"3) दोनों सही हैं / Both follow\",\"4) कोई सही नहीं है / None follows\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'Statements: 1. All doors are windows. 2. Some windows are walls.
Conclusions: I. Some walls are doors. II. All walls are windows.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["दरवाजे का पूरा वृत्त खिड़कियों के वृत्त के अंदर है।","खिड़कियों का वृत्त दीवारों के वृत्त से जुड़ता (intersect) है।","चूँकि दीवार का वृत्त खिड़की को छूता है, इसका मतलब यह नहीं है कि वह अंदर जाकर दरवाजे को भी छुएगा (निष्कर्ष I अनिश्चित/गलत है)।","कथन कहता है कि ''कुछ'' खिड़कियाँ दीवारें हैं, यह साबित नहीं करता कि ''सभी'' दीवारें खिड़कियाँ हैं (निष्कर्ष II गलत है)।","अतः कोई भी निष्कर्ष सही नहीं है।"],"chainEn":["The entire Door circle is inside the Windows circle.","The Windows circle intersects with the Walls circle.","Just because the Wall circle touches Windows does not guarantee it reaches deep enough to touch Doors (Conclusion I is doubtful/false).","The statement says ''some'' windows are walls, this doesn''t prove ''all'' walls are windows (Conclusion II is false).","Hence, neither conclusion follows."],"pattern":"A + I Syllogism (No connection).","elimination":"An inner circle (Doors) is not guaranteed to touch an intersecting outer circle (Walls). Universal ''All'' cannot be derived from a ''Some'' statement.","memoryTip":"In ''All A are B, Some B are C'', A and C have no guaranteed connection."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('nQ4Wvhhj1111BID85sApG', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'कथन: 1. कोई A, B नहीं है। 2. सभी B, C हैं।
निष्कर्ष: I. कुछ C, A नहीं हैं। II. कुछ A, C हैं।', '"[\"1) केवल निष्कर्ष I सही है / Only conclusion I follows\",\"2) केवल निष्कर्ष II सही है / Only conclusion II follows\",\"3) दोनों सही हैं / Both follow\",\"4) कोई सही नहीं है / None follows\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'Statements: 1. No A is B. 2. All B are C.
Conclusions: I. Some C are not A. II. Some A are C.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["B का वृत्त पूरी तरह से C के वृत्त के अंदर है।","A का वृत्त B को बिल्कुल नहीं छू सकता।","चूँकि पूरा B, C के अंदर है, इसलिए C का वह हिस्सा (जो B है) कभी भी A को नहीं छू सकता।","इसलिए, ''कुछ C (जो B हैं) A नहीं हैं'' बिल्कुल सत्य है (निष्कर्ष I सही है)।","A और C के बाहरी हिस्से के बीच क्या संबंध है, यह हमें नहीं पता, इसलिए ''कुछ A, C हैं'' की गारंटी नहीं है (निष्कर्ष II गलत है)।"],"chainEn":["The B circle is completely inside the C circle.","The A circle cannot touch B at all.","Since all B is inside C, the part of C (which is B) can NEVER touch A.","Therefore, ''Some C (which are B) are not A'' is absolutely true (Conclusion I follows).","We don''t know the relationship between A and the outer part of C, so ''Some A are C'' is not guaranteed (Conclusion II is false)."],"pattern":"E + A = Reverse O (Some Not) logic.","elimination":"Negative boundary on B applies to the part of C that houses B. Thus, some parts of C are definitely restricted from A.","memoryTip":"If ''No X is Y'' and ''All Y are Z'', the only definite conclusion is ''Some Z are not X''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ix2Ppx_bjHuoD1DOsFZIV', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'गश्त के दौरान, आप देखते हैं कि कुछ युवक एक बुजुर्ग फल विक्रेता को परेशान कर रहे हैं। आपकी पहली प्रतिक्रिया क्या होगी?', '"[\"1) अनदेखा कर देंगे क्योंकि यह मामूली बात है / Ignore it as it is a minor issue\",\"2) भीड़ का हिस्सा बनकर तमाशा देखेंगे / Become part of the crowd and watch the spectacle\",\"3) तुरंत हस्तक्षेप करेंगे, युवकों को रोकेंगे और विक्रेता की सुरक्षा सुनिश्चित करेंगे / Intervene immediately, stop the youths and ensure the vendor''s safety\",\"4) चुपचाप पुलिस स्टेशन लौटकर FIR का इंतजार करेंगे / Quietly return to the police station and wait for an FIR\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 11, 'General', 'During patrolling, you see some youths harassing an elderly fruit vendor. What will be your first reaction?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पुलिस का प्राथमिक कर्तव्य नागरिकों, विशेषकर बुजुर्गों और कमजोर वर्गों की सुरक्षा सुनिश्चित करना है।","उत्पीड़न या अपराध होते हुए देखकर उसे अनदेखा करना कर्तव्य की घोर अवहेलना है।","गश्त (patrolling) का उद्देश्य ही सड़क पर तुरंत न्याय और सुरक्षा प्रदान करना है।","इसलिए तुरंत हस्तक्षेप करना सबसे उचित कार्रवाई है।"],"chainEn":["The primary duty of police is to ensure the safety of citizens, especially the elderly and vulnerable sections.","Ignoring harassment or a crime in progress is a grave dereliction of duty.","The very purpose of patrolling is to provide immediate justice and security on the streets.","Therefore, intervening immediately is the most appropriate action."],"pattern":"Active Law Enforcement / SRT.","elimination":"Options 1, 2, and 4 show extreme negligence. Option 3 demonstrates active, responsible policing.","memoryTip":"In ''Crime in Progress'' SRTs, the officer MUST take immediate on-the-spot action to protect the victim."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('zxklRt0Ca4jOf-8XzpkLd', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'आप सादे कपड़ों (Off-duty) में हैं और बाजार में एक झपटमार (Snatcher) आपके सामने से एक महिला का पर्स छीनकर भागता है। आप क्या करेंगे?', '"[\"1) उसका पीछा करेंगे और उसे सुरक्षित रूप से पकड़ने का प्रयास करेंगे / Chase him and try to apprehend him safely\",\"2) ऐसा दिखावा करेंगे कि आपने कुछ नहीं देखा / Pretend that you saw nothing\",\"3) एक घंटे बाद 100 नंबर पर कॉल करेंगे / Call 100 after an hour\",\"4) जोर-जोर से चिल्लाएंगे लेकिन अपनी जगह से नहीं हिलेंगे / Shout loudly but won''t move from your place\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 12, 'General', 'You are in civil clothes (Off-duty) and a snatcher steals a woman''s purse and runs past you in the market. What will you do?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["एक पुलिस अधिकारी 24/7 ड्यूटी पर माना जाता है जब बात अपराध को रोकने की हो।","सादे कपड़ों में होना आपको आपकी जिम्मेदारी से मुक्त नहीं करता।","अपराधी आपके सामने है, इसलिए उसे भागने देना गलत है।","सुरक्षित तरीके से पीछा करना और उसे पकड़ना एक पुलिसकर्मी का सही कर्तव्य है।"],"chainEn":["A police officer is considered to be on duty 24/7 when it comes to preventing crimes.","Being in civil clothes does not exempt you from your responsibility.","The criminal is right in front of you, so letting him escape is wrong.","Chasing and apprehending him safely is the correct duty of a policeman."],"pattern":"Off-duty Crime Response / SRT.","elimination":"Options 2, 3, and 4 show laziness or fear. Option 1 shows courage and adherence to the oath of a police officer.","memoryTip":"A police officer is never ''off-duty'' if a crime happens right in front of them."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('eqvg5PEMsro1H06cibulr', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'एक खुले पासे (Open Dice) में, फलक 1 के एकांतर (alternate) 5 है, 2 के एकांतर 4 है, और 3 के एकांतर 6 है। पासे को मोड़ने पर कौन से दो फलक एक साथ (निकटवर्ती) नहीं हो सकते?', '"[\"1) 1 और 4 / 1 and 4\",\"2) 2 और 6 / 2 and 6\",\"3) 1 और 5 / 1 and 5\",\"4) 3 और 4 / 3 and 4\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 13, 'General', 'In an open dice, face 1 is alternate to 5, 2 is alternate to 4, and 3 is alternate to 6. When the dice is folded, which two faces cannot be adjacent together?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["खुले पासे के नियम के अनुसार: एकांतर (Alternate) फलक हमेशा एक-दूसरे के विपरीत (Opposite) होते हैं।","दिया गया है: 1 के विपरीत 5 है, 2 के विपरीत 4 है, और 3 के विपरीत 6 है।","पासे का दूसरा नियम: दो विपरीत फलक कभी भी एक साथ (निकटवर्ती/Adjacent) दिखाई नहीं दे सकते।","चूँकि 1 और 5 विपरीत हैं, वे कभी निकटवर्ती नहीं हो सकते।"],"chainEn":["According to the open dice rule: Alternate faces are always opposite to each other.","Given: 1 is opposite 5, 2 is opposite 4, and 3 is opposite 6.","Second rule of dice: Two opposite faces can never appear together (adjacent).","Since 1 and 5 are opposite, they can never be adjacent."],"pattern":"Open Dice Alternate = Opposite logic.","elimination":"If they are alternate, they are opposite. If they are opposite, they can''t touch. Only Option 3 pairs two known opposites.","memoryTip":"Opposites repel. They can never share a border or a corner on a 3D cube."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('W4ww-mFo6GcOA6pf-F8IN', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'एक ही पासे की दो स्थितियाँ दी गई हैं।
स्थिति 1: फलक 1, 2, 3
स्थिति 2: फलक 3, 4, 5
संख्या 3 के विपरीत फलक पर कौन सी संख्या होगी?', '"[\"1) 1 / 1\",\"2) 2 / 2\",\"3) 6 / 6\",\"4) 4 / 4\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 14, 'General', 'Two positions of a single dice are given.
Position 1: Faces 1, 2, 3
Position 2: Faces 3, 4, 5
Which number will be on the face opposite to 3?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["दोनों स्थितियों में ''3'' उभयनिष्ठ (Common) संख्या है।","स्थिति 1 में, 3 के निकटवर्ती (adjacent) 1 और 2 हैं।","स्थिति 2 में, 3 के निकटवर्ती 4 और 5 हैं।","एक संख्या के 4 निकटवर्ती फलक होते हैं (यहाँ 1, 2, 4, 5)।","चूँकि निकटवर्ती फलक विपरीत नहीं हो सकते, केवल संख्या 6 शेष बचती है।","अतः 3 के विपरीत 6 होगा।"],"chainEn":["''3'' is the common number in both positions.","In position 1, adjacent to 3 are 1 and 2.","In position 2, adjacent to 3 are 4 and 5.","A number has 4 adjacent faces (here 1, 2, 4, 5).","Since adjacent faces cannot be opposite, only number 6 is left.","Hence, 6 will be opposite to 3."],"pattern":"Single Common Face Elimination.","elimination":"1, 2, 4, and 5 all touch 3. Therefore, none of them can be on the opposite side. 6 is the only valid answer.","memoryTip":"The number opposite to the common face is always the one missing from both images."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('4xXXFmF7YT3QlKa8JDUz6', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'दी गई श्रृंखला में प्रश्न चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आएगा: 10, 12, 15, 20, 27, ?', '"[\"1) 36 / 36\",\"2) 38 / 38\",\"3) 34 / 34\",\"4) 37 / 37\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 15, 'General', 'What will come in place of the question mark (?) in the series: 10, 12, 15, 20, 27, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["क्रमागत पदों के बीच का अंतर निकालें।","12 - 10 = +2","15 - 12 = +3","20 - 15 = +5","27 - 20 = +7","अंतर (2, 3, 5, 7) अभाज्य संख्याओं (Prime Numbers) की एक श्रृंखला है।","7 के बाद अगली अभाज्य संख्या 11 होती है।","इसलिए, अगला पद: 27 + 11 = 38"],"chainEn":["Calculate the differences between consecutive terms.","12 - 10 = +2","15 - 12 = +3","20 - 15 = +5","27 - 20 = +7","The differences (2, 3, 5, 7) form a series of Prime Numbers.","The next prime number after 7 is 11.","Therefore, the next term: 27 + 11 = 38"],"pattern":"Prime Number Difference Series.","elimination":"9 is not a prime number, so the gap is not +9 (which would give 36). The gap is strictly prime (+11), giving 38.","memoryTip":"If a difference series goes 2, 3, 5, 7... DO NOT add 9. 9 is odd, but not prime. The next is always 11."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('xlPEV9lOdsjhq-JsnV65c', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'अक्षर श्रृंखला को पूरा करें: BZA, DYC, FXE, ?', '"[\"1) GWH / GWH\",\"2) HWG / HWG\",\"3) HWF / HWF\",\"4) GWG / GWG\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 16, 'General', 'Complete the letter series: BZA, DYC, FXE, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["प्रत्येक समूह के अक्षरों का अलग-अलग विश्लेषण करें।","पहला अक्षर: B(+2) -> D(+2) -> F(+2) -> H","दूसरा अक्षर: Z(-1) -> Y(-1) -> X(-1) -> W","तीसरा अक्षर: A(+2) -> C(+2) -> E(+2) -> G","तीनों को एक साथ मिलाने पर: HWG"],"chainEn":["Analyze the letters of each group separately.","First letter: B(+2) -> D(+2) -> F(+2) -> H","Second letter: Z(-1) -> Y(-1) -> X(-1) -> W","Third letter: A(+2) -> C(+2) -> E(+2) -> G","Combining all three together: HWG"],"pattern":"Independent positional shifts (+2, -1, +2).","elimination":"First letter is H, second is W, third is G. Option 2 perfectly aligns with all three rules.","memoryTip":"Break the 3-letter clumps into three separate parallel series and solve them one by one."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('3u04XVElvE742TZLLLSWz', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'कथन: 1. सभी शेर बिल्लियाँ हैं। 2. सभी बिल्लियाँ जानवर हैं।
निष्कर्ष: I. सभी शेर जानवर हैं। II. कुछ जानवर बिल्लियाँ हैं।', '"[\"1) केवल निष्कर्ष I सही है / Only conclusion I follows\",\"2) केवल निष्कर्ष II सही है / Only conclusion II follows\",\"3) दोनों सही हैं / Both follow\",\"4) कोई सही नहीं है / None follows\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 17, 'General', 'Statements: 1. All lions are cats. 2. All cats are animals.
Conclusions: I. All lions are animals. II. Some animals are cats.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["शेर का वृत्त पूरी तरह से बिल्लियों के वृत्त के अंदर है।","बिल्लियों का वृत्त पूरी तरह से जानवरों के वृत्त के अंदर है।","इसलिए, शेर का वृत्त स्वतः ही जानवरों के वृत्त के अंदर आ जाता है (निष्कर्ष I सत्य है)।","चूँकि बिल्लियाँ जानवरों के बड़े वृत्त के अंदर हैं, इसका मतलब है कि जानवरों के वृत्त का कुछ हिस्सा बिल्लियों ने घेर रखा है (निष्कर्ष II सत्य है)।","अतः दोनों निष्कर्ष सही हैं।"],"chainEn":["The Lion circle is completely inside the Cats circle.","The Cats circle is completely inside the Animals circle.","Therefore, the Lion circle is automatically inside the Animals circle (Conclusion I is true).","Since Cats are inside the larger Animals circle, it means some portion of the Animals circle is occupied by Cats (Conclusion II is true).","Hence, both conclusions follow."],"pattern":"Concentric Circle Syllogism (A+A).","elimination":"Inner-to-outer verifies ''All'' (All Lions are Animals). Outer-to-inner verifies ''Some'' (Some Animals are Cats). Both follow logic perfectly.","memoryTip":"If A is subset of B, and B is subset of C. Then A is subset of C, and C has some elements of B."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('fzyxtjTCmWTHoO_P3N1XC', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'एक शाम, राम और श्याम एक-दूसरे के आमने-सामने खड़े होकर बात कर रहे थे। यदि राम की परछाई ठीक उसके दायीं ओर पड़ रही थी, तो श्याम किस दिशा की ओर मुँह किये हुए था?', '"[\"1) उत्तर / North\",\"2) दक्षिण / South\",\"3) पूर्व / East\",\"4) पश्चिम / West\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 18, 'General', 'One evening, Ram and Shyam were talking to each other face to face. If Ram''s shadow was falling exactly to his right, which direction was Shyam facing?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["शाम के समय, सूर्य पश्चिम (West) में होता है।","इसलिए, परछाई हमेशा पूर्व (East) दिशा में पड़ती है।","प्रश्न कहता है: राम की परछाई उसके दायीं (Right) ओर है। इसका अर्थ है राम का दायां हाथ पूर्व दिशा में है।","यदि दायां हाथ पूर्व में है, तो राम का मुँह उत्तर (North) की ओर होगा।","चूँकि वे आमने-सामने (face to face) खड़े हैं, श्याम राम की विपरीत दिशा में देख रहा है।","अतः, श्याम दक्षिण (South) की ओर देख रहा है।"],"chainEn":["In the evening, the sun is in the West.","Therefore, the shadow always falls towards the East.","The question says: Ram''s shadow is to his right. This means Ram''s right hand points East.","If the right hand points East, Ram must be facing North.","Since they are standing face to face, Shyam is facing the opposite direction of Ram.","Thus, Shyam is facing South."],"pattern":"Evening Directional Shadow Logic.","elimination":"Evening shadow -> East. Right=East means facing North (Ram). Shyam faces the opposite, so South.","memoryTip":"Evening rules: Shadow Right = Facing North. Shadow Left = Facing South."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('3I9xTn1aDPv3fUpNTaDc8', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'एक कूट भाषा में, ''123'' का अर्थ ''Sky is blue'' है और ''24'' का अर्थ ''Blue color'' है। इस कूट भाषा में ''Blue'' के लिए कौन सा अंक प्रयुक्त हुआ है?', '"[\"1) 1 / 1\",\"2) 2 / 2\",\"3) 3 / 3\",\"4) 4 / 4\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 19, 'General', 'In a code language, ''123'' means ''Sky is blue'' and ''24'' means ''Blue color''. Which digit is used for ''Blue'' in this language?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["वाक्य 1: ''123'' = ''Sky is blue''","वाक्य 2: ''24'' = ''Blue color''","दोनों वाक्यों में शब्दों की तुलना करें: ''Blue'' शब्द दोनों में उभयनिष्ठ (Common) है।","अब दोनों के अंकों की तुलना करें: अंक ''2'' दोनों में उभयनिष्ठ है।","अतः, ''Blue'' के लिए कूट ''2'' है।"],"chainEn":["Sentence 1: ''123'' = ''Sky is blue''","Sentence 2: ''24'' = ''Blue color''","Compare the words in both sentences: the word ''Blue'' is common to both.","Now compare the digits: the digit ''2'' is common to both.","Therefore, the code for ''Blue'' is ''2''."],"pattern":"Direct Intersection Coding.","elimination":"The only digit appearing in both sequences is 2. The only word appearing in both phrases is ''Blue''. Match them directly.","memoryTip":"Don''t assume positional matching (e.g., first word = first number). Always look for common intersections."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('IW1ZkXRg1PIeCAEdvpV5C', 'lECKT-fYtCVL98Z7PStF7', 'एक लड़की की तस्वीर की ओर इशारा करते हुए एक आदमी ने कहा, ''इसकी माँ मेरे पिता के इकलौते बेटे की पत्नी है।'' वह आदमी उस लड़की से किस प्रकार संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) चाचा / Uncle\",\"2) दादा / Grandfather\",\"3) भाई / Brother\",\"4) पिता / Father\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 20, 'General', 'Pointing to a photograph of a girl, a man said, ''Her mother is the wife of my father''s only son.'' How is the man related to the girl?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["आदमी कह रहा है: ''मेरे पिता का इकलौता बेटा'' (my father''s only son)।","एक आदमी के लिए ''उसके पिता का इकलौता बेटा'' वह स्वयं (He himself) होता है।","अब वाक्य बन जाता है: ''इसकी माँ मेरी पत्नी है'' (Her mother is my wife)।","यदि उस लड़की की माँ उस आदमी की पत्नी है, तो वह आदमी उस लड़की का पिता (Father) होगा।"],"chainEn":["The man says: ''my father''s only son''.","For a man, ''his father''s only son'' is he himself.","Now the sentence becomes: ''Her mother is my wife''.","If the girl''s mother is the man''s wife, then the man must be the father of the girl."],"pattern":"Self-referencing relationship deduction.","elimination":"''My father''s only son'' instantly resolves to ''Me''. The husband of the girl''s mother is her father. Option 4 is the only logical choice.","memoryTip":"Always translate ''my father''s only son'' (if speaker is male) to ''Myself'' before reading the rest of the sentence."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('g1zmyL6XH5mbprTNAdo07', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'प्रथम 25 विषम प्राकृत संख्याओं (Odd Natural Numbers) का योग क्या है?', '"[\"1) 500\",\"2) 600\",\"3) 625\",\"4) 650\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'What is the sum of the first 25 odd natural numbers?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["प्रथम ''n'' विषम प्राकृत संख्याओं का योग हमेशा n² होता है।","यहाँ n = 25 दिया गया है।","योग = 25²","योग = 25 × 25 = 625"],"stepsEn":["The sum of the first ''n'' odd natural numbers is always n².","Here n = 25 is given.","Sum = 25²","Sum = 25 × 25 = 625"],"shortcut":"सीधे n² सूत्र का उपयोग करें: 25² = 625।","trap":"छात्र n(n+1)/2 (प्राकृत संख्याओं का योग) का उपयोग कर सकते हैं और गलत उत्तर दे सकते हैं। / Students might use n(n+1)/2 (sum of natural numbers) and get the wrong answer.","memoryTip":"विषम (Odd) के लिए: n² | सम (Even) के लिए: n(n+1) | प्राकृत (Natural) के लिए: n(n+1)/2"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('LBtMJeTc-xukAkLGgb1iP', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'यदि किसी वस्तु के क्रय मूल्य (CP) और विक्रय मूल्य (SP) का अनुपात 5:6 है, तो लाभ प्रतिशत क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 15%\",\"2) 20%\",\"3) 25%\",\"4) 30%\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'If the ratio of the cost price (CP) and selling price (SP) of an article is 5:6, what will be the profit percentage?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["क्रय मूल्य (CP) और विक्रय मूल्य (SP) का अनुपात = 5 : 6","मान लें CP = 5 इकाई और SP = 6 इकाई।","लाभ = SP - CP = 6 - 5 = 1 इकाई।","लाभ प्रतिशत = (लाभ / CP) × 100","लाभ % = (1 / 5) × 100 = 20%"],"stepsEn":["Ratio of Cost Price (CP) and Selling Price (SP) = 5 : 6","Let CP = 5 units and SP = 6 units.","Profit = SP - CP = 6 - 5 = 1 unit.","Profit percentage = (Profit / CP) × 100","Profit % = (1 / 5) × 100 = 20%"],"shortcut":"1 इकाई का लाभ 5 पर। 1/5 का प्रतिशत मान सीधे 20% होता है।","trap":"छात्र 1/6 (SP पर लाभ) मानकर 16.66% निकाल सकते हैं। / Students might calculate 1/6 (profit on SP) and get 16.66%.","memoryTip":"लाभ और हानि की गणना हमेशा क्रय मूल्य (CP) पर की जाती है। / Profit and loss are always calculated on the Cost Price (CP)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('G3KWo8CTGt4ZVCf8hUjX4', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'यदि x + y = 10 और xy = 24 है, तो x² + y² का मान क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 52\",\"2) 62\",\"3) 76\",\"4) 100\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'If x + y = 10 and xy = 24, what will be the value of x² + y²?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["बीजगणितीय सर्वसमिका (Algebraic Identity): (x + y)² = x² + y² + 2xy","दिए गए मान रखें: (10)² = x² + y² + 2(24)","100 = x² + y² + 48","x² + y² = 100 - 48","x² + y² = 52"],"stepsEn":["Algebraic Identity: (x + y)² = x² + y² + 2xy","Put the given values: (10)² = x² + y² + 2(24)","100 = x² + y² + 48","x² + y² = 100 - 48","x² + y² = 52"],"shortcut":"मान रखकर (Hit & Trial): 6 + 4 = 10 और 6 × 4 = 24। इसलिए x=6, y=4। 6² + 4² = 36 + 16 = 52।","trap":"छात्र सीधे 10² कर सकते हैं और 100 उत्तर दे सकते हैं। / Students might directly do 10² and answer 100.","memoryTip":"a² + b² निकालने के लिए (a+b)² में से हमेशा 2ab घटाएं। / To find a² + b², always subtract 2ab from (a+b)²."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Kxt12WQ3cGGNaoCH8hMLY', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'किसी धनराशि पर साधारण ब्याज, मूलधन का 1/16 है। यदि ब्याज दर का प्रतिशत और समय (वर्षों में) संख्यात्मक रूप से समान हैं, तो वार्षिक ब्याज दर क्या है?', '"[\"1) 2.5%\",\"2) 4%\",\"3) 5%\",\"4) 6.25%\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'The simple interest on a sum of money is 1/16 of the principal. If the numerical value of the rate of interest and the time (in years) is equal, what is the annual rate of interest?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मान लें मूलधन (P) = P, तो साधारण ब्याज (SI) = P/16।","दिया है: दर (R) = समय (T)। मान लें दोनों R हैं।","सूत्र: SI = (P × R × T) / 100","P / 16 = (P × R × R) / 100","P कट जाएगा। R² = 100 / 16","R = √(100 / 16) = 10 / 4 = 2.5%"],"stepsEn":["Let Principal (P) = P, then Simple Interest (SI) = P/16.","Given: Rate (R) = Time (T). Let both be R.","Formula: SI = (P × R × T) / 100","P / 16 = (P × R × R) / 100","P is cancelled. R² = 100 / 16","R = √(100 / 16) = 10 / 4 = 2.5%"],"shortcut":"दर (Rate) = √(भिन्नात्मक मान × 100) = √(1/16 × 100) = 10/4 = 2.5।","trap":"छात्र वर्गमूल (square root) निकालना भूल सकते हैं और 100/16 = 6.25% उत्तर दे सकते हैं। / Students might forget to take the square root and answer 100/16 = 6.25%.","memoryTip":"जब भी R = T हो और ब्याज P का ''a/b'' हो, तो सीधा सूत्र √(a/b × 100) लगाएं। / Whenever R = T and SI is ''a/b'' of P, directly use formula √(a/b × 100)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('rFVNqUelHEmWVVep-8pTN', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'एक संख्या में पहले 20% की वृद्धि की जाती है और फिर 20% की कमी की जाती है। संख्या में शुद्ध प्रतिशत परिवर्तन क्या है?', '"[\"1) 4% वृद्धि / 4% Increase\",\"2) 4% कमी / 4% Decrease\",\"3) 0% परिवर्तन / 0% Change\",\"4) 2% कमी / 2% Decrease\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'A number is first increased by 20% and then decreased by 20%. What is the net percentage change in the number?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मान लें कि प्रारंभिक संख्या 100 है।","20% वृद्धि के बाद: 100 + 20 = 120","अब 120 पर 20% की कमी की जाती है: 120 का 20% = 24","कमी के बाद संख्या = 120 - 24 = 96","प्रारंभिक संख्या 100 थी, अब 96 है। अतः 4% की कमी हुई।"],"stepsEn":["Let the initial number be 100.","After 20% increase: 100 + 20 = 120","Now 20% decrease on 120: 20% of 120 = 24","Number after decrease = 120 - 24 = 96","Initial was 100, now 96. Hence a 4% decrease."],"shortcut":"समान वृद्धि और कमी के लिए हमेशा x²/100 प्रतिशत की कमी होती है। 20²/100 = 400/100 = 4% कमी।","trap":"छात्र +20% और -20% को जोड़कर 0% सोच सकते हैं। / Students might add +20% and -20% and think it''s 0%.","memoryTip":"समान x% वृद्धि और x% कमी का परिणाम हमेशा (x²/100)% की ''हानि/कमी'' होता है। / Equal x% increase and x% decrease always results in (x²/100)% ''loss/decrease''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('m9KYK1hCV1WHA5q7A_Nfy', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', '250 मीटर लंबी एक ट्रेन 150 मीटर लंबे पुल को 20 सेकंड में पार करती है। ट्रेन की गति किमी/घंटा में क्या है?', '"[\"1) 54 किमी/घंटा / 54 km/hr\",\"2) 60 किमी/घंटा / 60 km/hr\",\"3) 72 किमी/घंटा / 72 km/hr\",\"4) 90 किमी/घंटा / 90 km/hr\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'A 250 m long train crosses a 150 m long bridge in 20 seconds. What is the speed of the train in km/hr?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["पुल को पार करते समय कुल दूरी = ट्रेन की लंबाई + पुल की लंबाई","कुल दूरी = 250 + 150 = 400 मीटर।","लिया गया समय = 20 सेकंड।","गति (मीटर/सेकंड में) = कुल दूरी / समय = 400 / 20 = 20 मीटर/सेकंड।","इसे किमी/घंटा में बदलने के लिए 18/5 से गुणा करें: 20 × (18 / 5) = 4 × 18 = 72 किमी/घंटा।"],"stepsEn":["Total distance while crossing a bridge = Length of train + Length of bridge","Total distance = 250 + 150 = 400 meters.","Time taken = 20 seconds.","Speed (in m/s) = Total distance / Time = 400 / 20 = 20 m/s.","Multiply by 18/5 to convert into km/hr: 20 × (18 / 5) = 4 × 18 = 72 km/hr."],"shortcut":"गति = (400 / 20) × (18/5) = 72।","trap":"छात्र पुल की लंबाई को जोड़ना भूल सकते हैं और केवल 250/20 का उपयोग कर सकते हैं। / Students might forget to add the bridge length and use only 250/20.","memoryTip":"पुल (Bridge), प्लेटफॉर्म (Platform), या दूसरी ट्रेन को पार करने पर दोनों की लंबाइयां जुड़ती हैं। / When crossing a bridge, platform, or another train, lengths are always added."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('kjnaugSl8LIz0YZwCiaMq', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'एक घन (Cube) का आयतन 512 सेमी³ है। इसका संपूर्ण पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल (Total Surface Area) ज्ञात कीजिए।', '"[\"1) 256 cm²\",\"2) 384 cm²\",\"3) 512 cm²\",\"4) 768 cm²\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'The volume of a cube is 512 cm³. Find its Total Surface Area.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["घन का आयतन = a³ (जहाँ a भुजा है)।","a³ = 512","a = ³√512 = 8 सेमी। (घन की भुजा 8 सेमी है)।","घन का संपूर्ण पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल = 6a²","क्षेत्रफल = 6 × (8)²","क्षेत्रफल = 6 × 64 = 384 सेमी²।"],"stepsEn":["Volume of cube = a³ (where a is the side).","a³ = 512","a = ³√512 = 8 cm. (Side of cube is 8 cm).","Total Surface Area of cube = 6a²","Area = 6 × (8)²","Area = 6 × 64 = 384 cm²."],"shortcut":"512 का घनमूल 8। क्षेत्रफल = 6 × 8² = 384।","trap":"छात्र 512 का वर्गमूल निकालने की कोशिश कर सकते हैं या 4a² (वक्र पृष्ठ) लगा सकते हैं। / Students might try to find square root of 512 or apply 4a² (curved surface area).","memoryTip":"आयतन (Volume) = a³ | संपूर्ण पृष्ठ (Total Surface) = 6a² | वक्र पृष्ठ (Curved Surface) = 4a²।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('SOM0Jb7ECXtYh1eumMc3c', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'A और B की वर्तमान आयु का अनुपात 3:4 है। 10 वर्ष बाद उनकी आयु का अनुपात 4:5 हो जाएगा। A की वर्तमान आयु क्या है?', '"[\"1) 20 वर्ष / 20 Years\",\"2) 30 वर्ष / 30 Years\",\"3) 40 वर्ष / 40 Years\",\"4) 50 वर्ष / 50 Years\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'The ratio of present ages of A and B is 3:4. After 10 years, the ratio of their ages will be 4:5. What is the present age of A?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["वर्तमान आयु का अनुपात = 3:4","10 वर्ष बाद अनुपात = 4:5","दोनों के अनुपातों में लंबवत अंतर जाँचें: 4 - 3 = 1 इकाई, 5 - 4 = 1 इकाई।","अनुपात का 1 इकाई का अंतर 10 वर्षों के बराबर है। (1 इकाई = 10 वर्ष)","A की वर्तमान आयु 3 इकाई है, इसलिए 3 × 10 = 30 वर्ष।"],"stepsEn":["Present age ratio = 3:4","Ratio after 10 years = 4:5","Check vertical difference for both: 4 - 3 = 1 unit, 5 - 4 = 1 unit.","A difference of 1 unit in ratio corresponds to 10 years. (1 unit = 10 years)","Present age of A is 3 units, so 3 × 10 = 30 years."],"shortcut":"अनुपात का अंतर (1) = वर्षों का अंतर (10)। A = 3 × 10 = 30।","trap":"छात्र B की आयु (40 वर्ष) निकाल सकते हैं और उसे उत्तर मान सकते हैं। / Students might calculate B''s age (40 years) and mark it as the answer.","memoryTip":"यदि अनुपात का अंतर समान हो, तो सीधे इकाई को वर्षों के बराबर कर दें। / If ratio difference is same, equate the unit directly to the years."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('DQdy1mqSAABpIfF99fRcq', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'A की कार्य क्षमता B से 50% अधिक है। यदि A अकेला किसी काम को 12 दिनों में कर सकता है, तो B अकेला उसी काम को कितने दिनों में करेगा?', '"[\"1) 8 दिन / 8 Days\",\"2) 15 दिन / 15 Days\",\"3) 18 दिन / 18 Days\",\"4) 20 दिन / 20 Days\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'A is 50% more efficient than B. If A alone can do a work in 12 days, in how many days will B alone do the same work?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["B की क्षमता को 100% मान लें।","A की क्षमता = 100 + 50 = 150%","क्षमता का अनुपात (A:B) = 150 : 100 = 3 : 2","कुल कार्य = A की क्षमता × A के दिन = 3 × 12 = 36 इकाई।","B द्वारा लिया गया समय = कुल कार्य / B की क्षमता = 36 / 2","B का समय = 18 दिन।"],"stepsEn":["Let B''s efficiency be 100%.","A''s efficiency = 100 + 50 = 150%","Efficiency ratio (A:B) = 150 : 100 = 3 : 2","Total work = A''s efficiency × A''s days = 3 × 12 = 36 units.","Time taken by B = Total work / B''s efficiency = 36 / 2","B''s time = 18 days."],"shortcut":"क्षमता 3:2 है, तो समय का अनुपात 2:3 होगा। 2 इकाई = 12 दिन (1 = 6)। 3 इकाई = 18 दिन।","trap":"छात्र 12 का 50% (6) निकालकर 12+6 = 18 कर सकते हैं। हालांकि उत्तर सही आएगा, पर यह लॉजिक हर जगह काम नहीं करेगा। या 12-6=6 कर सकते हैं। / Students might do +50% of 12 (bad logic) or -50% (6 days).","memoryTip":"दक्षता (Efficiency) हमेशा समय (Time) के व्युत्क्रमानुपाती होती है। (E1 × D1 = E2 × D2)। / Efficiency is inversely proportional to time. (E1 × D1 = E2 × D2)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('xQfQuyxulVudlLtCADRXZ', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'एक व्यक्ति ने ₹5 में 6 की दर से कुछ नींबू खरीदे और ₹6 में 5 की दर से बेच दिए। उसका लाभ प्रतिशत क्या है?', '"[\"1) 22%\",\"2) 30%\",\"3) 44%\",\"4) 50%\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'A person bought some lemons at the rate of 6 for ₹5 and sold them at the rate of 5 for ₹6. What is his profit percentage?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["एक वस्तु का क्रय मूल्य (CP) और विक्रय मूल्य (SP) निकालें।","1 नींबू का CP = 5 / 6 रुपये।","1 नींबू का SP = 6 / 5 रुपये।","अनुपात लें (CP : SP) = (5 / 6) : (6 / 5)","क्रॉस गुणा करें: 25 : 36 (अर्थात CP 25 है और SP 36 है)।","लाभ = 36 - 25 = 11।","लाभ प्रतिशत = (11 / 25) × 100 = 11 × 4 = 44%"],"stepsEn":["Find CP and SP of one item.","CP of 1 lemon = 5 / 6 Rs.","SP of 1 lemon = 6 / 5 Rs.","Take ratio (CP : SP) = (5 / 6) : (6 / 5)","Cross multiply: 25 : 36 (meaning CP is 25 and SP is 36).","Profit = 36 - 25 = 11.","Profit percentage = (11 / 25) × 100 = 11 × 4 = 44%"],"shortcut":"क्रॉस गुणन विधि (Cross-product): CP = 5×5=25, SP = 6×6=36। लाभ = 11। % = 11/25 × 100 = 44%。","trap":"छात्र ₹5 और ₹6 का अंतर निकालकर ₹1 लाभ और 20% उत्तर मान सकते हैं। / Students might take difference of Rs 5 and Rs 6 as Rs 1 profit and assume 20%.","memoryTip":"ऐसे प्रश्नों में हमेशा ''रुपये / वस्तु'' (Rs / Article) लिखकर क्रॉस मल्टीप्लाई करें। / Always write ''Rs / Article'' and cross multiply in such questions."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('6ebitWYHTdULi3wfDtcd4', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'एक पुलिसकर्मी एक चोर को 200 मीटर की दूरी से देखता है। चोर 10 किमी/घंटा और पुलिसकर्मी 12 किमी/घंटा की गति से भागते हैं। पकड़े जाने से पहले चोर कितनी दूरी (मीटर में) तय करेगा?', '"[\"1) 800\",\"2) 1000\",\"3) 1200\",\"4) 1500\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 11, 'General', 'A policeman spots a thief from a distance of 200 meters. The thief runs at 10 km/hr and the policeman at 12 km/hr. What distance (in meters) will the thief cover before being caught?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["चूंकि वे एक ही दिशा में भाग रहे हैं, सापेक्ष गति (Relative Speed) = 12 - 10 = 2 किमी/घंटा।","उनके बीच की दूरी = 200 मीटर = 0.2 किमी।","पकड़ने में लगा समय = दूरी / सापेक्ष गति = 0.2 / 2 = 0.1 घंटे।","इस 0.1 घंटे में चोर द्वारा तय की गई दूरी = चोर की गति × समय","दूरी = 10 किमी/घंटा × 0.1 घंटे = 1 किमी = 1000 मीटर।"],"stepsEn":["Since they run in the same direction, Relative Speed = 12 - 10 = 2 km/hr.","Distance between them = 200 meters = 0.2 km.","Time taken to catch = Distance / Relative Speed = 0.2 / 2 = 0.1 hours.","Distance covered by thief in this 0.1 hour = Thief''s speed × time","Distance = 10 km/hr × 0.1 hours = 1 km = 1000 meters."],"shortcut":"दूरियों का अनुपात गतियों के अनुपात (10:12 = 5:6) के बराबर होता है। अंतर 1 = 200m। चोर (5) = 5 × 200 = 1000m।","trap":"छात्र पुलिसकर्मी द्वारा तय की गई दूरी (1200m) निकाल सकते हैं। / Students might calculate the distance covered by the policeman (1200m).","memoryTip":"समान समय के लिए, दूरी सीधे गति के समानुपाती (Directly Proportional) होती है। D1/D2 = S1/S2। / For equal time, distance is directly proportional to speed. D1/D2 = S1/S2."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('yhng2Nr5R1yiDhubkogaQ', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'कोई धनराशि चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज (Compound Interest) की दर से 3 वर्षों में स्वयं की 8 गुनी हो जाती है। वार्षिक ब्याज की दर क्या है?', '"[\"1) 50%\",\"2) 100%\",\"3) 150%\",\"4) 200%\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 12, 'General', 'A sum of money becomes 8 times of itself in 3 years at compound interest. What is the annual rate of interest?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मिश्रधन (A) = 8P, मूलधन = P, समय (T) = 3 वर्ष।","सूत्र: A = P(1 + R/100)^T","8P = P(1 + R/100)³","8 = (1 + R/100)³","दोनों तरफ का घनमूल (Cube root) लेने पर: ³√8 = 1 + R/100","2 = 1 + R/100 => 1 = R/100 => R = 100%"],"stepsEn":["Amount (A) = 8P, Principal = P, Time (T) = 3 years.","Formula: A = P(1 + R/100)^T","8P = P(1 + R/100)³","8 = (1 + R/100)³","Taking cube root on both sides: ³√8 = 1 + R/100","2 = 1 + R/100 => 1 = R/100 => R = 100%"],"shortcut":"R = [ (गुना)^(1/T) - 1 ] × 100 = [ 8^(1/3) - 1 ] × 100 = (2 - 1) × 100 = 100%。","trap":"छात्र इसे साधारण ब्याज (SI) का प्रश्न मानकर सूत्र 100(n-1)/T लगाकर 233.3% उत्तर निकाल सकते हैं। / Students might treat it as SI and apply 100(n-1)/T to get 233.3%.","memoryTip":"चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज (CI) में 3 वर्ष के लिए घनमूल (Cube root) और 2 वर्ष के लिए वर्गमूल (Square root) लेते हैं। / In CI, take cube root for 3 years and square root for 2 years."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('nOila953OyW53NVfiS7S_', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'दो संख्याओं का महत्तम समापवर्तक (HCF) 11 है और लघुत्तम समापवर्त्य (LCM) 693 है। यदि एक संख्या 77 है, तो दूसरी संख्या क्या है?', '"[\"1) 66\",\"2) 88\",\"3) 99\",\"4) 121\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 13, 'General', 'The HCF of two numbers is 11 and their LCM is 693. If one number is 77, what is the other number?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["सूत्र: पहली संख्या × दूसरी संख्या = HCF × LCM","77 × दूसरी संख्या = 11 × 693","दूसरी संख्या = (11 × 693) / 77","11 से 77 को 7 बार काटें। (77 / 11 = 7)","दूसरी संख्या = 693 / 7","दूसरी संख्या = 99"],"stepsEn":["Formula: First Number × Second Number = HCF × LCM","77 × Second number = 11 × 693","Second number = (11 × 693) / 77","Cancel 77 by 11 by 7 times. (77 / 11 = 7)","Second number = 693 / 7","Second number = 99"],"shortcut":"X = (11 × 693) / 77 = 693 / 7 = 99।","trap":"छात्र गुणा करने में गलती कर सकते हैं, इसलिए पहले काटना (Cancel out) बेहतर होता है। / Students might make multiplication errors, so cancelling out first is better.","memoryTip":"हमेशा याद रखें: N1 × N2 = LCM × HCF"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Of45_xWNMjFNlOEWgI72Z', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'एक समबाहु त्रिभुज (Equilateral Triangle) का क्षेत्रफल 16√3 सेमी² है। इसका परिमाप (Perimeter) ज्ञात कीजिए।', '"[\"1) 12 सेमी / 12 cm\",\"2) 16 सेमी / 16 cm\",\"3) 24 सेमी / 24 cm\",\"4) 32 सेमी / 32 cm\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 14, 'General', 'The area of an equilateral triangle is 16√3 cm². Find its perimeter.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["समबाहु त्रिभुज का क्षेत्रफल = (√3 / 4) × भुजा²","दिया है: (√3 / 4) × a² = 16√3","दोनों तरफ से √3 कट जाएगा।","a² / 4 = 16","a² = 16 × 4 = 64","a (भुजा) = √64 = 8 सेमी।","परिमाप = 3 × भुजा = 3 × 8 = 24 सेमी।"],"stepsEn":["Area of Equilateral Triangle = (√3 / 4) × side²","Given: (√3 / 4) × a² = 16√3","√3 gets cancelled from both sides.","a² / 4 = 16","a² = 16 × 4 = 64","a (side) = √64 = 8 cm.","Perimeter = 3 × side = 3 × 8 = 24 cm."],"shortcut":"√3 से √3 कटा। a² = 64, a = 8। परिमाप = 24।","trap":"छात्र भुजा (8) को ही उत्तर मान सकते हैं, जबकि परिमाप पूछा गया है। / Students might mark the side (8) as the answer, whereas perimeter is asked.","memoryTip":"समबाहु त्रिभुज: क्षेत्रफल = (√3/4)a², परिमाप = 3a, ऊँचाई = (√3/2)a। / Equilateral: Area = (√3/4)a², Perimeter = 3a, Height = (√3/2)a."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('GGQJp6HIeGMauhU2kYCVe', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'एक सम षट्भुज (Regular Hexagon) के सभी आंतरिक कोणों (Interior Angles) का योग क्या होता है?', '"[\"1) 540°\",\"2) 720°\",\"3) 900°\",\"4) 1080°\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 15, 'General', 'What is the sum of all the interior angles of a regular hexagon?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["किसी बहुभुज (Polygon) के आंतरिक कोणों का योग निकालने का सूत्र = (n - 2) × 180°","यहाँ षट्भुज (Hexagon) की 6 भुजाएँ होती हैं, इसलिए n = 6।","योग = (6 - 2) × 180°","योग = 4 × 180°","योग = 720°"],"stepsEn":["Formula for sum of interior angles of a polygon = (n - 2) × 180°","Here a hexagon has 6 sides, so n = 6.","Sum = (6 - 2) × 180°","Sum = 4 × 180°","Sum = 720°"],"shortcut":"त्रिभुज 180, चतुर्भुज 360, पंचभुज 540, षट्भुज 720 (हर भुजा बढ़ने पर 180 जोड़ें)।","trap":"छात्र बाह्य कोणों (Exterior angles) का योग 360° सोचकर कनफ्यूज हो सकते हैं। / Students might confuse it with the sum of exterior angles which is 360°.","memoryTip":"आंतरिक कोणों का योग (Sum of Interior Angles) = (n - 2) × 180°। बाह्य कोणों का योग = हमेशा 360°। / Sum of interior = (n-2)*180. Sum of exterior = always 360."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Isy52oYOttO8QG1rJ9frX', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'दूध और पानी के 40 लीटर मिश्रण में दूध और पानी का अनुपात 3:1 है। मिश्रण में कितना पानी और मिलाया जाए कि यह अनुपात 1:1 हो जाए?', '"[\"1) 10 लीटर / 10 L\",\"2) 15 लीटर / 15 L\",\"3) 20 लीटर / 20 L\",\"4) 25 लीटर / 25 L\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 16, 'General', 'In a 40 liter mixture of milk and water, the ratio of milk to water is 3:1. How much more water should be added to the mixture so that this ratio becomes 1:1?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["40 लीटर में दूध = (3/4) × 40 = 30 लीटर","पानी = (1/4) × 40 = 10 लीटर","अनुपात को 1:1 करने का मतलब है कि दूध और पानी की मात्रा बराबर होनी चाहिए।","दूध की मात्रा 30 लीटर है (जो नहीं बदलेगी), इसलिए पानी को भी 30 लीटर होना चाहिए।","वर्तमान पानी 10 लीटर है।","मिलाया जाने वाला पानी = 30 - 10 = 20 लीटर।"],"stepsEn":["Milk in 40 L = (3/4) × 40 = 30 Liters","Water = (1/4) × 40 = 10 Liters","Making ratio 1:1 means milk and water quantities should be equal.","Milk is 30 L (which won''t change), so water must also become 30 L.","Current water is 10 L.","Water to be added = 30 - 10 = 20 Liters."],"shortcut":"दूध 3 है, पानी 1 है। 1:1 के लिए पानी को भी 3 होना पड़ेगा। मतलब 2 इकाई पानी मिलाना है। 4 इकाई (3+1) = 40L, तो 2 इकाई = 20L।","trap":"छात्र 3:1 को 1:3 समझकर अलग उत्तर निकाल सकते हैं। / Students might read 3:1 as 1:3 and get a different answer.","memoryTip":"1:1 का अर्थ है दोनों की मात्रा को समान करना। जो नहीं मिलाया जा रहा है, उसके बराबर दूसरे को कर दें। / 1:1 means equalizing both. Make the changing part equal to the constant part."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('uNTxw6qBD6keHNOYRu6Rl', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', '10 संख्याओं का औसत 25 है। यदि प्रत्येक संख्या को 3 से गुणा किया जाए, तो नया औसत क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 25\",\"2) 50\",\"3) 75\",\"4) 100\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 17, 'General', 'The average of 10 numbers is 25. If each number is multiplied by 3, what will be the new average?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["औसत का यह एक गुण (Property) है कि यदि प्रत्येक संख्या में कोई गणितीय क्रिया (जोड़, घटाव, गुणा, भाग) की जाती है, तो औसत में भी वही क्रिया लागू होती है।","यहाँ प्रत्येक संख्या को 3 से गुणा किया गया है।","अतः, नया औसत = पुराना औसत × 3","नया औसत = 25 × 3 = 75।"],"stepsEn":["It''s a property of averages that if a mathematical operation (add, subtract, multiply, divide) is performed on each number, the same operation applies to the average.","Here each number is multiplied by 3.","Hence, New Average = Old Average × 3","New Average = 25 × 3 = 75."],"shortcut":"प्रत्येक में परिवर्तन = औसत में परिवर्तन। 25 × 3 = 75।","trap":"छात्र पहले 10 से गुणा करके योग (250) निकाल सकते हैं और लंबी गणना में उलझ सकते हैं। / Students might find sum (250) first and get tangled in long calculations.","memoryTip":"प्रत्येक संख्या में (±, ×, ÷) = औसत में (±, ×, ÷)। / Change in each number (±, ×, ÷) = Same change in Average."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('4kN7MagWPIfc6LbM5ziM6', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'A किसी काम को 12 दिनों में और B उसी काम को 15 दिनों में कर सकता है। C की सहायता से वे उस काम को 5 दिनों में पूरा कर लेते हैं। C अकेला उस काम को कितने दिनों में करेगा?', '"[\"1) 10 दिन / 10 Days\",\"2) 15 दिन / 15 Days\",\"3) 20 दिन / 20 Days\",\"4) 25 दिन / 25 Days\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 18, 'General', 'A can do a piece of work in 12 days and B can do the same work in 15 days. With the help of C, they complete the work in 5 days. In how many days will C alone do the work?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["कुल कार्य = 12, 15 और 5 का LCM = 60 इकाई।","A की क्षमता = 60 / 12 = 5 इकाई/दिन","B की क्षमता = 60 / 15 = 4 इकाई/दिन","तीनों (A+B+C) की कुल क्षमता = 60 / 5 = 12 इकाई/दिन","C की क्षमता = (A+B+C) - A - B = 12 - 5 - 4 = 3 इकाई/दिन।","C द्वारा लिया गया समय = कुल कार्य / C की क्षमता = 60 / 3 = 20 दिन।"],"stepsEn":["Total work = LCM of 12, 15 and 5 = 60 units.","A''s efficiency = 60 / 12 = 5 units/day","B''s efficiency = 60 / 15 = 4 units/day","Total efficiency of (A+B+C) = 60 / 5 = 12 units/day","C''s efficiency = (A+B+C) - A - B = 12 - 5 - 4 = 3 units/day.","Time taken by C = Total work / C''s efficiency = 60 / 3 = 20 days."],"shortcut":"C की क्षमता 12 - 9 = 3। 60/3 = 20 दिन।","trap":"छात्र C को काम बिगाड़ने वाला (Negative work) मान सकते हैं, जबकि वह ''सहायता'' कर रहा है। / Students might treat C as negative worker, whereas he is ''helping''.","memoryTip":"A+B+C की क्षमता में से A और B की क्षमता घटाकर हमेशा C की क्षमता निकालें। / Always subtract efficiency of A and B from A+B+C to get C''s efficiency."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('x-M0-2LHecyECjP7H2hUA', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'एक चुनाव में दो उम्मीदवार थे। एक उम्मीदवार को 40% वोट मिले और वह 298 वोटों से हार गया। चुनाव में कुल कितने वोट डाले गए थे?', '"[\"1) 1400\",\"2) 1490\",\"3) 1500\",\"4) 1600\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 19, 'General', 'In an election there were two candidates. One candidate got 40% votes and lost by 298 votes. How many total votes were cast in the election?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["कुल वोट 100% मान लें।","हारने वाले को 40% वोट मिले।","जीतने वाले को (100% - 40%) = 60% वोट मिले।","हार-जीत का अंतर = 60% - 40% = 20%।","यह 20% अंतर 298 वोटों के बराबर है। (20% = 298)","कुल वोट (100%) = (298 / 20) × 100 = 298 × 5 = 1490।"],"stepsEn":["Assume total votes as 100%.","Loser got 40% votes.","Winner got (100% - 40%) = 60% votes.","Margin of defeat/win = 60% - 40% = 20%.","This 20% margin is equal to 298 votes. (20% = 298)","Total votes (100%) = (298 / 20) × 100 = 298 × 5 = 1490."],"shortcut":"20% = 298. 100% के लिए 5 से गुणा करें: 298 × 5 = 1490।","trap":"छात्र 40% को 298 के बराबर रख सकते हैं, जबकि 298 अंतर (Margin) है। / Students might equate 40% to 298, whereas 298 is the margin.","memoryTip":"हार या जीत का मतलब हमेशा दोनों उम्मीदवारों के % का ''अंतर'' होता है। / Defeat or Win always implies the ''Difference'' of % between the two candidates."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('0XBVeNXoZ81jhWzYlqaXG', '90O4fr3rOFCbFvQh8446N', 'यदि किसी वृत्त (Circle) की त्रिज्या में 10% की वृद्धि की जाती है, तो उसके क्षेत्रफल में कितने प्रतिशत की वृद्धि होगी?', '"[\"1) 10%\",\"2) 20%\",\"3) 21%\",\"4) 100%\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 20, 'General', 'If the radius of a circle is increased by 10%, by what percentage will its area increase?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["वृत्त का क्षेत्रफल πr² होता है, जिसका अर्थ है कि क्षेत्रफल त्रिज्या (r) पर दो बार निर्भर करता है (r × r)।","क्रमिक प्रतिशत परिवर्तन (Successive Percentage Change) का सूत्र: x + y + (xy / 100)","यहाँ x = 10 और y = 10 है।","वृद्धि = 10 + 10 + (10 × 10) / 100","वृद्धि = 20 + 1 = 21%"],"stepsEn":["Area of circle is πr², which means area depends on radius (r) twice (r × r).","Successive Percentage Change formula: x + y + (xy / 100)","Here x = 10 and y = 10.","Increase = 10 + 10 + (10 × 10) / 100","Increase = 20 + 1 = 21%"],"shortcut":"10% वृद्धि मतलब 10 से 11। क्षेत्रफल में 100 से 121। सीधा 21% वृद्धि।","trap":"छात्र सीधे 10% देखकर क्षेत्रफल में भी 10% (या 10+10=20%) की वृद्धि सोच सकते हैं। / Students might see 10% and think area also increases by 10% (or 10+10=20%).","memoryTip":"2D आकृतियों (क्षेत्रफल) में हमेशा 2 सक्सेसिव बदलाव होते हैं, और 3D (आयतन) में 3 सक्सेसिव बदलाव होते हैं। / In 2D shapes (Area) there are 2 successive changes, in 3D (Volume) there are 3."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('KZC6-gEAHcAAoCM29bC2X', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', 'A किसी काम को 20 दिनों में और B 30 दिनों में कर सकता है। दोनों ने मिलकर 4 दिन काम किया और फिर A ने काम छोड़ दिया। शेष काम B अकेले कितने दिनों में करेगा?', '"[\"1) 15 दिन / 15 Days\",\"2) 18 दिन / 18 Days\",\"3) 20 दिन / 20 Days\",\"4) 24 दिन / 24 Days\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'A can do a piece of work in 20 days and B in 30 days. They work together for 4 days and then A leaves. In how many days will B alone finish the remaining work?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["कुल कार्य = 20 और 30 का LCM = 60 इकाई।","A की कार्य क्षमता = 60 / 20 = 3 इकाई/दिन।","B की कार्य क्षमता = 60 / 30 = 2 इकाई/दिन।","4 दिनों में दोनों द्वारा किया गया कार्य = (3 + 2) × 4 = 5 × 4 = 20 इकाई।","शेष कार्य = 60 - 20 = 40 इकाई।","B द्वारा शेष कार्य को पूरा करने में लगा समय = 40 / 2 = 20 दिन।"],"stepsEn":["Total work = LCM of 20 and 30 = 60 units.","Efficiency of A = 60 / 20 = 3 units/day.","Efficiency of B = 60 / 30 = 2 units/day.","Work done by both in 4 days = (3 + 2) × 4 = 5 × 4 = 20 units.","Remaining work = 60 - 20 = 40 units.","Time taken by B to finish remaining work = 40 / 2 = 20 days."],"shortcut":"कुल काम 60. 4 दिन में (5×4=20) काम हुआ। बचा 40 काम। B(क्षमता 2) करेगा = 40/2 = 20 दिन।","trap":"छात्र पूरे काम का समय (24 दिन) निकाल सकते हैं, जबकि प्रश्न केवल ''शेष काम'' के बारे में पूछ रहा है। / Students might calculate total time (24 days) whereas the question asks for ''remaining work''.","memoryTip":"काम छोड़ने वाले प्रश्नों में: (कुल काम - हो चुका काम) / जो बच गया उसकी क्षमता। / In leaving work questions: (Total work - Done work) / Efficiency of remaining person."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('k3Z26mO3wvyd48aSKAbPw', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', 'एक दुकानदार एक वस्तु को 15% लाभ पर बेचता है। यदि उसने इसे ₹200 अधिक में बेचा होता, तो उसे 20% का लाभ होता। वस्तु का क्रय मूल्य ज्ञात कीजिए।', '"[\"1) ₹2000\",\"2) ₹3000\",\"3) ₹4000\",\"4) ₹5000\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'A shopkeeper sells an article at 15% profit. Had he sold it for ₹200 more, he would have gained 20%. Find the cost price of the article.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मान लें वस्तु का क्रय मूल्य (CP) 100% है।","प्रारंभिक विक्रय मूल्य (SP1) = 115%","नया विक्रय मूल्य (SP2) = 120%","दोनों विक्रय मूल्यों में अंतर = 120% - 115% = 5%","प्रश्न के अनुसार, यह 5% का अंतर ₹200 के बराबर है।","5% = 200 => 1% = 40","क्रय मूल्य (100%) = 40 × 100 = ₹4000।"],"stepsEn":["Let Cost Price (CP) be 100%.","Initial Selling Price (SP1) = 115%","New Selling Price (SP2) = 120%","Difference in selling prices = 120% - 115% = 5%","As per the question, this 5% difference equals ₹200.","5% = 200 => 1% = 40","Cost Price (100%) = 40 × 100 = ₹4000."],"shortcut":"प्रतिशत का अंतर (20% - 15% = 5%) = 200। 100% के लिए 20 से गुणा करें: 200 × 20 = 4000।","trap":"छात्र 15% और 20% को जोड़ सकते हैं, जो गलत है क्योंकि दोनों ''लाभ'' हैं (समान प्रकृति में घटते हैं)। / Students might add 15% and 20%, which is wrong because both are ''profits'' (same nature subtracts).","memoryTip":"लाभ-लाभ या हानि-हानि = प्रतिशत घटेंगे (-)। लाभ-हानि = प्रतिशत जुड़ेंगे (+)। / Profit-Profit or Loss-Loss = Percentages subtract (-). Profit-Loss = Percentages add (+)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('o6uYHuarjzPg4HlERYkZQ', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', 'तीन ट्रैफिक लाइटें क्रमशः 48, 72 और 108 सेकंड के अंतराल पर बदलती हैं। यदि वे सुबह 8:20:00 बजे एक साथ बदलती हैं, तो वे दोबारा एक साथ कब बदलेंगी?', '"[\"1) 8:25:12 AM\",\"2) 8:27:12 AM\",\"3) 8:28:12 AM\",\"4) 8:30:12 AM\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'Three traffic lights change at intervals of 48, 72 and 108 seconds respectively. If they change simultaneously at 8:20:00 AM, when will they change simultaneously again?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["एक साथ बदलने का समय निकालने के लिए 48, 72 और 108 का लघुत्तम समापवर्त्य (LCM) निकालें।","48 = 16 × 3, 72 = 8 × 9, 108 = 4 × 27","LCM = 16 (2 की अधिकतम घात) × 27 (3 की अधिकतम घात) = 432 सेकंड।","432 सेकंड को मिनटों में बदलें: 432 / 60 = 7 मिनट और 12 सेकंड।","अगली बार एक साथ बदलने का समय = 8:20:00 + 7 मिनट 12 सेकंड = 8:27:12 AM।"],"stepsEn":["To find the simultaneous change time, find the LCM of 48, 72 and 108.","48 = 16 × 3, 72 = 8 × 9, 108 = 4 × 27","LCM = 16 (max power of 2) × 27 (max power of 3) = 432 seconds.","Convert 432 seconds to minutes: 432 / 60 = 7 minutes and 12 seconds.","Next simultaneous change time = 8:20:00 + 7 mins 12 secs = 8:27:12 AM."],"shortcut":"LCM(48, 72, 108) = 432 सेकंड = 7 मिनट 12 सेकंड। 8:20:00 + 7:12 = 8:27:12।","trap":"छात्र सेकंड को मिनट में बदलने में गलती कर सकते हैं या HCF (12) निकाल सकते हैं। / Students might err in converting seconds to minutes or might calculate HCF (12).","memoryTip":"ट्रैफिक लाइट (Traffic Light) और वृत्ताकार धावक (Circular Runner) के प्रश्नों में हमेशा LCM निकालना होता है। / Always calculate LCM in Traffic Light and Circular Runner problems."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('UhlTDAwT6w5I0u_VQkDSq', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', '10 वर्ष पूर्व, पिता की आयु पुत्र की आयु की तिगुनी थी। उनकी वर्तमान आयु का अनुपात 2:1 है। पिता की वर्तमान आयु क्या है?', '"[\"1) 30 वर्ष / 30 Years\",\"2) 40 वर्ष / 40 Years\",\"3) 50 वर्ष / 50 Years\",\"4) 60 वर्ष / 60 Years\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', '10 years ago, a father''s age was thrice the age of his son. The ratio of their present ages is 2:1. What is the present age of the father?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मान लें 10 वर्ष पूर्व, पुत्र की आयु = x और पिता की आयु = 3x थी।","वर्तमान में उनकी आयु: पुत्र = x + 10, पिता = 3x + 10।","वर्तमान अनुपात 2:1 है: (3x + 10) / (x + 10) = 2 / 1","क्रॉस गुणा करें: 1(3x + 10) = 2(x + 10)","3x + 10 = 2x + 20","x = 10","पिता की वर्तमान आयु = 3x + 10 = 3(10) + 10 = 30 + 10 = 40 वर्ष।"],"stepsEn":["Let 10 years ago, Son''s age = x and Father''s age = 3x.","At present: Son = x + 10, Father = 3x + 10.","Present ratio is 2:1: (3x + 10) / (x + 10) = 2 / 1","Cross multiply: 1(3x + 10) = 2(x + 10)","3x + 10 = 2x + 20","x = 10","Father''s present age = 3x + 10 = 3(10) + 10 = 30 + 10 = 40 years."],"shortcut":"अंतर समान करें: पुराना अनुपात 3:1 (अंतर 2), नया 2:1 (अंतर 1)। नए को 2 से गुणा करें: 4:2। पिता 3 से 4 हुआ (1 इकाई की वृद्धि 10 साल में)। पिता की वर्तमान आयु = 4 × 10 = 40।","trap":"छात्र x का मान 10 निकालकर उसे ही वर्तमान आयु मान सकते हैं या 10 साल पहले की आयु (30) उत्तर दे सकते हैं। / Students might take x=10 as answer or give the age 10 years ago (30).","memoryTip":"आयु के अनुपातों के बीच लंबवत अंतर (Vertical Difference) को बराबर करने वाला तरीका सबसे तेज़ होता है। / Equalizing the vertical difference between age ratios is the fastest method."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('5RcSjU7o20Cql7XIxjRaz', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', 'एक आयताकार खेत का परिमाप 82 मीटर है और इसका क्षेत्रफल 400 वर्ग मीटर है। खेत की चौड़ाई (मीटर में) ज्ञात कीजिए।', '"[\"1) 9\",\"2) 16\",\"3) 20\",\"4) 25\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'The perimeter of a rectangular field is 82 meters and its area is 400 square meters. Find the breadth (in meters) of the field.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["परिमाप = 2(L + B) = 82 => L + B = 41","क्षेत्रफल = L × B = 400","हमें ऐसी दो संख्याएँ चाहिए जिनका योग 41 हो और गुणनफल 400 हो।","विकल्पों से जाँचें या गुणनखंड (Factorization) करें: 25 और 16 ऐसी संख्याएँ हैं (25 + 16 = 41, 25 × 16 = 400)।","चूंकि चौड़ाई (Breadth) सामान्यतः लंबाई (Length) से कम होती है, चौड़ाई = 16 मीटर होगी।"],"stepsEn":["Perimeter = 2(L + B) = 82 => L + B = 41","Area = L × B = 400","We need two numbers whose sum is 41 and product is 400.","Check from options or factorize: 25 and 16 are such numbers (25 + 16 = 41, 25 × 16 = 400).","Since Breadth is generally less than Length, Breadth = 16 meters."],"shortcut":"L+B = 41, L*B = 400। विकल्पों में 16 है। यदि B=16, तो L=25 (योग 41)। अतः 16 सही है।","trap":"छात्र 25 भी उत्तर दे सकते हैं, लेकिन 25 लंबाई होगी, चौड़ाई (छोटी भुजा) 16 होगी। / Students might answer 25, but 25 is length, breadth (shorter side) is 16.","memoryTip":"परिमाप के प्रश्नों में हमेशा आधा परिमाप (Half Perimeter) निकाल लें, जो (L + B) के बराबर होता है। / Always calculate Half Perimeter in such questions, which equals (L + B)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('3FVfv2LIMzPrbJuqAHRKD', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', 'किसी धनराशि पर 10% वार्षिक दर से 2 वर्ष का चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज ₹525 है। उसी राशि पर 5% वार्षिक दर से 4 वर्ष का साधारण ब्याज क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) ₹400\",\"2) ₹500\",\"3) ₹600\",\"4) ₹800\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'The compound interest on a sum of money for 2 years at 10% per annum is ₹525. What will be the simple interest on the same sum at 5% per annum for 4 years?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["2 वर्ष के लिए 10% की दर से प्रभावी चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज (CI) = 10 + 10 + (10×10)/100 = 21%","प्रश्न के अनुसार, 21% = ₹525","1% = 525 / 21 = ₹25","अब हमें साधारण ब्याज (SI) निकालना है। दर = 5%, समय = 4 वर्ष।","प्रभावी SI = 5% × 4 = 20%","SI (20%) = 20 × 25 = ₹500।"],"stepsEn":["Effective Compound Interest (CI) for 2 years at 10% = 10 + 10 + (10×10)/100 = 21%","As per the question, 21% = ₹525","1% = 525 / 21 = ₹25","Now we need to find Simple Interest (SI). Rate = 5%, Time = 4 years.","Effective SI = 5% × 4 = 20%","SI (20%) = 20 × 25 = ₹500."],"shortcut":"CI 21% = 525, SI 20% = ? => (525/21) × 20 = 25 × 20 = 500। मूलधन निकालने की जरूरत नहीं।","trap":"छात्र पहले मूलधन (₹2500) निकालने में लंबा समय बर्बाद कर सकते हैं। / Students might waste a long time calculating the Principal (₹2500) first.","memoryTip":"10% की दर से 2 वर्ष का CI हमेशा 21% होता है। इसे सीधा याद रखें। / CI for 2 years at 10% is always 21%. Memorize this."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('RYyP6vLfViXLDsC5J1uES', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', '300 मीटर लंबी एक ट्रेन 90 किमी/घंटा की गति से चल रही है। 200 मीटर लंबे प्लेटफॉर्म को पार करने में इसे कितने सेकंड लगेंगे?', '"[\"1) 15 सेकंड / 15 Seconds\",\"2) 18 सेकंड / 18 Seconds\",\"3) 20 सेकंड / 20 Seconds\",\"4) 25 सेकंड / 25 Seconds\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'A 300 m long train is running at a speed of 90 km/hr. How many seconds will it take to cross a 200 m long platform?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["प्लेटफॉर्म को पार करते समय तय की गई कुल दूरी = ट्रेन की लंबाई + प्लेटफॉर्म की लंबाई","कुल दूरी = 300 + 200 = 500 मीटर।","ट्रेन की गति 90 किमी/घंटा है। इसे मीटर/सेकंड में बदलें।","गति = 90 × (5 / 18) = 5 × 5 = 25 मीटर/सेकंड।","समय = कुल दूरी / गति = 500 / 25","समय = 20 सेकंड।"],"stepsEn":["Total distance covered while crossing a platform = Length of train + Length of platform","Total distance = 300 + 200 = 500 meters.","Train speed is 90 km/hr. Convert it to m/s.","Speed = 90 × (5 / 18) = 5 × 5 = 25 m/s.","Time = Total distance / Speed = 500 / 25","Time = 20 seconds."],"shortcut":"समय = (300 + 200) / (90 × 5/18) = 500 / 25 = 20 सेकंड।","trap":"छात्र प्लेटफॉर्म की लंबाई जोड़ना भूल सकते हैं और केवल 300/25 = 12 सेकंड निकाल सकते हैं। / Students might forget to add platform length and calculate just 300/25 = 12 seconds.","memoryTip":"किमी/घंटा (km/h) को मीटर/सेकंड (m/s) में बदलने के लिए हमेशा 5/18 से गुणा करें। / Always multiply by 5/18 to convert km/h to m/s."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('J8vi8iT37rURuu3IT9AnM', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', '80 लीटर दूध और पानी के मिश्रण में 10% पानी है। नए मिश्रण में पानी को 20% बनाने के लिए इसमें कितना पानी (लीटर में) मिलाया जाना चाहिए?', '"[\"1) 8 लीटर / 8 Liters\",\"2) 10 लीटर / 10 Liters\",\"3) 12 लीटर / 12 Liters\",\"4) 15 लीटर / 15 Liters\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'A mixture of 80 liters of milk and water contains 10% water. How much water (in liters) must be added to make it 20% water in the new mixture?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["प्रारंभिक मिश्रण में पानी 10% है, इसलिए दूध 90% होगा।","दूध की मात्रा = 80 का 90% = 72 लीटर।","चूंकि केवल पानी मिलाया जा रहा है, नए मिश्रण में भी दूध 72 लीटर ही रहेगा।","नए मिश्रण में पानी 20% होना चाहिए, जिसका अर्थ है दूध 80% होगा।","इसलिए, नए मिश्रण का 80% = 72 लीटर।","नया कुल मिश्रण (100%) = (72 / 80) × 100 = 90 लीटर।","मिलाया गया पानी = नया मिश्रण - पुराना मिश्रण = 90 - 80 = 10 लीटर।"],"stepsEn":["In initial mixture, water is 10%, so milk is 90%.","Quantity of milk = 90% of 80 = 72 Liters.","Since only water is added, milk remains 72 Liters in the new mixture.","New mixture needs 20% water, meaning milk will be 80%.","So, 80% of new mixture = 72 Liters.","New total mixture (100%) = (72 / 80) × 100 = 90 Liters.","Water added = New mixture - Old mixture = 90 - 80 = 10 Liters."],"shortcut":"मिलाया गया पानी = (प्रारंभिक मात्रा × % का अंतर) / (100 - नया % पानी) = (80 × 10) / (100 - 20) = 800 / 80 = 10 लीटर।","trap":"छात्र 80 का 10% निकालकर सीधा 8 लीटर जोड़ सकते हैं। / Students might calculate 10% of 80 and add 8 liters directly.","memoryTip":"जो पदार्थ नहीं मिलाया जा रहा है (यहाँ दूध), उसकी मात्रा को दोनों स्थितियों में बराबर कर दें। / Equalize the quantity of the substance that is NOT being added (here Milk)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('aJWxZ5XSYJlINIFngQ0lU', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', '11 परिणामों का औसत 50 है। यदि पहले 6 परिणामों का औसत 49 है और अंतिम 6 परिणामों का औसत 52 है, तो छठा परिणाम क्या है?', '"[\"1) 48\",\"2) 50\",\"3) 52\",\"4) 56\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'The average of 11 results is 50. If the average of the first 6 results is 49 and that of the last 6 is 52, find the 6th result.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["11 परिणामों का कुल योग = 11 × 50 = 550","पहले 6 परिणामों का योग = 6 × 49 = 294","अंतिम 6 परिणामों का योग = 6 × 52 = 312","यदि हम पहले 6 और अंतिम 6 को जोड़ते हैं, तो छठा परिणाम दो बार जुड़ जाता है।","कुल 12 परिणामों का योग = 294 + 312 = 606","छठा परिणाम = (12 परिणामों का योग) - (11 परिणामों का योग)","छठा परिणाम = 606 - 550 = 56।"],"stepsEn":["Total sum of 11 results = 11 × 50 = 550","Sum of first 6 results = 6 × 49 = 294","Sum of last 6 results = 6 × 52 = 312","If we add first 6 and last 6, the 6th result is added twice.","Sum of 12 results = 294 + 312 = 606","6th result = (Sum of 12 results) - (Sum of 11 results)","6th result = 606 - 550 = 56."],"shortcut":"छठा परिणाम = 50 + 6×(-1) + 6×(+2) = 50 - 6 + 12 = 56। (Deviation method)","trap":"छात्र गुणा करने में गलती कर सकते हैं, 606 के बजाय 506 लिख सकते हैं। / Students might make calculation errors, writing 506 instead of 606.","memoryTip":"ओवरलैपिंग (Overlapping) वाले औसत प्रश्नों में, ओवरलैप होने वाली संख्या = (दोनों हिस्सों का योग) - (कुल योग)। / In overlapping average questions, overlapping number = (Sum of both parts) - (Total sum)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('uOFAcbJQF3BsQp93HXIcd', 'kKDi61AuVOfZp18NSph-_', 'एक चुनाव में, एक उम्मीदवार को कुल वैध वोटों का 55% मिला। 20% वोट अवैध (Invalid) घोषित किए गए। यदि कुल वोटों की संख्या 7500 थी, तो दूसरे उम्मीदवार को कितने वैध वोट मिले?', '"[\"1) 2700\",\"2) 2900\",\"3) 3000\",\"4) 3300\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'In an election, a candidate got 55% of the total valid votes. 20% of the votes were declared invalid. If the total number of votes was 7500, how many valid votes did the other candidate get?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["कुल वोट = 7500","अवैध वोट 20% हैं, इसलिए वैध वोट = 7500 का 80%।","वैध वोट = 7500 × (80 / 100) = 6000","जीतने वाले को 55% वैध वोट मिले, तो दूसरे (हारने वाले) उम्मीदवार को (100% - 55%) = 45% वैध वोट मिलेंगे।","दूसरे उम्मीदवार के वोट = 6000 का 45%","वोट = 6000 × (45 / 100) = 60 × 45 = 2700।"],"stepsEn":["Total votes = 7500","Invalid votes are 20%, so valid votes = 80% of 7500.","Valid votes = 7500 × (80 / 100) = 6000","Winner got 55% of valid votes, so the other (loser) candidate will get (100% - 55%) = 45% of valid votes.","Other candidate''s votes = 45% of 6000","Votes = 6000 × (45 / 100) = 60 × 45 = 2700."],"shortcut":"दूसरे उम्मीदवार के वोट = 7500 × 0.80 × 0.45 = 2700 सीधा उत्तर।","trap":"छात्र 55% निकालकर जीतने वाले के वोट (3300) निकाल सकते हैं, जो विकल्प 4 में दिया गया है। / Students might calculate 55% (3300) which is winner''s votes, present in option 4.","memoryTip":"हमेशा ध्यान दें कि प्रश्न में ''किसके'' वोट पूछे गए हैं (विजेता या हारने वाले के)। / Always pay attention to ''whose'' votes are asked in the question (winner or loser)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('3bUltPIG2sQfvIZXZ6NmD', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'मध्य प्रदेश में उत्तर भारत का एकमात्र द्रविड़ शैली (Dravidian Style) में बना मंदिर ''तेली का मंदिर'' कहाँ स्थित है?', '"[\"1) खजुराहो / Khajuraho\",\"2) ओरछा / Orchha\",\"3) ग्वालियर / Gwalior\",\"4) उज्जैन / Ujjain\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'Where is ''Teli Ka Mandir'', the only temple in North India built in the Dravidian style, located in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["तेली का मंदिर ग्वालियर के किले के अंदर स्थित है।","यह उत्तर भारत का एकमात्र ऐसा मंदिर है जिसकी वास्तुकला दक्षिण भारतीय (द्रविड़ शैली) से प्रेरित है।","इसका निर्माण 8वीं-9वीं शताब्दी में गुर्जर-प्रतिहार राजवंश के दौरान हुआ था।"],"factsEn":["Teli Ka Mandir is located inside the Gwalior Fort.","It is the only temple in North India whose architecture is inspired by the South Indian (Dravidian) style.","It was built during the 8th-9th century under the Gurjara-Pratihara dynasty."],"mnemonics":["Dravid in Gwalior (Teli Ka Mandir)"],"related":["सहस्रबाहु (सास-बहू) मंदिर (Sasbahu Temple - Gwalior)","ग्वालियर का किला (Gwalior Fort)"],"memoryTip":"ग्वालियर किले के अंदर ''तेल'' (Teli) का दीया दक्षिण दिशा (Dravidian) की ओर जलता है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('lKs_Pf4iB68svNvSNfKXS', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'चीनी यात्री फाह्यान (Fa-Hien) ने मध्य प्रदेश के किस क्षेत्र की जलवायु को ''विश्व की सर्वश्रेष्ठ जलवायु'' कहा था?', '"[\"1) निमाड़ / Nimar\",\"2) बुंदेलखंड / Bundelkhand\",\"3) मालवा / Malwa\",\"4) बघेलखंड / Baghelkhand\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'The Chinese traveler Fa-Hien had called the climate of which region of Madhya Pradesh the ''best climate in the world''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["चीनी यात्री फाह्यान चंद्रगुप्त द्वितीय (विक्रमादित्य) के शासनकाल में भारत आया था।","उसने मालवा के पठार की जलवायु को समशीतोष्ण (Temperate) होने के कारण ''विश्व की सर्वश्रेष्ठ जलवायु'' कहा था।","मालवा में न तो ज्यादा गर्मी पड़ती है और न ही ज्यादा सर्दी।"],"factsEn":["The Chinese traveler Fa-Hien came to India during the reign of Chandragupta II (Vikramaditya).","He called the climate of the Malwa plateau the ''best climate in the world'' because of its temperate nature.","Malwa experiences neither extreme heat nor extreme cold."],"mnemonics":["Fa-Hien in Malwa (F-M)"],"related":["चंद्रगुप्त विक्रमादित्य (Chandragupta Vikramaditya)","समशीतोष्ण जलवायु (Temperate Climate)"],"memoryTip":"''माल'' (Malwa) अच्छा हो तो वहां की जलवायु फाह्यान को भी अच्छी लगेगी।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('keXOGoK_W4kgxCjz8Kfp2', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'बंदरों और पालतू जानवरों के व्यापार के लिए प्रसिद्ध ''नागाजी का मेला'' मध्य प्रदेश के किस जिले में लगता है?', '"[\"1) भिंड / Bhind\",\"2) श्योपुर / Sheopur\",\"3) मुरैना / Morena\",\"4) दतिया / Datia\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'In which district of Madhya Pradesh is the ''Nagaji Fair'', famous for the trade of monkeys and domestic animals, held?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["नागाजी का मेला मुरैना जिले के पोरसा (Porsa) गाँव में लगता है।","यह मेला मुगल सम्राट अकबर के समय से संत नागाजी की याद में आयोजित किया जा रहा है।","प्राचीन काल में यहाँ बंदरों का व्यापार होता था, अब अन्य पालतू जानवर भी बेचे जाते हैं।"],"factsEn":["The Nagaji fair is held in the Porsa village of the Morena district.","This fair has been organized in memory of Saint Nagaji since the time of Mughal Emperor Akbar.","In ancient times, monkeys were traded here; now other domestic animals are also sold."],"mnemonics":["Nagaji ka Morena (N-M)"],"related":["पोरसा गाँव (Porsa Village)","संत नागाजी (Saint Nagaji)"],"memoryTip":"मुरैना के ''मोर'' और नागाजी के ''बंदर'' दोनों जानवर हैं, ऐसे याद रखें।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('H0LlMnij-3LbZY4FvTCdQ', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'मध्य प्रदेश के पहले गैर-कांग्रेसी मुख्यमंत्री (First Non-Congress CM) कौन थे?', '"[\"1) सुंदरलाल पटवा / Sunderlal Patwa\",\"2) कैलाश जोशी / Kailash Joshi\",\"3) वीरेंद्र कुमार सखलेचा / Virendra Kumar Sakhlecha\",\"4) गोविंद नारायण सिंह / Govind Narayan Singh\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'Who was the first Non-Congress Chief Minister of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["कैलाश जोशी मध्य प्रदेश के पहले गैर-कांग्रेसी मुख्यमंत्री बने थे।","उन्होंने 1977 में जनता पार्टी की सरकार के दौरान मुख्यमंत्री पद की शपथ ली थी।","कैलाश जोशी को ''राजनीति का संत'' (Saint of Politics) भी कहा जाता है।"],"factsEn":["Kailash Joshi became the first Non-Congress Chief Minister of Madhya Pradesh.","He took oath as Chief Minister during the Janata Party government in 1977.","Kailash Joshi is also called the ''Saint of Politics''."],"mnemonics":["Kailash par Naya Daur (1977 Non-Congress Shift)"],"related":["जनता पार्टी (Janata Party)","सुंदरलाल पटवा (Sunderlal Patwa - BJP''s first CM)"],"memoryTip":"राजनीति के ''संत'' (कैलाश जोशी) ही कांग्रेस के लम्बे शासन को पहली बार बदल पाए।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('KQSx2dbgCFI2ACwNxam4e', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'मध्य प्रदेश का कौन सा जिला मुख्य रूप से ''ग्रेफाइट'' (Graphite) खनिज के उत्पादन के लिए जाना जाता है?', '"[\"1) बालाघाट / Balaghat\",\"2) बैतूल / Betul\",\"3) झाबुआ / Jhabua\",\"4) पन्ना / Panna\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'Which district of Madhya Pradesh is mainly known for the production of ''Graphite'' mineral?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मध्य प्रदेश में ग्रेफाइट का उत्पादन मुख्य रूप से बैतूल (Betul) जिले में होता है।","ग्रेफाइट का उपयोग पेंसिल की लीड और बैटरी बनाने में किया जाता है।","बैतूल ''घड़ी बनाने के कारखाने'' और ताप्ती नदी के उद्गम के लिए भी प्रसिद्ध है।"],"factsEn":["The production of graphite in MP mainly takes place in the Betul district.","Graphite is used to make pencil leads and batteries.","Betul is also famous for a ''watch manufacturing factory'' and the origin of the Tapti River."],"mnemonics":["Betul ki Pencil (Betul - Graphite)"],"related":["ताप्ती नदी उद्गम (Tapti River Origin)","बालाघाट (Balaghat - Copper/Manganese)"],"memoryTip":"पेंसिल से लिखते समय अगर गलत हो जाए, तो ''बेत'' (बैतूल) पड़ती है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('iTvyTWuuCO4v3PijU4N0Q', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'मध्य प्रदेश के राजकीय खेल ''मलखंब'' (Malkhamb) में उत्कृष्ट प्रदर्शन के लिए कौन सा पुरस्कार दिया जाता है?', '"[\"1) विश्वामित्र पुरस्कार / Vishwamitra Award\",\"2) विक्रम पुरस्कार / Vikram Award\",\"3) प्रभाष जोशी खेल पुरस्कार / Prabhash Joshi Sports Award\",\"4) कैप्टन रूप सिंह सम्मान / Captain Roop Singh Samman\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'Which award is given for outstanding performance in the state sport of Madhya Pradesh, ''Malkhamb''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मलखंब मध्य प्रदेश का राजकीय खेल है (2013 में घोषित)।","इस खेल में उत्कृष्ट प्रदर्शन करने वाले खिलाड़ियों को ''प्रभाष जोशी खेल पुरस्कार'' दिया जाता है।","मलखंब मुख्य रूप से उज्जैन क्षेत्र में बहुत लोकप्रिय है और वहाँ मलखंब अकादमी भी है।"],"factsEn":["Malkhamb is the state sport of MP (declared in 2013).","Players demonstrating outstanding performance in this sport are awarded the ''Prabhash Joshi Sports Award''.","Malkhamb is mainly very popular in the Ujjain region and has a Malkhamb Academy there."],"mnemonics":["Prabhash ka Malkhamb (P-M)"],"related":["उज्जैन अकादमी (Ujjain Academy)","राजकीय खेल (State Sport)"],"memoryTip":"सुबह के ''प्रभात'' (Prabhash) में उठकर लोग मलखंब का अभ्यास करते हैं।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('_FVp0fujioQ5h8vch-h0j', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'एशिया की सबसे बड़ी सौर ऊर्जा परियोजनाओं में से एक ''रीवा अल्ट्रा मेगा सोलर पावर प्रोजेक्ट'' की क्षमता कितनी है?', '"[\"1) 500 मेगावाट / 500 MW\",\"2) 750 मेगावाट / 750 MW\",\"3) 1000 मेगावाट / 1000 MW\",\"4) 1200 मेगावाट / 1200 MW\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'What is the capacity of the ''Rewa Ultra Mega Solar Power Project'', one of Asia''s largest solar power projects?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["रीवा अल्ट्रा मेगा सोलर पावर प्रोजेक्ट (Rewa Solar Plant) की कुल स्थापित क्षमता 750 मेगावाट (MW) है।","इसमें 250 मेगावाट की 3 इकाइयां हैं।","इस परियोजना से पैदा होने वाली बिजली का 24% हिस्सा ''दिल्ली मेट्रो'' (DMRC) को दिया जाता है।"],"factsEn":["The total installed capacity of the Rewa Ultra Mega Solar Power Project is 750 Megawatts (MW).","It has 3 units of 250 MW each.","24% of the electricity generated from this project is supplied to the ''Delhi Metro'' (DMRC)."],"mnemonics":["Rewa ki 750 (Rewa - 750 MW)"],"related":["दिल्ली मेट्रो (Delhi Metro)","गुढ़ (Gudh - Tehsil in Rewa where it is located)"],"memoryTip":"रीवा के ''सफेद बाघ'' के बाद अब 750 मेगावाट की ''सफेद धूप'' (Solar) पूरी दुनिया में मशहूर है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('WXe7H2v87TurY0D_jD5cP', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'नर्मदा नदी के समानांतर बहने वाली ''ताप्ती नदी'' का उद्गम मध्य प्रदेश के किस जिले से होता है?', '"[\"1) छिंदवाड़ा / Chhindwara\",\"2) बैतूल / Betul\",\"3) होशंगाबाद / Hoshangabad\",\"4) अनूपपुर / Anuppur\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'The ''Tapti River'', which flows parallel to the Narmada River, originates from which district of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["ताप्ती नदी का उद्गम बैतूल जिले की मुलताई (Multai) नामक स्थान से होता है।","यह नदी नर्मदा के समानांतर पूर्व से पश्चिम की ओर बहती है और ऐश्चुरी (Estuary) बनाती है।","सूरत (गुजरात) शहर ताप्ती नदी के तट पर ही स्थित है।"],"factsEn":["The Tapti River originates from a place called Multai in the Betul district.","This river flows from east to west parallel to the Narmada and forms an estuary.","The city of Surat (Gujarat) is situated on the banks of the Tapti River."],"mnemonics":["Tapti ki Multai (Tapti - Multai, Betul)"],"related":["सूरत शहर (Surat City)","ऐश्चुरी (Estuary)"],"memoryTip":"सूर्य की ''तपन'' (ताप्ती) ''बेतहाशा'' (बैतूल) पड़ती है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('fkG7JrsQYgNbg-k2fmRqD', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'मध्य प्रदेश के किस आदिवासी क्रांतिकारी को ''इंडियन रॉबिनहुड'' (Indian Robinhood) के नाम से जाना जाता था?', '"[\"1) भीमा नायक / Bhima Nayak\",\"2) शंकर शाह / Shankar Shah\",\"3) टंट्या भील / Tantia Bhil\",\"4) बिरसा मुंडा / Birsa Munda\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'Which tribal revolutionary of Madhya Pradesh was known as ''Indian Robinhood''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["टंट्या भील (जिन्हें सम्मान से ''टंट्या मामा'' कहा जाता है) को अंग्रेजों द्वारा ''इंडियन रॉबिनहुड'' कहा गया था।","वे अमीरों और अंग्रेजों का धन लूटकर गरीबों में बांट देते थे।","उनका जन्म खंडवा (पंधाना) में हुआ था और उनका बलिदान दिवस 4 दिसंबर को मनाया जाता है।"],"factsEn":["Tantia Bhil (respectfully called ''Tantia Mama'') was called the ''Indian Robinhood'' by the British.","He used to loot wealth from the rich and the British and distribute it among the poor.","He was born in Khandwa (Pandhana) and his martyrdom day is observed on December 4."],"mnemonics":["Robinhood Mama (Tantia Mama)"],"related":["पातालपानी (Patalpani - Tantia Mama Railway Station)","खंडवा (Khandwa)"],"memoryTip":"मामा (टंट्या भील) ने रॉबिनहुड की तरह गरीबों का हमेशा खयाल रखा।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('5zO9jgU-tWBm8N6G1xqT_', '0o9sihG_Fx6uEwFQXZ5tl', 'अशोकनगर जिला अपने किस भौगोलिक संकेत (GI Tag) प्राप्त उत्पाद के लिए विश्व भर में प्रसिद्ध है?', '"[\"1) बाघ प्रिंट / Bagh Print\",\"2) चंदेरी साड़ियां / Chanderi Sarees\",\"3) माहेश्वरी साड़ियां / Maheshwari Sarees\",\"4) बेल मेटल क्राफ्ट / Bell Metal Craft\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'Ashoknagar district is famous worldwide for which of its Geographical Indication (GI Tag) received product?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["अशोकनगर जिले का ''चंदेरी'' कस्बा अपनी रेशम और सूती कपड़ों से बनी ''चंदेरी साड़ियों'' (Chanderi Sarees) के लिए विश्व प्रसिद्ध है।","इसे मध्य प्रदेश का एक महत्वपूर्ण भौगोलिक संकेत (GI Tag) प्राप्त है।","चंदेरी अपने किलों और जौहर स्मारक के लिए भी ऐतिहासिक रूप से प्रसिद्ध है।"],"factsEn":["The ''Chanderi'' town in Ashoknagar district is world-famous for its ''Chanderi Sarees'' made of silk and cotton.","It holds an important Geographical Indication (GI Tag) for Madhya Pradesh.","Chanderi is also historically famous for its forts and Jauhar monument."],"mnemonics":["Ashok ki Chanderi (Ashoknagar - Chanderi)"],"related":["माहेश्वरी साड़ियां (Maheshwari Sarees - Khargone)","जौहर स्मारक (Jauhar Monument)"],"memoryTip":"अशोक (राजा) ने अपनी रानी को ''चंदेरी'' की साड़ी भेंट की थी।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('d_s87243SSJfCSjijHFkZ', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'दी गई श्रृंखला में अगला पद ज्ञात कीजिए: 6, 13, 28, 59, 122, ?', '"[\"1) 249 / 249\",\"2) 247 / 247\",\"3) 251 / 251\",\"4) 245 / 245\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'Find the next term in the given series: 6, 13, 28, 59, 122, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पैटर्न प्रत्येक पद को 2 से गुणा करके उसमें बढ़ती हुई संख्या (1, 2, 3...) जोड़ने पर आधारित है।","6 × 2 + 1 = 13","13 × 2 + 2 = 28","28 × 2 + 3 = 59","59 × 2 + 4 = 122","अगला पद: 122 × 2 + 5 = 244 + 5 = 249"],"chainEn":["The pattern is based on multiplying each term by 2 and adding an increasing integer (1, 2, 3...).","6 × 2 + 1 = 13","13 × 2 + 2 = 28","28 × 2 + 3 = 59","59 × 2 + 4 = 122","Next term: 122 × 2 + 5 = 244 + 5 = 249"],"pattern":"(×2 + n) progressive multiplication series.","elimination":"122 doubled is 244. Adding the sequence number 5 yields exactly 249, eliminating all other nearby options.","memoryTip":"If a series is roughly doubling at each step, find the base doubled value and figure out the small gap. It is usually a +1, +2, +3 sequence."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ZKIc7NbN3rV6jbbiFEPE_', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'यदि एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में ''SMART'' को ''USBNT'' लिखा जाता है, तो उसी कूट भाषा में ''BRAVE'' को क्या लिखा जाएगा?', '"[\"1) FWCBS / FWCBS\",\"2) FWBSC / FWBSC\",\"3) FVBSC / FVBSC\",\"4) FWBRC / FWBRC\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'If in a certain code language ''SMART'' is written as ''USBNT'', then how will ''BRAVE'' be written in that language?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["मूल शब्द के अक्षरों को उल्टे क्रम (reverse order) में लिखें और फिर प्रत्येक में +1 करें।","''SMART'' का उल्टा क्रम ''TRAMS'' है।","अब +1 करें: T(+1)=U, R(+1)=S, A(+1)=B, M(+1)=N, S(+1)=T. (परिणाम: USBNT)","यही नियम ''BRAVE'' पर लागू करें: उल्टा क्रम ''EVARB'' है।","अब +1 करें: E(+1)=F, V(+1)=W, A(+1)=B, R(+1)=S, B(+1)=C. (परिणाम: FWBSC)"],"chainEn":["Write the letters of the original word in reverse order and then add +1 to each.","Reverse of ''SMART'' is ''TRAMS''.","Now +1: T(+1)=U, R(+1)=S, A(+1)=B, M(+1)=N, S(+1)=T. (Result: USBNT)","Apply the same rule to ''BRAVE'': Reverse is ''EVARB''.","Now +1: E(+1)=F, V(+1)=W, A(+1)=B, R(+1)=S, B(+1)=C. (Result: FWBSC)"],"pattern":"Reverse string +1 forward shift coding.","elimination":"The first letter of the result comes from E+1 = F. The second comes from V+1 = W. This eliminates option 3 immediately. A+1 is B, keeping option 2 as the only precise match.","memoryTip":"If the first and last letters of the coded word match the letters near the END of the original word, it''s a reverse coding pattern."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('j-45ag3UJfNw_tajqaMUm', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'एक महिला की ओर इशारा करते हुए एक आदमी ने कहा, ''इसके भाई के पिता मेरे दादाजी के इकलौते बेटे हैं।'' वह महिला उस आदमी से किस प्रकार संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) माँ / Mother\",\"2) बुआ / Aunt\",\"3) बहन / Sister\",\"4) पत्नी / Wife\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'Pointing to a woman, a man said, ''Her brother''s father is the only son of my grandfather.'' How is the woman related to the man?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["आदमी के बयान को दो हिस्सों में तोड़ें।","पहला हिस्सा: ''मेरे दादाजी का इकलौता बेटा'' -> आदमी के लिए उसके दादाजी का इकलौता बेटा उसका ''पिता'' होता है।","दूसरा हिस्सा: ''इसके (महिला के) भाई के पिता'' -> महिला के भाई का पिता मतलब महिला का भी ''पिता'' है।","दोनों हिस्सों को जोड़ने पर: ''महिला का पिता'' = ''आदमी का पिता''।","चूँकि दोनों का पिता एक ही है, अतः वे भाई-बहन हैं। महिला उस आदमी की बहन है।"],"chainEn":["Break the man''s statement into two parts.","First part: ''the only son of my grandfather'' -> For the man, his grandfather''s only son is his ''father''.","Second part: ''Her (woman''s) brother''s father'' -> The father of a woman''s brother is simply the woman''s ''father''.","Connecting both parts: ''Woman''s father'' = ''Man''s father''.","Since they share the same father, they are siblings. The woman is the man''s sister."],"pattern":"Equating common parents in Blood Relation.","elimination":"Since they share the exact same father, they belong to the same generation and same family line. Sister is the only logical conclusion.","memoryTip":"Always translate relative pronouns first. ''My grandfather''s only son'' = ''My Father''. ''Her brother''s father'' = ''Her Father''. If Her Father = My Father, we are siblings."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ZRR3lwxHtSQdmXqknSc2l', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'एक व्यक्ति पूर्व की ओर मुँह करके खड़ा है। वह 45° वामावर्त (Anti-clockwise) दिशा में मुड़ता है, फिर 180° दक्षिणावर्त (Clockwise) दिशा में मुड़ता है, और अंत में 90° वामावर्त दिशा में मुड़ता है। अब वह किस दिशा की ओर मुँह किये हुए है?', '"[\"1) दक्षिण-पूर्व / South-East\",\"2) दक्षिण-पश्चिम / South-West\",\"3) उत्तर-पूर्व / North-East\",\"4) उत्तर-पश्चिम / North-West\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'A person is facing East. He turns 45° in the anti-clockwise direction, then 180° in the clockwise direction, and finally 90° in the anti-clockwise direction. Which direction is he facing now?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["प्रारंभिक दिशा: पूर्व (East)।","वामावर्त (Anti-clockwise) घुमाव को जोड़ें: 45° + 90° = 135°","दक्षिणावर्त (Clockwise) घुमाव: 180°","नेट (Net) घुमाव निकालें: 180° (CW) - 135° (ACW) = 45° (CW)","+45° (CW) का अर्थ है प्रारंभिक दिशा (पूर्व) से 45° दायीं ओर मुड़ना।","पूर्व से 45° दक्षिणावर्त मुड़ने पर दक्षिण-पूर्व (South-East) आता है।"],"chainEn":["Initial direction: East.","Sum of Anti-clockwise turns: 45° + 90° = 135°","Clockwise turn: 180°","Calculate Net turn: 180° (CW) - 135° (ACW) = 45° (CW)","+45° (CW) means a 45° right turn from the initial direction (East).","Turning 45° clockwise from East results in South-East."],"pattern":"Net Angular Rotation Logic.","elimination":"A net 45° turn clockwise from East directly lands on South-East. No other quadrant is possible.","memoryTip":"Group CW and ACW turns separately, subtract the smaller from the larger, and make only ONE final turn from the starting point."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('QGMIsB1-bjl9Lk4Md4sTq', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'कथन: 1. सभी पुलिसकर्मी बहादुर हैं। 2. कुछ बहादुर बुद्धिमान हैं।
निष्कर्ष: I. कुछ पुलिसकर्मी बुद्धिमान हैं। II. सभी बुद्धिमान पुलिसकर्मी हैं。', '"[\"1) केवल निष्कर्ष I सही है / Only conclusion I follows\",\"2) केवल निष्कर्ष II सही है / Only conclusion II follows\",\"3) दोनों सही हैं / Both follow\",\"4) कोई सही नहीं है / None follows\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'Statements: 1. All policemen are brave. 2. Some brave are smart.
Conclusions: I. Some policemen are smart. II. All smart are policemen.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पुलिसकर्मियों का वृत्त पूरी तरह से ''बहादुर'' के वृत्त के अंदर है।","''बुद्धिमान'' का वृत्त ''बहादुर'' के वृत्त को काटता (intersect) है।","चूँकि ''बुद्धिमान'' का वृत्त केवल ''बहादुर'' को काट रहा है, यह निश्चित नहीं है कि वह अंदर जाकर ''पुलिसकर्मियों'' के वृत्त को छुएगा या नहीं।","इसलिए ''कुछ पुलिसकर्मी बुद्धिमान हैं'' एक संभावना हो सकती है, लेकिन निश्चित निष्कर्ष नहीं (निष्कर्ष I गलत है)।","चूँकि केवल ''कुछ'' बहादुर बुद्धिमान हैं, हम ''सभी'' बुद्धिमानों के पुलिसकर्मी होने का दावा बिल्कुल नहीं कर सकते (निष्कर्ष II भी गलत है)।"],"chainEn":["The Policemen circle is entirely inside the Brave circle.","The Smart circle intersects the Brave circle.","Since the Smart circle only intersects Brave, there is no guarantee it goes deep enough to touch the inner Policemen circle.","Therefore, ''Some policemen are smart'' is a possibility, but not a definite conclusion (Conclusion I is false).","Since only ''some'' brave are smart, we cannot claim ''All'' smart are policemen (Conclusion II is also false)."],"pattern":"A + I Syllogism (No Definite Relation).","elimination":"Without explicit connection between the innermost circle and the intersecting third circle, positive conclusions between them always fail.","memoryTip":"In Syllogism, Possibility does not equal Definite Truth. If it CAN happen but doesn''t HAVE to happen, the conclusion is false."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('tbJiqYoyfy7sFq-CJ1Pnn', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'यदि एक खुले पासे को मोड़ा जाए जिसमें 1 के विपरीत 3, 2 के विपरीत 4, और 5 के विपरीत 6 है, तो निम्नलिखित में से कौन सा पासा बनाया जा सकता है?', '"[\"1) फलक 1, 3, 5 / Faces 1, 3, 5\",\"2) फलक 2, 4, 6 / Faces 2, 4, 6\",\"3) फलक 1, 2, 5 / Faces 1, 2, 5\",\"4) फलक 5, 6, 3 / Faces 5, 6, 3\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'If an open dice is folded where 1 is opposite 3, 2 is opposite 4, and 5 is opposite 6, which of the following dice can be formed?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पासे का मुख्य नियम: कोई भी दो विपरीत फलक एक साथ (निकटवर्ती) नहीं देखे जा सकते।","विपरीत जोड़े हैं: (1 और 3), (2 और 4), (5 और 6)।","विकल्प 1: 1 और 3 एक साथ हैं (गलत)।","विकल्प 2: 2 और 4 एक साथ हैं (गलत)।","विकल्प 4: 5 और 6 एक साथ हैं (गलत)।","विकल्प 3: फलक 1, 2, और 5। ये तीनों अलग-अलग विपरीत जोड़ों में से एक-एक हैं। यह पासा बिल्कुल सही बनाया जा सकता है।"],"chainEn":["Main rule of dice: No two opposite faces can be seen together (adjacent).","Opposite pairs are: (1 and 3), (2 and 4), (5 and 6).","Option 1: 1 and 3 are together (False).","Option 2: 2 and 4 are together (False).","Option 4: 5 and 6 are together (False).","Option 3: Faces 1, 2, and 5. These are taken one from each opposite pair. This dice can be perfectly formed."],"pattern":"Opposite Face Elimination Rule in Dice.","elimination":"Options 1, 2, and 4 present explicitly stated opposite faces as adjacent, violating the fundamental rule of 3D cubes.","memoryTip":"A valid 3D dice view must pick exactly ONE number from each of the three opposite pairs."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('QZEyhAEtEjDmJSWeh-Z4C', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'वाहन चेकिंग अभियान के दौरान, आप बिना हेलमेट के एक व्यक्ति को रोकते हैं। वह दावा करता है कि वह एक उच्च पदस्थ पुलिस अधिकारी का बेटा है और आपको धमकाता है। आप क्या करेंगे?', '"[\"1) माफी मांगेंगे और उसे जाने देंगे / Apologize and let him go\",\"2) बिना रसीद दिए उसका वाहन तुरंत जब्त कर लेंगे / Confiscate his vehicle immediately without a receipt\",\"3) उसे किसी अन्य नागरिक की तरह मानेंगे और नियम उल्लंघन का चालान काटेंगे / Treat him like any other citizen and issue a challan for the rule violation\",\"4) डर कर अपना चेकिंग पॉइंट बदल लेंगे / Change your checking point out of fear\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'During a vehicle checking drive, you stop a person without a helmet. He claims to be the son of a high-ranking police officer and threatens you. What will you do?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["कानून सभी नागरिकों के लिए समान है, चाहे उनकी पारिवारिक या राजनीतिक पृष्ठभूमि कुछ भी हो।","धमकी के आगे झुकना (विकल्प 1 और 4) कर्तव्य की अवहेलना और कायरता है।","कानूनी प्रक्रिया से बाहर जाकर वाहन जब्त करना (विकल्प 2) शक्ति का दुरुपयोग है।","सही और पेशेवर कार्रवाई बिना डरे, समान रूप से कानून लागू करना और यातायात नियमों के उल्लंघन के लिए चालान काटना है।"],"chainEn":["The law is equal for all citizens, regardless of their family or political background.","Bowing to threats (Options 1 and 4) is dereliction of duty and cowardice.","Confiscating a vehicle outside legal procedure (Option 2) is abuse of power.","The correct and professional action is to enforce the law equally without fear and issue a challan for the traffic violation."],"pattern":"Equality before Law / SRT.","elimination":"Options 1 and 4 show weakness. Option 2 is illegal. Option 3 is the only lawful and ethical response.","memoryTip":"In VIP-pressure SRTs, the correct answer is ALWAYS to treat them like an ordinary citizen and follow standard legal protocol."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('2sxQ9ky3ZRXMcDY34PYwh', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'यदि एक कूट भाषा में ''MAN'' = 28 और ''BOY'' = 42 है, तो ''GIRL'' का कूट क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 44 / 44\",\"2) 46 / 46\",\"3) 48 / 48\",\"4) 42 / 42\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'If in a code language ''MAN'' = 28 and ''BOY'' = 42, what will be the code for ''GIRL''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["अक्षरों के वर्णमाला स्थानीय मान (Place Value) को जोड़ें।","M(13) + A(1) + N(14) = 13 + 1 + 14 = 28","B(2) + O(15) + Y(25) = 2 + 15 + 25 = 42","यही तर्क ''GIRL'' पर लागू करें:","G(7) + I(9) + R(18) + L(12)","योग: 7 + 9 + 18 + 12 = 46"],"chainEn":["Add the alphabetical positional values of the letters.","M(13) + A(1) + N(14) = 13 + 1 + 14 = 28","B(2) + O(15) + Y(25) = 2 + 15 + 25 = 42","Apply the same logic to ''GIRL'':","G(7) + I(9) + R(18) + L(12)","Sum: 7 + 9 + 18 + 12 = 46"],"pattern":"Direct Sum of Alphabetic Values.","elimination":"The direct sum evaluates strictly to 46. Other numerical options are mathematically incorrect.","memoryTip":"To save time, quickly write down values above the letters on rough paper. Add numbers forming pairs of 10 first (e.g., 18 + 12 = 30, then +16 = 46)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Xd1a6CNeqqZTb-CIT2PXk', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'दी गई श्रृंखला को पूरा करें: Z26, X24, V22, T20, ?', '"[\"1) S19 / S19\",\"2) P16 / P16\",\"3) Q17 / Q17\",\"4) R18 / R18\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'Complete the given series: Z26, X24, V22, T20, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["यह एक अल्फ़ान्यूमेरिक (Alphanumeric) श्रृंखला है जहाँ अक्षर और उसका स्थानीय मान एक साथ लिखे गए हैं।","अक्षरों का क्रम देखें: Z, X, V, T... यहाँ -2 का अंतर है। (Z-2=X, X-2=V, V-2=T)।","अगला अक्षर T(20) - 2 = R होगा।","अक्षरों के साथ जुड़े अंक उनके वास्तविक वर्णमाला स्थानीय मान हैं (Z=26, X=24, V=22, T=20)।","चूँकि अगला अक्षर R है, उसका स्थानीय मान 18 होगा। अतः उत्तर R18 है।"],"chainEn":["This is an alphanumeric series where the letter is written along with its positional value.","Look at the letter sequence: Z, X, V, T... There is a gap of -2. (Z-2=X, X-2=V, V-2=T).","The next letter will be T(20) - 2 = R.","The numbers attached are exactly the real alphabetical positional values (Z=26, X=24, V=22, T=20).","Since the next letter is R, its positional value is 18. Hence the answer is R18."],"pattern":"-2 letter shift with corresponding positional numbers.","elimination":"Options 1, 2, and 3 break the -2 backward pattern. Only R fits the -2 gap perfectly with its correct number 18.","memoryTip":"If letters are accompanied by decreasing even numbers starting from 26, it is simply the reverse alphabet at every alternate step."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Cs_NsYwnHECVCcWMURJBU', 'UReeJgTJ6kdv5MUPrGFuN', 'निम्नलिखित अक्षर श्रृंखला में रिक्त स्थानों की पूर्ति करें: a _ b b c _ a a _ b c c', '"[\"1) a, c, b\",\"2) b, a, c\",\"3) a, b, c\",\"4) c, a, b\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'Fill in the blanks in the following letter series: a _ b b c _ a a _ b c c', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पदों को गिनें: श्रृंखला में कुल 12 पद (रिक्त स्थानों सहित) हैं।","इन्हें 6-6 के दो भागों में बाँट कर देखें: a _ b b c _  और  a a _ b c c","दोनों हिस्सों की तुलना करें: दूसरा हिस्सा ''a a'' से शुरू हो रहा है, तो पहले हिस्से का रिक्त स्थान ''a'' होना चाहिए (a a b b c _)।","पहला हिस्सा ''b b'' के बाद ''c'' पर है, और दूसरे हिस्से के अंत में ''c c'' है। इसका मतलब पैटर्न ''a a b b c c'' का दोहराव है।","पहला रिक्त: a (a a b b c c बनाने के लिए)। दूसरा रिक्त: c (a a b b c c पूरा करने के लिए)। तीसरा रिक्त: b (a a b b c c बनाने के लिए)।","अतः भरे जाने वाले अक्षर a, c, b हैं।"],"chainEn":["Count the terms: The series has a total of 12 terms (including blanks).","Divide them into two parts of 6: a _ b b c _  and  a a _ b c c","Compare both parts: The second part starts with ''a a'', so the first blank in the first part should be ''a'' (making it a a b b c _).","The first part has ''c'' after ''b b'', and the second part ends with ''c c''. This indicates the repeating block is ''a a b b c c''.","First blank: a (to make a a b b). Second blank: c (to complete a a b b c c). Third blank: b (to make a a b b c c).","Thus, the letters to be filled are a, c, b."],"pattern":"Repeating clumped block (aabbcc aabbcc).","elimination":"Filling in ''a, c, b'' perfectly mirrors the two 6-letter halves. Any other combination breaks the double-letter symmetry.","memoryTip":"In repeating letter series, look for natural clumps like ''bb'' or ''cc''. They usually indicate a mirrored or double-letter pattern."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('NJNVwMNa5VaF2F-cHfZMS', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'श्वसन के दौरान ऊर्जा किस रूप में मुक्त होती है?', '"[\"1) एडीपी / ADP\",\"2) एटीपी / ATP\",\"3) ग्लूकोज / Glucose\",\"4) विटामिन / Vitamin\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'In what form is energy released during respiration?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["श्वसन के दौरान मुक्त होने वाली ऊर्जा एटीपी (ATP) अणुओं के रूप में संचित होती है।","एटीपी का पूरा नाम एडिनोसिन ट्राइफॉस्फेट (Adenosine Triphosphate) है।","इसे कोशिका की ''ऊर्जा मुद्रा'' (Energy Currency) कहा जाता है।"],"factsEn":["Energy released during respiration is stored in the form of ATP molecules.","ATP stands for Adenosine Triphosphate.","It is known as the ''Energy Currency'' of the cell."],"mnemonics":["ATP = All The Power."],"related":["माइटोकॉन्ड्रिया (Mitochondria)","ग्लाइकोलाइसिस (Glycolysis)"],"memoryTip":"Just like you need currency (money) to buy things, cells need ATP to do work."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('BEh--EHCeJTNNwWugxS9L', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'मनुष्य की खोपड़ी (Skull) में कुल कितनी हड्डियां होती हैं?', '"[\"1) 14\",\"2) 22\",\"3) 28\",\"4) 32\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'How many bones are there in total in the human skull?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मानव खोपड़ी में कुल 22 हड्डियां होती हैं (कान की हड्डियों को छोड़कर)।","इसमें 8 कपाल (Cranial) हड्डियां होती हैं जो मस्तिष्क की रक्षा करती हैं और 14 चेहरे (Facial) की हड्डियां होती हैं।","यदि कान की 6 हड्डियों और 1 हायोइड हड्डी को जोड़ा जाए, तो सिर में कुल 29 हड्डियां होती हैं।"],"factsEn":["The human skull consists of a total of 22 bones (excluding ear ossicles).","It includes 8 cranial bones that protect the brain and 14 facial bones.","If 6 ear bones and 1 hyoid bone are included, the total head region has 29 bones."],"mnemonics":["8 for Brain, 14 for Face = 22 for Skull."],"related":["कंकाल तंत्र (Skeletal System)","मैंडिबल (Mandible - Lower Jaw)"],"memoryTip":"The lower jaw (Mandible) is the only movable bone in the skull."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('PLLtz6cCPbyMHw8iSoKfQ', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'ठोस से सीधे गैस में बदलने की प्रक्रिया को क्या कहते हैं?', '"[\"1) वाष्पीकरण / Evaporation\",\"2) संघनन / Condensation\",\"3) उर्ध्वपातन / Sublimation\",\"4) गलन / Melting\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'What is the process of changing directly from solid to gas called?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["जब कोई ठोस पदार्थ बिना तरल बने सीधे गैस में बदल जाता है, तो उसे उर्ध्वपातन (Sublimation) कहते हैं।","कपूर (Camphor), नेफ़थलीन और सूखी बर्फ (Dry Ice) इसके मुख्य उदाहरण हैं।","गैस से सीधे ठोस बनने को ''निक्षेपण'' (Deposition) कहा जाता है।"],"factsEn":["When a solid changes directly into a gas without becoming a liquid, it is called Sublimation.","Camphor, Naphthalene, and Dry Ice are primary examples.","The reverse process (gas to solid) is called Deposition."],"mnemonics":["Sublime = Solid to Steam."],"related":["सूखी बर्फ (Dry Ice)","वाष्पीकरण (Vaporization)"],"memoryTip":"Think of naphthalene balls in clothes; they vanish without leaving a wet spot."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('9PNkv67b92P1b7aGnsWlQ', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'रक्तचाप (Blood Pressure) मापने के लिए किस उपकरण का उपयोग किया जाता है?', '"[\"1) स्टेथोस्कोप / Stethoscope\",\"2) स्फिग्मोमैनोमीटर / Sphygmomanometer\",\"3) थर्मामीटर / Thermometer\",\"4) ईसीजी / ECG\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'Which instrument is used to measure blood pressure?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["स्फिग्मोमैनोमीटर (Sphygmomanometer) का उपयोग रक्तचाप मापने के लिए किया जाता है।","स्टेथोस्कोप का उपयोग हृदय की धड़कन सुनने के लिए किया जाता है।","ईसीजी (ECG) हृदय की विद्युत गतिविधि को रिकॉर्ड करता है।"],"factsEn":["A sphygmomanometer is used to measure blood pressure.","A stethoscope is used to listen to the heartbeat.","An ECG records the electrical activity of the heart."],"mnemonics":["SPHYG-mo measures the pressure flow."],"related":["हृदय गति (Heart Rate)","धमनी और शिरा (Artery and Vein)"],"memoryTip":"It''s the long word for the ''BP machine'' doctors wrap around your arm."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('XbLir7w5rdgLxlH8ncvgZ', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'हवा में ध्वनि की गति लगभग कितनी होती है?', '"[\"1) 332 m/s\",\"2) 1500 m/s\",\"3) 5000 m/s\",\"4) 3 × 10^8 m/s\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'What is the approximate speed of sound in air?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["सामान्य तापमान पर हवा में ध्वनि की गति लगभग 332-343 मीटर प्रति सेकंड होती है।","ध्वनि की गति माध्यम के तापमान और घनत्व पर निर्भर करती है।","ध्वनि लोहे (ठोस) में हवा (गैस) की तुलना में बहुत तेज यात्रा करती है।"],"factsEn":["The speed of sound in air at normal temperature is approximately 332-343 m/s.","The speed of sound depends on the temperature and density of the medium.","Sound travels much faster in iron (solid) than in air (gas)."],"mnemonics":["332 - Speed for you and me (in air)."],"related":["मैक संख्या (Mach Number)","सोनिक बूम (Sonic Boom)"],"memoryTip":"Sound is fast, but Light (3 x 10^8) is millions of times faster."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('FXx6_lBnCYwsJTKTku7Zl', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'किस विटामिन को ''सनशाइन विटामिन'' (Sunshine Vitamin) भी कहा जाता है?', '"[\"1) विटामिन ए / Vitamin A\",\"2) विटामिन बी / Vitamin B\",\"3) विटामिन सी / Vitamin C\",\"4) विटामिन डी / Vitamin D\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'Which vitamin is also known as the ''Sunshine Vitamin''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["विटामिन डी को ''सनशाइन विटामिन'' कहा जाता है क्योंकि हमारा शरीर सूर्य की रोशनी के संपर्क में आने पर इसे बनाता है।","यह हड्डियों और दांतों की मजबूती के लिए कैल्शियम के अवशोषण में मदद करता है।","इसकी कमी से बच्चों में रिकेट्स हो सकता है।"],"factsEn":["Vitamin D is called the ''sunshine vitamin'' because the body synthesizes it when exposed to sunlight.","It helps in calcium absorption for strong bones and teeth.","Its deficiency causes Rickets in children."],"mnemonics":["D for Day-light."],"related":["कैल्शियम (Calcium)","रिकेट्स (Rickets)"],"memoryTip":"Go out in the sun to get your daily dose of ''D''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('8tv2wfRaUdtugHsATTA88', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'शुष्क सेल (Dry Cell) में किस प्रकार की ऊर्जा संचित होती है?', '"[\"1) यांत्रिक ऊर्जा / Mechanical Energy\",\"2) विद्युत ऊर्जा / Electrical Energy\",\"3) रासायनिक ऊर्जा / Chemical Energy\",\"4) ऊष्मीय ऊर्जा / Thermal Energy\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'What type of energy is stored in a Dry Cell?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["शुष्क सेल (बैटरी) में रासायनिक ऊर्जा संचित होती है।","उपयोग के दौरान, यह रासायनिक ऊर्जा विद्युत ऊर्जा में बदल जाती है।","इसमें अमोनियम क्लोराइड का पेस्ट इलेक्ट्रोलाइट के रूप में उपयोग होता है।"],"factsEn":["Chemical energy is stored in a dry cell (battery).","During use, this chemical energy is converted into electrical energy.","It uses ammonium chloride paste as an electrolyte."],"mnemonics":["Cell = Chemical storage."],"related":["इलेक्ट्रोलाइट (Electrolyte)","वोल्टाइक सेल (Voltaic Cell)"],"memoryTip":"Batteries contain chemicals that react to push electrons."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('yG0yILLtzwo9hptBHqlqU', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'मानव शरीर में इंसुलिन का निर्माण कहाँ होता है?', '"[\"1) यकृत / Liver\",\"2) प्लीहा / Spleen\",\"3) अग्न्याशय / Pancreas\",\"4) गुर्दे / Kidney\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'Where is insulin produced in the human body?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["इंसुलिन अग्न्याशय (Pancreas) की लैंगरहैंस की द्वीपिकाओं (Islets of Langerhans) की बीटा कोशिकाओं द्वारा निर्मित होता है।","यह रक्त शर्करा (ब्लड शुगर) को नियंत्रित करने वाला मुख्य हार्मोन है।","अग्न्याशय एक मिश्रित ग्रंथि (अंतःस्रावी और बहिःस्रावी दोनों) है।"],"factsEn":["Insulin is produced by the beta cells of the Islets of Langerhans in the Pancreas.","It is the primary hormone that regulates blood sugar.","The pancreas is a mixed gland (both endocrine and exocrine)."],"mnemonics":["Pancreas processes the sugar (using insulin)."],"related":["ग्लूकागन (Glucagon)","डायबिटीज (Diabetes)"],"memoryTip":"If the Pancreas fails to make insulin, blood sugar goes up (Diabetes)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('CL1AaiGFRUpizvZCzVSY2', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'तारे मुख्य रूप से किन गैसों से बने होते हैं?', '"[\"1) ऑक्सीजन और नाइट्रोजन / Oxygen and Nitrogen\",\"2) हाइड्रोजन और हीलियम / Hydrogen and Helium\",\"3) कार्बन और मीथेन / Carbon and Methane\",\"4) हीलियम और नियॉन / Helium and Neon\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'Stars are mainly composed of which gases?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["तारे (जैसे सूर्य) मुख्य रूप से हाइड्रोजन और हीलियम से बने होते हैं।","सूर्य में लगभग 71% हाइड्रोजन और 27% हीलियम है।","ऊर्जा नाभिकीय संलयन (Nuclear Fusion) की प्रक्रिया से पैदा होती है।"],"factsEn":["Stars (like the Sun) are mainly composed of Hydrogen and Helium.","The Sun consists of about 71% Hydrogen and 27% Helium.","Energy is generated through the process of Nuclear Fusion."],"mnemonics":["H + H = He (Fusion in stars)."],"related":["नाभिकीय संलयन (Nuclear Fusion)","सौरमंडल (Solar System)"],"memoryTip":"Hydrogen is the fuel, Helium is the result in stars."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('mk9glorMOrhll510a_Pt9', 'OHLylm8i7P-oUwf0PubG5', 'सफेद रक्त कोशिकाओं (WBC) का मुख्य कार्य क्या है?', '"[\"1) ऑक्सीजन का परिवहन / Transport oxygen\",\"2) संक्रमण से लड़ना / Fight infection\",\"3) रक्त का थक्का जमाना / Blood clotting\",\"4) कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड ले जाना / Carry CO2\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'What is the main function of White Blood Cells (WBC)?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["डब्ल्यूबीसी (ल्यूकोसाइट्स) शरीर की प्रतिरक्षा प्रणाली (Immune system) का हिस्सा हैं।","वे रोगाणुओं और बाहरी संक्रमणों से लड़कर शरीर की रक्षा करते हैं।","इन्हें शरीर का ''सैनिक'' (Soldiers of the body) कहा जाता है।"],"factsEn":["WBCs (leukocytes) are part of the body''s immune system.","They protect the body by fighting against germs and external infections.","They are called the ''Soldiers of the body''."],"mnemonics":["WBC = Warriors of Body Cells."],"related":["ल्यूकोसाइट्स (Leukocytes)","प्रतिरक्षा प्रणाली (Immune System)"],"memoryTip":"WBCs act like an army defending your body from invader germs."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('DNPOxLwTzAnNhDkp1OyaE', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', 'मध्य प्रदेश की कौन सी नदी कर्क रेखा (Tropic of Cancer) को दो बार काटती है?', '"[\"1) नर्मदा / Narmada\",\"2) माही / Mahi\",\"3) चंबल / Chambal\",\"4) बेतवा / Betwa\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'Which river of Madhya Pradesh crosses the Tropic of Cancer twice?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["माही नदी भारत की एकमात्र ऐसी प्रमुख नदी है जो कर्क रेखा को दो बार पार करती है।","इसका उद्गम मध्य प्रदेश के धार जिले (मिंडा गाँव) से होता है।","यह मध्य प्रदेश, राजस्थान और गुजरात में बहते हुए खंभात की खाड़ी (अरब सागर) में गिर जाती है।"],"factsEn":["The Mahi River is the only major river in India that crosses the Tropic of Cancer twice.","It originates from the Dhar district (Minda village) of Madhya Pradesh.","It flows through MP, Rajasthan, and Gujarat, and drains into the Gulf of Khambhat (Arabian Sea)."],"mnemonics":["Mahi ki Double Cross (Mahi crosses Cancer twice)"],"related":["धार जिला (Dhar District)","खंभात की खाड़ी (Gulf of Khambhat)"],"memoryTip":"''मही'' (धरती) के बीचों-बीच से कर्क रेखा गुजरती है, और ''माही'' नदी उसे दो बार काटती है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('65wajasnz0F5VgrWToGTx', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', '''बैंक नोट प्रेस'' (Bank Note Press) मध्य प्रदेश के किस जिले में स्थित है?', '"[\"1) होशंगाबाद / Hoshangabad\",\"2) नेपानगर / Nepanagar\",\"3) देवास / Dewas\",\"4) उज्जैन / Ujjain\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', '''Bank Note Press'' is located in which district of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["बैंक नोट प्रेस (BNP) देवास में स्थित है, जहाँ भारत सरकार के बैंक नोट छापे जाते हैं।","इसकी स्थापना वर्ष 1974 में की गई थी।","होशंगाबाद में सिक्योरिटी पेपर मिल है (जहाँ नोट का कागज बनता है) और देवास में नोट की छपाई होती है।"],"factsEn":["The Bank Note Press (BNP) is located in Dewas, where the Government of India''s bank notes are printed.","It was established in the year 1974.","Hoshangabad has the Security Paper Mill (where note paper is made) and Dewas is where the note printing happens."],"mnemonics":["Devas me Paisa (Notes are printed in Dewas)"],"related":["सिक्योरिटी पेपर मिल (Security Paper Mill - Hoshangabad)","टकसाल (Mint - none in MP)"],"memoryTip":"बैंक नोट छापने के लिए ''देवों'' का वास (देवास) चाहिए।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('BaUpDcyYBzxrCkK6-3OCF', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', 'काले रंग के ''कड़कनाथ मुर्गे'' (Kadaknath Chicken) के लिए मध्य प्रदेश के किस जिले को भौगोलिक संकेत (GI Tag) प्राप्त हुआ है?', '"[\"1) अलीराजपुर / Alirajpur\",\"2) झाबुआ / Jhabua\",\"3) बड़वानी / Barwani\",\"4) डिंडोरी / Dindori\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'Which district of Madhya Pradesh has received the Geographical Indication (GI Tag) for the black colored ''Kadaknath Chicken''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["कड़कनाथ मुर्गा (जिसे कालीमासी भी कहा जाता है) मूल रूप से मध्य प्रदेश के झाबुआ जिले में पाया जाता है।","इसे 2018 में जीआई टैग (GI Tag) प्रदान किया गया था।","इसका मांस, खून और हड्डियां सभी काले रंग के होते हैं, और यह उच्च प्रोटीन व कम फैट के लिए जाना जाता है।"],"factsEn":["Kadaknath chicken (also known as Kalimasi) is originally found in the Jhabua district of MP.","It was granted the GI Tag in 2018.","Its meat, blood, and bones are all black, and it is known for high protein and low fat."],"mnemonics":["Jhabua ka Kadak (Kadaknath in Jhabua)"],"related":["जीआई टैग (GI Tag - 2018)","कालीमासी (Kalimasi - Local Name)"],"memoryTip":"झाबुआ के आदिवासी क्षेत्रों में यह ''कड़क'' (मजबूत) मुर्गा पाला जाता है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('hE5DI_Q1n9qwEH9e9JdtZ', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', 'प्रसिद्ध ''असीरगढ़ का किला'' (Fort of Asirgarh), जिसे ''दक्षिण का प्रवेश द्वार'' (Key to Deccan) भी कहा जाता है, कहाँ स्थित है?', '"[\"1) ग्वालियर / Gwalior\",\"2) बुरहानपुर / Burhanpur\",\"3) मांडू / Mandu\",\"4) चंदेरी / Chanderi\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'Where is the famous ''Fort of Asirgarh'', also known as the ''Key to Deccan'', located?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["असीरगढ़ का किला मध्य प्रदेश के बुरहानपुर जिले में सतपुड़ा की पहाड़ियों पर स्थित है।","ऐतिहासिक रूप से इसे ''दक्कन की कुंजी'' (Key to Deccan) या ''दक्षिण का प्रवेश द्वार'' माना जाता था क्योंकि उत्तर से दक्षिण जाने का यही मुख्य मार्ग था।","इसका निर्माण आशा अहीर नामक एक राजा ने करवाया था।"],"factsEn":["The Fort of Asirgarh is located on the hills of Satpura in the Burhanpur district of MP.","Historically, it was considered the ''Key to Deccan'' or ''Gateway to the South'' as it was the main route to travel from North to South.","It was built by a king named Asha Ahir."],"mnemonics":["Asirgarh ki Key (Burhanpur is the gateway)"],"related":["आशा अहीर (Asha Ahir)","बुरहानपुर (Burhanpur - Southernmost district)"],"memoryTip":"जो यह किला जीत लेता था, उसके लिए दक्षिण जाने का रास्ता ''बुरहान'' (खुल) जाता था।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('onN__WPDBhlRpdk2VDnqV', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', 'मालवा के पठार (Malwa Plateau) की सबसे ऊँची चोटी कौन सी है?', '"[\"1) धूपगढ़ / Dhupgarh\",\"2) सद्भावना शिखर / Sadbhawna Shikhar\",\"3) सिगार / Sigar\",\"4) अमरकंटक / Amarkantak\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'Which is the highest peak of the Malwa Plateau?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मालवा के पठार की सबसे ऊँची चोटी ''सिगार'' (Sigar Peak) है, जिसकी ऊँचाई 881 मीटर है।","यह इंदौर जिले के महू (जानापाव पहाड़ी क्षेत्र) के पास स्थित है।","मालवा पठार की अन्य प्रमुख चोटियों में जानापाव (854 मी) और धजारी (810 मी) शामिल हैं।"],"factsEn":["The highest peak of the Malwa Plateau is ''Sigar Peak'', which has an elevation of 881 meters.","It is located near Mhow (Janapav hill region) in the Indore district.","Other major peaks of the Malwa plateau include Janapav (854 m) and Dhajari (810 m)."],"mnemonics":["Malwa ki Sigar (Highest point smokes a cigar - memory hook)"],"related":["जानापाव (Janapav)","धूपगढ़ (Dhupgarh - Highest in whole MP)"],"memoryTip":"मालवा के लोग ''सिगार'' की तरह सबसे ऊँचे रहते हैं।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('z3S4XQP9ix4dNYi75dBBX', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', 'मध्य प्रदेश राज्य का गठन 1 नवंबर 1956 को किस आयोग की सिफारिश पर किया गया था?', '"[\"1) जेवीपी समिति / JVP Committee\",\"2) फजल अली आयोग / Fazal Ali Commission\",\"3) काका कालेलकर आयोग / Kaka Kalelkar Commission\",\"4) कोठारी आयोग / Kothari Commission\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'On the recommendation of which commission was the state of Madhya Pradesh formed on 1 November 1956?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["मध्य प्रदेश का गठन 1 नवंबर 1956 को ''राज्य पुनर्गठन आयोग'' (State Reorganization Commission) की सिफारिश पर किया गया था।","इस आयोग के अध्यक्ष सैयद फजल अली थे, इसलिए इसे ''फजल अली आयोग'' भी कहा जाता है।","आयोग के अन्य दो सदस्य हृदयनाथ कुंजरू और के. एम. पणिक्कर थे।"],"factsEn":["Madhya Pradesh was formed on Nov 1, 1956, on the recommendation of the ''State Reorganization Commission''.","The chairman of this commission was Syed Fazal Ali, hence it is also called the ''Fazal Ali Commission''.","The other two members of the commission were Hridaynath Kunzru and K. M. Panikkar."],"mnemonics":["Fazal ki MP (Fazal Ali created MP)"],"related":["राज्य पुनर्गठन अधिनियम (State Reorganization Act 1956)","पार्ट ए, बी, सी (Part A, B, C States merged)"],"memoryTip":"मध्य प्रदेश बनना फजल अली की ''फसल'' (मेहनत) का नतीजा था।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ytU40c7rTySvHXBc8EWCA', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', 'वर्ष 2011 की जनगणना के अनुसार, मध्य प्रदेश का सर्वाधिक साक्षरता (Highest Literacy Rate) वाला जिला कौन सा है?', '"[\"1) इंदौर / Indore\",\"2) भोपाल / Bhopal\",\"3) जबलपुर / Jabalpur\",\"4) बालाघाट / Balaghat\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'According to the 2011 census, which is the district with the highest literacy rate in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["2011 की जनगणना के अनुसार, जबलपुर मध्य प्रदेश का सर्वाधिक साक्षरता वाला जिला है (81.1%)।","जबलपुर के बाद इंदौर (80.9%) और भोपाल (80.4%) का स्थान आता है।","सबसे कम साक्षरता वाला जिला अलीराजपुर (36.1%) है।"],"factsEn":["As per the 2011 census, Jabalpur is the district with the highest literacy rate in Madhya Pradesh (81.1%).","Jabalpur is followed by Indore (80.9%) and Bhopal (80.4%).","The district with the lowest literacy rate is Alirajpur (36.1%)."],"mnemonics":["Jabalpur ka Gyan (High Literacy)"],"related":["अलीराजपुर (Alirajpur - Lowest Literacy)","साक्षरता दर (Literacy Rate of MP - 69.3%)"],"memoryTip":"जबलपुर को ''संस्कार धानी'' कहा जाता है, जहाँ संस्कार होते हैं वहाँ साक्षरता सबसे ज्यादा होती है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('fQAeC_4JHX7rt6lH3uYc2', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', 'प्रसिद्ध जैन तीर्थ स्थल ''बावनगजा'' (Bawangaja) मध्य प्रदेश के किस जिले में स्थित है?', '"[\"1) दमोह / Damoh\",\"2) छतरपुर / Chhatarpur\",\"3) बड़वानी / Barwani\",\"4) उज्जैन / Ujjain\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'The famous Jain pilgrimage site ''Bawangaja'' is located in which district of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["बावनगजा मध्य प्रदेश के बड़वानी जिले में स्थित एक महत्वपूर्ण जैन तीर्थ स्थल है।","यहाँ सतपुड़ा की पहाड़ियों को काटकर बनाई गई भगवान आदिनाथ (ऋषभदेव) की 84 फीट (52 गज) ऊंची विशाल प्रतिमा है।","इसी 52 गज की मूर्ति के कारण इसका नाम ''बावनगजा'' पड़ा।"],"factsEn":["Bawangaja is an important Jain pilgrimage site located in the Barwani district of MP.","It has an 84 feet (52 yards) tall giant statue of Lord Adinath (Rishabhanatha) carved out of the Satpura hills.","Due to this 52-yard statue, it got the name ''Bawangaja''."],"mnemonics":["Bawan Barwani (B-B)"],"related":["भगवान आदिनाथ (Lord Adinath)","कुंडलपुर (Kundalpur - Damoh, another Jain site)"],"memoryTip":"''बावन'' (Bawan) और ''बड़वानी'' (Barwani) दोनों ''ब'' अक्षर से शुरू होते हैं।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('pAuhoHfMLVolXbkbkKJAZ', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', 'प्राचीन काल के महान कवि और नाटककार ''कालिदास'' का संबंध मध्य प्रदेश के किस शहर से था?', '"[\"1) खजुराहो / Khajuraho\",\"2) उज्जैन / Ujjain\",\"3) धार / Dhar\",\"4) विदिशा / Vidisha\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'The great poet and playwright of ancient times ''Kalidasa'' was associated with which city of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["महाकवि कालिदास का संबंध प्राचीन उज्जयिनी (वर्तमान उज्जैन) से था।","वे गुप्त सम्राट चंद्रगुप्त द्वितीय (विक्रमादित्य) के दरबार के नवरत्नों में से एक थे।","कालिदास को ''भारत का शेक्सपियर'' (Shakespeare of India) कहा जाता है। उन्होंने अभिज्ञानशाकुंतलम्, मेघदूतम् आदि महान रचनाएं लिखीं।"],"factsEn":["The great poet Kalidasa was associated with ancient Ujjayini (present-day Ujjain).","He was one of the Navaratnas in the court of Gupta Emperor Chandragupta II (Vikramaditya).","Kalidasa is called the ''Shakespeare of India''. He wrote great works like Abhijnanasakuntalam, Meghadutam, etc."],"mnemonics":["Kalidas in Mahakal''s city (Ujjain)"],"related":["चंद्रगुप्त विक्रमादित्य (Chandragupta Vikramaditya)","कालिदास अकादमी (Kalidas Academy - Ujjain)"],"memoryTip":"कालिदास और महाकाल दोनों उज्जैन की पहचान हैं।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ey0_n3-0Mu3O-ODmb_Tjl', '_fWSALCmCNJzP5E1syobu', 'ओरछा में स्थित भव्य ''जहाँगीर महल'' (Jahangir Mahal) का निर्माण किस बुंदेला शासक ने करवाया था?', '"[\"1) रुद्र प्रताप सिंह / Rudra Pratap Singh\",\"2) छत्रसाल / Chhatrasal\",\"3) वीर सिंह देव / Vir Singh Deo\",\"4) भारती चंद / Bharti Chand\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'Which Bundela ruler built the grand ''Jahangir Mahal'' located in Orchha?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["ओरछा के जहाँगीर महल का निर्माण राजा वीर सिंह देव (बुंदेला) ने 17वीं शताब्दी में करवाया था।","उन्होंने यह महल अपने मित्र और मुग़ल सम्राट जहाँगीर के स्वागत के लिए बनवाया था, जब वह ओरछा आ रहे थे।","वीर सिंह देव ने ही अबुल फज़ल की हत्या भी की थी।"],"factsEn":["The Jahangir Mahal of Orchha was built by King Vir Singh Deo (Bundela) in the 17th century.","He built this palace to welcome his friend and Mughal Emperor Jahangir, when he was visiting Orchha.","Vir Singh Deo was also the one who assassinated Abul Fazl."],"mnemonics":["Vir ka Jahangir (Vir Singh Deo - Jahangir Mahal)"],"related":["ओरछा (Orchha - Now in Niwari district)","अबुल फज़ल (Abul Fazl)"],"memoryTip":"जहाँगीर की दोस्ती के लिए ''वीर'' (वीर सिंह) ने पूरा महल खड़ा कर दिया।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('WaXIp936_90KdH2_vB20w', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'एक अश्वशक्ति (1 Horsepower) में कितने वाट होते हैं?', '"[\"1) 746 वाट / 746 Watt\",\"2) 1000 वाट / 1000 Watt\",\"3) 550 वाट / 550 Watt\",\"4) 786 वाट / 786 Watt\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'How many watts are there in one horsepower (1 HP)?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["1 अश्वशक्ति (Horsepower) 746 वाट के बराबर होती है।","यह शक्ति (Power) मापने की एक पुरानी इकाई है जो आमतौर पर मोटरों और इंजनों के लिए उपयोग की जाती है।","746 वाट को ''ब्रिटिश हॉर्सपावर'' भी कहा जाता है।"],"factsEn":["1 Horsepower (HP) is equal to 746 Watts.","It is an old unit of power commonly used for motors and engines.","746 Watts is also known as ''British Horsepower''."],"mnemonics":["7-4-6: Power fixes the horse''s mix."],"related":["वाट (Watt)","शक्ति (Power)"],"memoryTip":"Just remember the number 746. It is a very frequent question in MP exams."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('2x62zZNXLTuQS0zH60gZZ', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'कोशिका की ''आत्मघाती थैली'' (Suicide Bag) किसे कहा जाता है?', '"[\"1) राइबोसोम / Ribosome\",\"2) लाइसोसोम / Lysosome\",\"3) रिक्तिका / Vacuole\",\"4) सेंट्रोसोम / Centrosome\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'Which cell organelle is known as the ''Suicide Bag''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["लाइसोसोम (Lysosome) को कोशिका की आत्मघाती थैली कहा जाता है।","इनमें शक्तिशाली पाचक एंजाइम होते हैं जो कोशिका के क्षतिग्रस्त होने पर उसे ही पचा जाते हैं।","इनकी खोज क्रिश्चियन डी डुवे (Christian de Duve) ने की थी।"],"factsEn":["Lysosomes are known as the suicide bags of the cell.","They contain powerful digestive enzymes that can digest the cell itself if it gets damaged.","They were discovered by Christian de Duve."],"mnemonics":["Lyso-some ''Lyses'' (breaks down) the cell."],"related":["पाचक एंजाइम (Digestive Enzymes)","कोशिकांग (Cell Organelles)"],"memoryTip":"L for Lysosome, L for Lysis (destruction)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('VRyNm14PVkt3Vy5daPjBJ', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'विद्युत बल्ब का फिलामेंट (तंतु) किस धातु का बना होता है?', '"[\"1) तांबा / Copper\",\"2) नाइक्रोम / Nichrome\",\"3) टंगस्टन / Tungsten\",\"4) लोहा / Iron\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'The filament of an electric bulb is made of which metal?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["विद्युत बल्ब का फिलामेंट टंगस्टन (Tungsten) का बना होता है।","टंगस्टन का गलनांक (Melting Point) बहुत अधिक (लगभग 3422°C) होता है, जिससे यह उच्च ताप पर भी नहीं पिघलता।","टंगस्टन का रासायनिक प्रतीक ''W'' (वोल्फ्राम) है।"],"factsEn":["The filament of an electric bulb is made of Tungsten.","Tungsten has a very high melting point (approx 3422°C), preventing it from melting at high temperatures.","The chemical symbol for Tungsten is ''W'' (Wolfram)."],"mnemonics":["Tungsten stays Tough even when hot."],"related":["नाइक्रोम (Nichrome - used in heaters)","गलनांक (Melting Point)"],"memoryTip":"Heater use Nichrome, but Light Bulbs use Tungsten."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ls3rhlNg5fvFJPp0L-DJ-', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'मानव शरीर में सबसे छोटी हड्डी कौन सी है?', '"[\"1) फीमर / Femur\",\"2) स्टेपीज / Stapes\",\"3) पटेला / Patella\",\"4) टिबिया / Tibia\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'Which is the smallest bone in the human body?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["स्टेपीज (Stapes) मानव शरीर की सबसे छोटी हड्डी है, जो मध्य कान में पाई जाती है।","फीमर (जांघ की हड्डी) शरीर की सबसे बड़ी हड्डी है।","कान में कुल तीन छोटी हड्डियां होती हैं: मैलियस, इनकस और स्टेपीज।"],"factsEn":["The stapes is the smallest bone in the human body, found in the middle ear.","The femur (thigh bone) is the largest bone in the body.","There are three small bones in the ear: Malleus, Incus, and Stapes."],"mnemonics":["Stapes is small like a Staple pin."],"related":["कर्ण अस्थियां (Ear Ossicles)","कंकाल तंत्र (Skeletal System)"],"memoryTip":"Smallest is in the ear (Stapes), Largest is in the leg (Femur)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('e--Fl_WfQ_dsBFHJCYfHg', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'अम्ल वर्षा (Acid Rain) के लिए कौन सी गैसें मुख्य रूप से जिम्मेदार हैं?', '"[\"1) CO2 और CO\",\"2) SO2 और NO2\",\"3) CH4 और CO2\",\"4) N2 और O2\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'Which gases are primarily responsible for Acid Rain?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["सल्फर डाइऑक्साइड (SO2) और नाइट्रोजन डाइऑक्साइड (NO2) अम्ल वर्षा के मुख्य कारण हैं।","ये गैसें वायुमंडल में जल वाष्प के साथ मिलकर सल्फ्यूरिक और नाइट्रिक एसिड बनाती हैं।","अम्ल वर्षा ऐतिहासिक इमारतों (जैसे ताजमहल) और मिट्टी को नुकसान पहुंचाती है।"],"factsEn":["Sulfur Dioxide (SO2) and Nitrogen Dioxide (NO2) are the main causes of acid rain.","These gases react with water vapor in the atmosphere to form sulfuric and nitric acids.","Acid rain damages historical buildings (like Taj Mahal) and soil."],"mnemonics":["S and N (Sun) cause Rain (Acid)."],"related":["वायु प्रदूषण (Air Pollution)","ताजमहल का पीला होना (Yellowing of Taj Mahal)"],"memoryTip":"Think of Factories emitting Smoke (Sulfur) and Nitrogen. SO2 + NO2 = Acid Rain."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('nYSTM9xIuHtE4U5H02xq4', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'रक्त का लाल रंग किसके कारण होता है?', '"[\"1) प्लाज्मा / Plasma\",\"2) हीमोग्लोबिन / Hemoglobin\",\"3) प्लेटलेट्स / Platelets\",\"4) डब्ल्यूबीसी / WBC\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'The red color of blood is due to?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["रक्त का लाल रंग हीमोग्लोबिन (Hemoglobin) नामक प्रोटीन के कारण होता है।","हीमोग्लोबिन में लोहा (Iron) मौजूद होता है जो ऑक्सीजन के साथ जुड़ता है।","आरबीसी (RBC) में हीमोग्लोबिन पाया जाता है।"],"factsEn":["The red color of blood is due to a protein called Hemoglobin.","Hemoglobin contains Iron which binds with oxygen.","Hemoglobin is found in Red Blood Cells (RBCs)."],"mnemonics":["Hemo means blood, Globin is protein."],"related":["लाल रक्त कोशिकाएं (RBC)","आयरन (Iron)"],"memoryTip":"Iron ''rusts'' red; hemoglobin has iron, making blood red."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ao4FtIVqWdSNszXsBRPdP', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'विटामिन बी1 की कमी से कौन सा रोग होता है?', '"[\"1) स्कर्वी / Scurvy\",\"2) बेरीबेरी / Beriberi\",\"3) रिकेट्स / Rickets\",\"4) रतौंधी / Night Blindness\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'Which disease is caused by the deficiency of Vitamin B1?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["विटामिन बी1 (थायमिन) की कमी से बेरीबेरी रोग होता है।","यह तंत्रिका तंत्र और मांसपेशियों को प्रभावित करता है।","पालिश किए हुए चावल खाने से अक्सर बी1 की कमी हो जाती है।"],"factsEn":["Deficiency of Vitamin B1 (Thiamine) causes Beriberi.","It affects the nervous system and muscles.","Eating polished rice often leads to B1 deficiency."],"mnemonics":["B1 - Beriberi (Both start with B)."],"related":["थायमिन (Thiamine)","विटामिन बी कॉम्प्लेक्स (Vitamin B Complex)"],"memoryTip":"B1 matches with B-eri B-eri."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('mSJnJBSmuSmcNO4cs3wgm', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'दाब (Pressure) की SI इकाई क्या है?', '"[\"1) न्यूटन / Newton\",\"2) जूल / Joule\",\"3) पास्कल / Pascal\",\"4) वाट / Watt\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'What is the SI unit of Pressure?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["दाब की SI इकाई पास्कल (Pascal) है, जिसे प्रति वर्ग मीटर न्यूटन (N/m²) भी कहा जाता है।","दाब = बल / क्षेत्रफल (Pressure = Force / Area)।","ब्लेज पास्कल के सम्मान में इस इकाई का नाम रखा गया है।"],"factsEn":["The SI unit of pressure is Pascal (Pa), also called Newton per square meter (N/m²).","Pressure = Force / Area.","The unit is named after Blaise Pascal."],"mnemonics":["Press-cal (Pascal) the button."],"related":["बैरोमीटर (Barometer)","वायुमंडलीय दाब (Atmospheric Pressure)"],"memoryTip":"Think of pushing down on something - that is ''Pressure'', and we use ''Pascal'' to measure it."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('NTHoARCaVVRNXXd-zaC9t', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'किस गैस को ''स्ट्रेंजर गैस'' (Stranger Gas) भी कहा जाता है?', '"[\"1) आर्गन / Argon\",\"2) नियॉन / Neon\",\"3) जीनॉन / Xenon\",\"4) हीलियम / Helium\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'Which gas is also known as ''Stranger Gas''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["जीनॉन (Xenon) को ''स्ट्रेंजर गैस'' कहा जाता है क्योंकि ग्रीक शब्द ''Xenos'' का अर्थ ''अजनबी'' (Stranger) होता है।","यह एक उत्कृष्ट (Noble) गैस है जो बहुत कम पाई जाती है।","इसका परमाणु क्रमांक 54 है।"],"factsEn":["Xenon is called ''Stranger Gas'' because the Greek word ''Xenos'' means ''stranger''.","It is a noble gas found in trace amounts.","Its atomic number is 54."],"mnemonics":["Xeno = Xenophobia (fear of strangers) -> Xenon is the Stranger."],"related":["अक्रिय गैसें (Inert Gases)","आवर्त सारणी (Periodic Table)"],"memoryTip":"Xeno prefix always relates to ''foreign'' or ''stranger''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('dHanai0qNI4OFTuMq3sYs', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'पेनिसिलिन, जो पहला एंटीबायोटिक था, किससे प्राप्त किया गया था?', '"[\"1) जीवाणु / Bacteria\",\"2) कवक / Fungus\",\"3) शैवाल / Algae\",\"4) वायरस / Virus\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'Penicillin, the first antibiotic, was obtained from?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["पेनिसिलिन एक कवक (Fungus) से प्राप्त किया गया था जिसका नाम ''पेनिसिलियम नोटेटम'' है।","इसकी खोज अलेक्जेंडर फ्लेमिंग ने 1928 में की थी।","यह जीवाणु संक्रमण (Bacterial infections) के इलाज के लिए इस्तेमाल की जाने वाली पहली दवा थी।"],"factsEn":["Penicillin was obtained from a fungus named ''Penicillium notatum''.","It was discovered by Alexander Fleming in 1928.","It was the first drug used to treat bacterial infections."],"mnemonics":["Fun-gus = Penicillin is ''Fun'' because it saves lives."],"related":["अलेक्जेंडर फ्लेमिंग (Alexander Fleming)","प्रतिजैविक (Antibiotics)"],"memoryTip":"It''s a common mistake to think it comes from bacteria; it''s actually from ''Mould'' which is a fungus."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('CCIVcIW9iAEQAqFfwSwx9', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'रसोई गैस (LPG) का मुख्य घटक क्या है?', '"[\"1) मीथेन / Methane\",\"2) इथेन / Ethane\",\"3) ब्यूटेन / Butane\",\"4) प्रोपेन / Propane\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 11, 'General', 'What is the main component of LPG (Cooking Gas)?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["LPG (तरलीकृत पेट्रोलियम गैस) का मुख्य घटक ब्यूटेन (Butane) है।","इसमें प्रोपेन भी शामिल होता है, लेकिन ब्यूटेन की मात्रा अधिक होती है।","गैस रिसाव का पता लगाने के लिए इसमें इथाइल मरकैप्टन मिलाया जाता है।"],"factsEn":["The main component of LPG (Liquefied Petroleum Gas) is Butane.","It also contains propane, but butane is present in higher quantities.","Ethyl Mercaptan is added for leak detection."],"mnemonics":["Gas Cylinder = Big ''B'' (Butane)."],"related":["ब्यूटेन (C4H10)","एलपीजी (LPG)"],"memoryTip":"LPG = Butane. CNG = Methane. (L-B, C-M)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('TS43PvVAlBPXN51dmsYyW', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'निकट दृष्टिदोष (Myopia) के निवारण के लिए किस लेंस का उपयोग किया जाता है?', '"[\"1) उत्तल लेंस / Convex Lens\",\"2) अवतल लेंस / Concave Lens\",\"3) बेलनाकार लेंस / Cylindrical Lens\",\"4) समतल लेंस / Plane Lens\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 12, 'General', 'Which lens is used to correct Myopia?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["निकट दृष्टिदोष (Myopia) में व्यक्ति पास की वस्तुएं देख सकता है लेकिन दूर की नहीं।","इसे ठीक करने के लिए अवतल लेंस (Concave Lens) का उपयोग किया जाता है।","उत्तल लेंस का उपयोग दूर दृष्टिदोष (Hypermetropia) के लिए होता है।"],"factsEn":["In Myopia, a person can see near objects but not distant ones.","It is corrected using a Concave Lens.","Convex lenses are used for Hypermetropia."],"mnemonics":["My-opia is Near (Short word, short distance), needs ''Cave'' to see far."],"related":["हाइपरमेट्रोपिया (Hypermetropia)","नेत्र लेंस (Eye Lens)"],"memoryTip":"Concave ''spreads'' light to fix distant vision."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('byGppR6k3-1Z6G0BizOVY', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'विद्युत धारा की दिशा किस यंत्र से पता लगाई जा सकती है?', '"[\"1) एमीटर / Ammeter\",\"2) वोल्टमीटर / Voltmeter\",\"3) गैल्वेनोमीटर / Galvanometer\",\"4) जनरेटर / Generator\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 13, 'General', 'Which instrument is used to detect the direction of electric current?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["गैल्वेनोमीटर का उपयोग परिपथ में विद्युत धारा की उपस्थिति और दिशा का पता लगाने के लिए किया जाता है।","एमीटर केवल धारा की मात्रा (Magnitude) मापता है।","यह बहुत कम मात्रा की धारा को भी माप सकता है।"],"factsEn":["A galvanometer is used to detect the presence and direction of electric current in a circuit.","An Ammeter only measures the magnitude of the current.","It can detect even very small amounts of current."],"mnemonics":["G for Galvanometer, G for Guide (direction)."],"related":["विद्युत परिपथ (Electric Circuit)","एमीटर (Ameter)"],"memoryTip":"Ammeter measures, Galvanometer detects."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('zSigK4MDD3hSjxQLWVLDw', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'रेबीज के टीके की खोज किसने की थी?', '"[\"1) एडवर्ड जेनर / Edward Jenner\",\"2) लुई पाश्चर / Louis Pasteur\",\"3) अलेक्जेंडर फ्लेमिंग / Alexander Fleming\",\"4) रॉबर्ट कोच / Robert Koch\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 14, 'General', 'Who discovered the Rabies vaccine?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["रेबीज के टीके की खोज लुई पाश्चर (Louis Pasteur) ने की थी।","उन्होंने ''पाश्चराइजेशन'' की प्रक्रिया भी विकसित की थी।","एडवर्ड जेनर ने चेचक (Smallpox) के टीके की खोज की थी।"],"factsEn":["The Rabies vaccine was discovered by Louis Pasteur.","He also developed the process of ''Pasteurization''.","Edward Jenner discovered the Smallpox vaccine."],"mnemonics":["Pasteur = Protection from Rabid dogs."],"related":["पाश्चराइजेशन (Pasteurization)","वैक्सीन (Vaccine)"],"memoryTip":"Pasteur is a big name in vaccines and milk (Pasteurization)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('gxjaPBiU2AIEOReFgpvzv', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'भोपाल गैस त्रासदी में रिसाव होने वाली गैस का नाम क्या था?', '"[\"1) मिथाइल आइसोसाइनेट / Methyl Isocyanate\",\"2) कार्बन मोनोऑक्साइड / Carbon Monoxide\",\"3) एथिल आइसोसाइनेट / Ethyl Isocyanate\",\"4) पोटेशियम साइनाइड / Potassium Cyanide\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 15, 'General', 'What was the name of the gas leaked in the Bhopal Gas Tragedy?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["भोपाल गैस त्रासदी (1984) में मिथाइल आइसोसाइनेट (MIC) गैस का रिसाव हुआ था।","यह यूनियन कार्बाइड कीटनाशक संयंत्र से लीक हुई थी।","यह औद्योगिक इतिहास की सबसे बड़ी त्रासदियों में से एक है।"],"factsEn":["Methyl Isocyanate (MIC) gas leaked in the Bhopal Gas Tragedy (1984).","It leaked from the Union Carbide pesticide plant.","It is one of the biggest tragedies in industrial history."],"mnemonics":["MIC - Methyl Isocyanate."],"related":["यूनियन कार्बाइड (Union Carbide)","1984"],"memoryTip":"Important for MP exams. Remember ''MIC''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('3ucnhmoQPVW3Y5JKTpHpj', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'लोहे पर जंग लगना (Rusting of Iron) किस प्रकार की अभिक्रिया है?', '"[\"1) भौतिक परिवर्तन / Physical change\",\"2) रासायनिक परिवर्तन / Chemical change\",\"3) प्रतिवर्ती परिवर्तन / Reversible change\",\"4) जैविक परिवर्तन / Biological change\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 16, 'General', 'Rusting of iron is which type of reaction?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["लोहे पर जंग लगना एक रासायनिक परिवर्तन और ऑक्सीकरण अभिक्रिया (Oxidation) है।","इसमें लोहे की सतह ऑक्सीजन और नमी के संपर्क में आकर हाइड्रेटेड आयरन ऑक्साइड (जंग) बनाती है।","जंग लगने से लोहे का वजन बढ़ जाता है।"],"factsEn":["Rusting of iron is a chemical change and an oxidation reaction.","Iron reacts with oxygen and moisture to form hydrated iron oxide (rust).","The weight of iron increases upon rusting."],"mnemonics":["Rust = Reaction."],"related":["ऑक्सीकरण (Oxidation)","गैल्वेनाइजेशन (Galvanization)"],"memoryTip":"Once rusted, it cannot be easily turned back into original iron, so it is a chemical change."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('9zWxH2lAgMmKBuR-OtLS4', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'वायुमंडल की किस परत में मौसम संबंधी घटनाएं (बादल, बारिश) होती हैं?', '"[\"1) समताप मंडल / Stratosphere\",\"2) क्षोभ मंडल / Troposphere\",\"3) मध्य मंडल / Mesosphere\",\"4) बाह्य मंडल / Exosphere\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 17, 'General', 'In which layer of the atmosphere do weather phenomena (clouds, rain) occur?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["सभी मौसम संबंधी घटनाएं क्षोभ मंडल (Troposphere) में होती हैं।","यह वायुमंडल की सबसे निचली परत है।","ओजोन परत समताप मंडल (Stratosphere) में पाई जाती है।"],"factsEn":["All weather phenomena occur in the Troposphere.","It is the lowermost layer of the atmosphere.","The ozone layer is found in the Stratosphere."],"mnemonics":["Tropo = Trouble (Weather trouble)."],"related":["वायुमंडल की परतें (Atmospheric Layers)","ओजोन परत (Ozone Layer)"],"memoryTip":"The layer we live in is where the weather happens: Troposphere."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('fuiCMAPJh26iujxy9LH3p', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'आनुवंशिकता (Heredity) की बुनियादी इकाई क्या है?', '"[\"1) गुणसूत्र / Chromosome\",\"2) जीन / Gene\",\"3) डीएनए / DNA\",\"4) कोशिका / Cell\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 18, 'General', 'What is the basic unit of Heredity?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["जीन (Gene) आनुवंशिकता की बुनियादी भौतिक और कार्यात्मक इकाई है।","जीन डीएनए (DNA) के बने होते हैं।","यह माता-पिता से संतानों में लक्षणों को ले जाते हैं।"],"factsEn":["The gene is the basic physical and functional unit of heredity.","Genes are made up of DNA.","They carry traits from parents to offspring."],"mnemonics":["Gene = Genetics unit."],"related":["ग्रेगर मेंडल (Gregor Mendel)","डीएनए (DNA)"],"memoryTip":"DNA is the material, but ''Gene'' is the specific instruction or unit."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('65j-hXSU3MquUBjwTbgcw', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'मनुष्य के हृदय की धड़कन मापने वाले यंत्र को क्या कहते हैं?', '"[\"1) स्फिग्मोमैनोमीटर / Sphygmomanometer\",\"2) स्टेथोस्कोप / Stethoscope\",\"3) पेसमेकर / Pacemaker\",\"4) ईसीजी / ECG\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 19, 'General', 'What is the instrument used to measure/hear the human heartbeat called?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["हृदय की धड़कन सुनने के लिए स्टेथोस्कोप (Stethoscope) का उपयोग किया जाता है।","इसका आविष्कार रेने लैनक (Rene Laennec) ने किया था।","यह ध्वनि के ''परावर्तन'' (Reflection) के सिद्धांत पर काम करता है।"],"factsEn":["A stethoscope is used to hear the heartbeat.","It was invented by Rene Laennec.","It works on the principle of multiple reflection of sound."],"mnemonics":["Stetho = Chest (Greek)."],"related":["हृदय की धड़कन (Heartbeat)","ध्वनि परावर्तन (Sound Reflection)"],"memoryTip":"The tool around a doctor''s neck is the Stethoscope."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('7w6np2ExRfqhoTnalkkSm', 'HG7AODa05gU3lbrCbgD1n', 'पेड़-पौधे रात में कौन सी गैस छोड़ते हैं?', '"[\"1) ऑक्सीजन / Oxygen\",\"2) कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड / Carbon Dioxide\",\"3) नाइट्रोजन / Nitrogen\",\"4) हाइड्रोजन / Hydrogen\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 20, 'General', 'Which gas do plants release at night?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["रात में प्रकाश संश्लेषण (Photosynthesis) नहीं होता, इसलिए पौधे केवल श्वसन (Respiration) करते हैं और कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड (CO2) छोड़ते हैं।","दिन में वे ऑक्सीजन छोड़ते हैं और CO2 लेते हैं।","पीपल और तुलसी जैसे कुछ पौधे रात में भी ऑक्सीजन छोड़ सकते हैं।"],"factsEn":["Photosynthesis does not occur at night, so plants only respire and release Carbon Dioxide (CO2).","During the day, they release Oxygen and intake CO2.","Some plants like Peepal and Tulsi can release oxygen even at night."],"mnemonics":["Night = No Light = No Photosynthesis = CO2 out."],"related":["प्रकाश संश्लेषण (Photosynthesis)","श्वसन (Respiration)"],"memoryTip":"That''s why it''s advised not to sleep under trees at night."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('-JOAdrdepIOaIuQd1uDds', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'संख्या 45678 में 5 का स्थानीय मान (Place value) क्या है?', '"[\"1) 5\",\"2) 50\",\"3) 500\",\"4) 5000\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'What is the place value of 5 in the number 45678?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["किसी अंक का स्थानीय मान (Place value) उसके स्थान (इकाई, दहाई, सैकड़ा, हज़ार आदि) पर निर्भर करता है।","संख्या 45678 में 5 हज़ार (Thousands) के स्थान पर है।","इसलिए 5 का स्थानीय मान = 5 × 1000 = 5000।"],"stepsEn":["The place value of a digit depends on its position (ones, tens, hundreds, thousands, etc.).","In the number 45678, 5 is at the thousands place.","So, place value of 5 = 5 × 1000 = 5000."],"shortcut":"5 के बाद जितने अंक हैं, उतने ही शून्य (0) लगा दें। 5 के बाद 3 अंक हैं, तो 5000।","trap":"छात्र स्थानीय मान (Place value) और अंकित मान (Face value = 5) में भ्रमित हो सकते हैं। / Students might confuse place value with face value (which is just 5).","memoryTip":"स्थान (Place) = वह कहाँ बैठा है (जैसे हज़ार)। अंकित (Face) = वह कैसा दिखता है (वह अंक स्वयं)। / Place = Where it sits. Face = How it looks (the digit itself)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('I22CW6lQPzNF5H-xJJHkD', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'किसी संख्या का 20% 50 है। वह संख्या क्या है?', '"[\"1) 100\",\"2) 200\",\"3) 250\",\"4) 500\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', '20% of a number is 50. What is the number?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मान लें कि वह संख्या x है।","प्रश्न के अनुसार: x का 20% = 50","x × (20 / 100) = 50","x × (1 / 5) = 50","x = 50 × 5 = 250"],"stepsEn":["Let the number be x.","According to question: 20% of x = 50","x × (20 / 100) = 50","x × (1 / 5) = 50","x = 50 × 5 = 250"],"shortcut":"20% = 50। 100% निकालने के लिए दोनों तरफ 5 से गुणा करें। 50 × 5 = 250।","trap":"छात्र 50 का 20% निकाल सकते हैं और उत्तर 10 सोच सकते हैं। / Students might calculate 20% of 50 and think the answer is 10.","memoryTip":"कोई भी संख्या अपने आप में हमेशा 100% होती है। / Any number is always 100% of itself."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('DI7hDbY5nJ1TirnH9-Gm1', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'एक कुर्सी को ₹400 में खरीदकर ₹500 में बेचा गया। लाभ प्रतिशत क्या है?', '"[\"1) 10%\",\"2) 20%\",\"3) 25%\",\"4) 30%\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'A chair is bought for ₹400 and sold for ₹500. What is the profit percentage?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["क्रय मूल्य (CP) = ₹400","विक्रय मूल्य (SP) = ₹500","लाभ = SP - CP = 500 - 400 = ₹100","लाभ प्रतिशत = (लाभ / क्रय मूल्य) × 100","लाभ प्रतिशत = (100 / 400) × 100 = (1 / 4) × 100 = 25%"],"stepsEn":["Cost Price (CP) = ₹400","Selling Price (SP) = ₹500","Profit = SP - CP = 500 - 400 = ₹100","Profit percentage = (Profit / CP) × 100","Profit percentage = (100 / 400) × 100 = (1 / 4) × 100 = 25%"],"shortcut":"100 का लाभ 400 पर। 1/4 का मतलब सीधा 25% होता है।","trap":"छात्र विक्रय मूल्य (500) पर लाभ प्रतिशत निकाल सकते हैं (100/500 = 20%), जो गलत है। / Students might calculate profit % on SP (100/500 = 20%), which is wrong.","memoryTip":"लाभ और हानि की गणना हमेशा उस मूल्य पर होती है जिस पर वस्तु ''खरीदी'' गई (CP)। / Profit and Loss are always calculated on the ''Buying'' price (CP)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('uoBmaZ9pvrAvZjWTQCpch', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'A एक काम को 15 दिन में करता है, B उसी काम को 30 दिन में करता है। दोनों मिलकर उस काम को कितने दिन में करेंगे?', '"[\"1) 10 दिन / 10 Days\",\"2) 12 दिन / 12 Days\",\"3) 15 दिन / 15 Days\",\"4) 20 दिन / 20 Days\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'A does a work in 15 days, B does the same work in 30 days. In how many days will they do the work together?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["कुल कार्य = 15 और 30 का लघुत्तम समापवर्त्य (LCM) = 30 इकाई","A की एक दिन की क्षमता = 30 / 15 = 2 इकाई/दिन","B की एक दिन की क्षमता = 30 / 30 = 1 इकाई/दिन","दोनों की कुल क्षमता = 2 + 1 = 3 इकाई/दिन","दोनों द्वारा लिया गया कुल समय = कुल कार्य / कुल क्षमता","समय = 30 / 3 = 10 दिन"],"stepsEn":["Total work = LCM of 15 and 30 = 30 units","A''s 1 day efficiency = 30 / 15 = 2 units/day","B''s 1 day efficiency = 30 / 30 = 1 unit/day","Total efficiency = 2 + 1 = 3 units/day","Total time taken = Total work / Total efficiency","Time = 30 / 3 = 10 days"],"shortcut":"सूत्र: (A × B) / (A + B) = (15 × 30) / (15 + 30) = 450 / 45 = 10 दिन।","trap":"छात्र दोनों दिनों का औसत (15+30)/2 = 22.5 निकाल सकते हैं, जो कार्य-समय में काम नहीं करता। / Students might find the average of days (15+30)/2, which doesn''t work in Time & Work.","memoryTip":"दो लोगों के मिलकर काम करने पर हमेशा (xy) / (x+y) वाला जादुई सूत्र याद रखें। / For two people working together, always remember the magic formula (xy) / (x+y)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('bVLVBN8ZBnT8EEju9_YYK', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'एक कार 72 किमी/घंटा की गति से चल रही है। उसकी गति मीटर/सेकंड में क्या होगी?', '"[\"1) 15 मीटर/सेकंड / 15 m/s\",\"2) 18 मीटर/सेकंड / 18 m/s\",\"3) 20 मीटर/सेकंड / 20 m/s\",\"4) 25 मीटर/सेकंड / 25 m/s\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'A car is running at a speed of 72 km/hr. What will be its speed in m/s?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["किमी/घंटा (km/h) को मीटर/सेकंड (m/s) में बदलने के लिए गति को 5/18 से गुणा करते हैं।","गति = 72 × (5 / 18)","18 से 72 को 4 बार काटें (18 × 4 = 72)।","गति = 4 × 5 = 20 मीटर/सेकंड।"],"stepsEn":["To convert km/hr to m/s, multiply the speed by 5/18.","Speed = 72 × (5 / 18)","Cancel 72 by 18 by 4 times (18 × 4 = 72).","Speed = 4 × 5 = 20 m/s."],"shortcut":"18 का पहाड़ा याद रखें: 18 km/h = 5 m/s। 72 (18 का 4 गुना) = 20 (5 का 4 गुना)।","trap":"छात्र गलती से 18/5 से गुणा कर सकते हैं और गलत उत्तर निकाल सकते हैं। / Students might mistakenly multiply by 18/5 and get a wrong answer.","memoryTip":"बड़े (km) से छोटे (m) में जाना है, तो छोटा नंबर (5) ऊपर रहेगा -> 5/18। / To go from big (km) to small (m), keep small number (5) on top -> 5/18."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('G0AhxpYP21o46IxTx1GIL', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', '₹2000 पर 5% वार्षिक दर से 3 वर्ष का साधारण ब्याज क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) ₹200\",\"2) ₹300\",\"3) ₹400\",\"4) ₹500\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'What will be the simple interest on ₹2000 at 5% per annum for 3 years?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मूलधन (P) = ₹2000","दर (R) = 5% वार्षिक","समय (T) = 3 वर्ष","साधारण ब्याज (SI) का सूत्र = (P × R × T) / 100","SI = (2000 × 5 × 3) / 100","दो शून्य से दो शून्य काटें: SI = 20 × 15 = ₹300"],"stepsEn":["Principal (P) = ₹2000","Rate (R) = 5% per annum","Time (T) = 3 years","Formula for Simple Interest (SI) = (P × R × T) / 100","SI = (2000 × 5 × 3) / 100","Cancel two zeros: SI = 20 × 15 = ₹300"],"shortcut":"कुल ब्याज = 5% × 3 वर्ष = 15%। ₹2000 का 15% = ₹300।","trap":"छात्र मिश्रधन (2300) को उत्तर मान सकते हैं यदि वे ब्याज को मूलधन में जोड़ दें। / Students might mark amount (2300) as answer if they add interest to principal.","memoryTip":"SI हमेशा हर साल समान रहता है। (R × T) % सीधा मूलधन पर लगा दें। / SI remains the same every year. Apply (R × T) % directly on principal."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('nwOp_GQG5Q73CLHJTeVeN', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'एक वर्ग (Square) की भुजा 12 मीटर है। उसका क्षेत्रफल क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 24 वर्ग मीटर / 24 sq m\",\"2) 48 वर्ग मीटर / 48 sq m\",\"3) 120 वर्ग मीटर / 120 sq m\",\"4) 144 वर्ग मीटर / 144 sq m\"]"', '4', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'The side of a square is 12m. What will be its area?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["वर्ग की भुजा (Side) = 12 मीटर","वर्ग के क्षेत्रफल का सूत्र = भुजा × भुजा (Side²)","क्षेत्रफल = 12 × 12","क्षेत्रफल = 144 वर्ग मीटर (sq m)"],"stepsEn":["Side of the square = 12 meters","Formula for area of a square = Side × Side (Side²)","Area = 12 × 12","Area = 144 sq m"],"shortcut":"सीधा 12 का वर्ग (square) करें: 12² = 144।","trap":"छात्र क्षेत्रफल के बजाय परिमाप (Perimeter) निकाल सकते हैं: 4 × 12 = 48। / Students might calculate perimeter instead of area: 4 × 12 = 48.","memoryTip":"क्षेत्रफल (Area) = 2D (a²)। परिमाप (Perimeter) = 1D लंबाई (4a)। / Area = 2D (a²). Perimeter = 1D length (4a)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('aZi03SSGBgbbeWgbyHGG3', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', '₹1000 को A और B के बीच 2:3 के अनुपात में बांटा गया। A का हिस्सा कितना है?', '"[\"1) ₹200\",\"2) ₹400\",\"3) ₹500\",\"4) ₹600\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', '₹1000 is divided between A and B in the ratio 2:3. What is A''s share?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["A और B का अनुपात = 2 : 3","अनुपातों का कुल योग = 2 + 3 = 5 भाग","5 भाग = ₹1000","1 भाग = 1000 / 5 = ₹200","A का हिस्सा 2 भाग है, इसलिए = 2 × 200 = ₹400"],"stepsEn":["Ratio of A and B = 2 : 3","Total sum of ratios = 2 + 3 = 5 parts","5 parts = ₹1000","1 part = 1000 / 5 = ₹200","A''s share is 2 parts, so = 2 × 200 = ₹400"],"shortcut":"A का हिस्सा = (A का अनुपात / कुल अनुपात) × कुल राशि = (2 / 5) × 1000 = 400।","trap":"छात्र B का हिस्सा (600) निकाल कर गलती से टिक कर सकते हैं। / Students might calculate B''s share (600) and mistakenly tick it.","memoryTip":"हमेशा कुल राशि को अनुपातों के योग से भाग दें, यह 1 इकाई (unit) का मान देता है। / Always divide total amount by sum of ratios, it gives the value of 1 unit."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('jJmnVLGzXRDxPdnW2QTP4', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', '5 छात्रों के अंक 10, 15, 20, 25 और 30 हैं। इनका औसत (Average) क्या है?', '"[\"1) 15\",\"2) 20\",\"3) 22\",\"4) 25\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'The marks of 5 students are 10, 15, 20, 25 and 30. What is their average?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["औसत = राशियों का योग / राशियों की कुल संख्या","अंकों का योग = 10 + 15 + 20 + 25 + 30 = 100","छात्रों की कुल संख्या = 5","औसत = 100 / 5 = 20"],"stepsEn":["Average = Sum of observations / Total number of observations","Sum of marks = 10 + 15 + 20 + 25 + 30 = 100","Total number of students = 5","Average = 100 / 5 = 20"],"shortcut":"चूंकि सभी संख्याओं के बीच समान अंतर (5) है, इसलिए बीच वाली संख्या (Middle number) ही औसत होती है। यहाँ बीच में 20 है।","trap":"योग करने में गलती (जैसे 90 या 110) होने पर गलत औसत आ सकता है। / Addition errors (like 90 or 110) can lead to a wrong average.","memoryTip":"समांतर श्रेणी (समान अंतर वाली सीरीज) में औसत हमेशा बीच वाली संख्या (Middle term) होती है। / In an Arithmetic Progression (series with equal gap), the average is always the middle term."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Eaa6jU98OfJi00kymCFQv', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'यदि 3x + 15 = 45 है, तो x का मान क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 5\",\"2) 10\",\"3) 15\",\"4) 20\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'If 3x + 15 = 45, what will be the value of x?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["दिया गया समीकरण: 3x + 15 = 45","+15 को दूसरी तरफ ले जाएँ (पक्षांतरण), यह -15 हो जाएगा।","3x = 45 - 15","3x = 30","x = 30 / 3","x = 10"],"stepsEn":["Given equation: 3x + 15 = 45","Move +15 to the other side (transposition), it becomes -15.","3x = 45 - 15","3x = 30","x = 30 / 3","x = 10"],"shortcut":"विकल्पों को x की जगह रखकर देखें: 3(10) + 15 = 30 + 15 = 45 (विकल्प 2 सही है)।","trap":"छात्र 45 में 15 जोड़कर 60 कर सकते हैं (3x = 60 => x = 20)। / Students might add 15 to 45 (3x = 60 => x = 20).","memoryTip":"बराबर (=) के दूसरी तरफ जाने पर निशान (Sign) बदल जाते हैं: + का -, और - का +। / Signs change when moving across the equals (=) sign: + becomes -, and - becomes +."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('jT6iXa9DbQ0qfCQZfH0K_', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', '12 और 16 का लघुत्तम समापवर्त्य (LCM) क्या है?', '"[\"1) 24\",\"2) 32\",\"3) 48\",\"4) 96\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 11, 'General', 'What is the LCM of 12 and 16?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["LCM वह सबसे छोटी संख्या होती है जो 12 और 16 दोनों के पहाड़े (Table) में आती है।","12 के गुणज (Multiples) = 12, 24, 36, 48, 60...","16 के गुणज (Multiples) = 16, 32, 48, 64...","दोनों में मिलने वाला सबसे पहला और छोटा गुणज 48 है।","अतः LCM = 48।"],"stepsEn":["LCM is the smallest number that comes in the multiplication table of both 12 and 16.","Multiples of 12 = 12, 24, 36, 48, 60...","Multiples of 16 = 16, 32, 48, 64...","The first and smallest common multiple in both is 48.","Hence, LCM = 48."],"shortcut":"बड़ी संख्या (16) का पहाड़ा पढ़ें और देखें कि क्या छोटी संख्या (12) उसे काट रही है: 16×2=32 (12 से नहीं कटता), 16×3=48 (12 से कटता है)। अतः 48।","trap":"छात्र इन दोनों का गुणा (12×16=192) कर सकते हैं, जो गुणज तो है पर ''लघुत्तम'' (Lowest) नहीं है। / Students might multiply both (192), which is a multiple but not the ''Lowest''.","memoryTip":"LCM हमेशा दी गई सबसे बड़ी संख्या के बराबर या उससे बड़ा होता है। / LCM is always equal to or greater than the largest given number."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('-RiyIZkuBXfhE5FsMAZIp', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', '1/2 + 1/4 + 1/8 का मान क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 3/8\",\"2) 5/8\",\"3) 7/8\",\"4) 1\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 12, 'General', 'What will be the value of 1/2 + 1/4 + 1/8?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["भिन्नों को जोड़ने के लिए सबसे पहले हर (Denominators) 2, 4, 8 का LCM निकालें।","2, 4, और 8 का LCM = 8।","सभी भिन्नों का हर 8 बनाएँ: 1/2 = 4/8, 1/4 = 2/8, 1/8 = 1/8।","अब अंश (Numerators) को जोड़ लें: (4 + 2 + 1) / 8","योग = 7/8"],"stepsEn":["To add fractions, first find the LCM of denominators 2, 4, and 8.","LCM of 2, 4, and 8 = 8.","Make all denominators 8: 1/2 = 4/8, 1/4 = 2/8, 1/8 = 1/8.","Now add the numerators: (4 + 2 + 1) / 8","Sum = 7/8"],"shortcut":"आधार (Base) को 8 मानकर सीधा सोचें: 8 का आधा (4), चौथाई (2), और आठवां हिस्सा (1)। 4+2+1 = 7। अतः 7/8।","trap":"छात्र अंश और हर को सीधे जोड़ सकते हैं (1+1+1 / 2+4+8 = 3/14), जो पूरी तरह गलत है। / Students might directly add numerators and denominators (3/14), which is completely wrong.","memoryTip":"भिन्न (Fraction) तभी जुड़ते या घटते हैं जब उनके नीचे वाला हिस्सा (हर/Denominator) एक समान हो। / Fractions can only be added/subtracted when their bottom part (Denominator) is exactly the same."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('jkL_dWSYXaTcRePm19tMs', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'एक त्रिभुज के दो कोण 50° और 60° हैं। तीसरा कोण क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 50°\",\"2) 60°\",\"3) 70°\",\"4) 80°\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 13, 'General', 'Two angles of a triangle are 50° and 60°. What will be the third angle?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["त्रिभुज के तीनों आंतरिक कोणों का योग हमेशा 180° होता है।","दिए गए दो कोणों का योग = 50° + 60° = 110°","तीसरा कोण = 180° - दोनों कोणों का योग","तीसरा कोण = 180° - 110° = 70°"],"stepsEn":["The sum of all three interior angles of a triangle is always 180°.","Sum of given two angles = 50° + 60° = 110°","Third angle = 180° - sum of two angles","Third angle = 180° - 110° = 70°"],"shortcut":"50 + 60 = 110। 180 तक पहुँचने के लिए 70 और चाहिए।","trap":"छात्र तीनों कोणों का योग 360° (चतुर्भुज का) मानकर 360 - 110 = 250° कर सकते हैं। / Students might assume total sum as 360° (like a quadrilateral) and do 360 - 110.","memoryTip":"त्रिभुज (Triangle) = 180°, चतुर्भुज (Quadrilateral) = 360°। / Triangle = 180°, Quadrilateral = 360°."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('EAJk9dU9no0rQ6k_63jWf', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', '₹500 अंकित मूल्य (Marked Price) वाली शर्ट पर 20% की छूट दी जाती है। शर्ट का विक्रय मूल्य (Selling Price) क्या है?', '"[\"1) ₹300\",\"2) ₹350\",\"3) ₹400\",\"4) ₹450\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 14, 'General', 'A shirt with marked price ₹500 is sold at a 20% discount. What is the selling price of the shirt?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["अंकित मूल्य (MP) = ₹500","छूट प्रतिशत = 20%","छूट की राशि = 500 का 20%","छूट = 500 × (20 / 100) = ₹100","विक्रय मूल्य (SP) = अंकित मूल्य - छूट","SP = 500 - 100 = ₹400"],"stepsEn":["Marked Price (MP) = ₹500","Discount Percentage = 20%","Discount Amount = 20% of 500","Discount = 500 × (20 / 100) = ₹100","Selling Price (SP) = Marked Price - Discount","SP = 500 - 100 = ₹400"],"shortcut":"20% की छूट का मतलब है कि वस्तु 80% मूल्य पर बेची जा रही है। 500 का 80% = 500 × 0.8 = 400।","trap":"छात्र ₹100 की छूट निकालकर उसी को उत्तर मान सकते हैं। / Students might calculate the ₹100 discount and assume it as the answer.","memoryTip":"छूट हमेशा अंकित मूल्य (MRP / Marked Price) पर दी जाती है। / Discount is always given on Marked Price (MRP)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('1MhaOU4b0qmwM0rHaqs9e', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'एक 200 मीटर लंबी ट्रेन एक बिजली के खंभे को पार करने में 10 सेकंड लेती है। ट्रेन की गति मीटर/सेकंड में क्या है?', '"[\"1) 10\",\"2) 15\",\"3) 20\",\"4) 25\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 15, 'General', 'A 200 meter long train takes 10 seconds to cross an electric pole. What is the speed of the train in m/s?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["जब ट्रेन किसी खंभे या खड़े व्यक्ति को पार करती है, तो ट्रेन द्वारा तय की गई कुल दूरी उसकी अपनी लंबाई के बराबर होती है।","तय की गई दूरी (Distance) = 200 मीटर","लिया गया समय (Time) = 10 सेकंड","गति (Speed) = दूरी / समय","गति = 200 / 10 = 20 मीटर/सेकंड"],"stepsEn":["When a train crosses a pole or a standing person, the total distance covered is equal to its own length.","Distance covered = 200 meters","Time taken = 10 seconds","Speed = Distance / Time","Speed = 200 / 10 = 20 m/s"],"shortcut":"सीधा 200 में 10 का भाग दें: 200 / 10 = 20।","trap":"इस सरल प्रश्न में कोई बड़ा ट्रैप नहीं है, लेकिन छात्र कभी-कभी किमी/घंटा में बदलने लग जाते हैं जबकि पूछा मीटर/सेकंड में ही है। / Students might start converting it to km/h unnecessarily.","memoryTip":"खंभा (Pole) या व्यक्ति (Person) की चौड़ाई शून्य (0) मानी जाती है। / Width of a pole or a person is considered zero (0)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('zU6sVTd9wYb9LsCyAnRCd', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'राम और श्याम की वर्तमान आयु का योग 40 वर्ष है। 5 वर्ष बाद उनकी आयु का योग क्या होगा?', '"[\"1) 45 वर्ष / 45 Years\",\"2) 50 वर्ष / 50 Years\",\"3) 55 वर्ष / 55 Years\",\"4) 60 वर्ष / 60 Years\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 16, 'General', 'The sum of present ages of Ram and Shyam is 40 years. What will be the sum of their ages after 5 years?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["वर्तमान में राम + श्याम = 40 वर्ष।","5 वर्ष बाद राम की आयु में 5 वर्ष की वृद्धि होगी।","5 वर्ष बाद श्याम की आयु में भी 5 वर्ष की वृद्धि होगी।","कुल वृद्धि = 5 + 5 = 10 वर्ष।","नया योग = 40 + 10 = 50 वर्ष।"],"stepsEn":["Presently Ram + Shyam = 40 years.","After 5 years, Ram''s age will increase by 5 years.","After 5 years, Shyam''s age will also increase by 5 years.","Total increase = 5 + 5 = 10 years.","New sum = 40 + 10 = 50 years."],"shortcut":"नया योग = पुराना योग + (व्यक्तियों की संख्या × वर्ष) = 40 + (2 × 5) = 50।","trap":"छात्र 40 में सिर्फ 5 जोड़कर 45 उत्तर दे सकते हैं (एक ही व्यक्ति की आयु बढ़ाते हैं)। / Students might just add 5 to 40 getting 45 (increasing age of only one person).","memoryTip":"समय के साथ हर व्यक्ति की आयु बढ़ती है। अगर 2 लोग हैं, तो 5 साल में कुल 10 साल बढ़ेंगे। / Age increases for everyone. If there are 2 people, total age increases by 10 in 5 years."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('lfQ_5jftRTEZBh4Fwy5CC', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'सबसे छोटी अभाज्य संख्या (Prime Number) कौन सी है?', '"[\"1) 0\",\"2) 1\",\"3) 2\",\"4) 3\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 17, 'General', 'Which is the smallest prime number?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["अभाज्य संख्या (Prime Number) वह संख्या होती है जिसके केवल दो गुणनखंड (factors) हों: 1 और वह संख्या स्वयं।","1 अभाज्य संख्या नहीं है क्योंकि इसका केवल एक ही गुणनखंड (1) है।","2 के दो गुणनखंड हैं (1 और 2)।","इसलिए, 2 सबसे छोटी अभाज्य संख्या है।"],"stepsEn":["A prime number is a number that has exactly two factors: 1 and the number itself.","1 is not a prime number because it has only one factor (1).","2 has exactly two factors (1 and 2).","Therefore, 2 is the smallest prime number."],"shortcut":"अभाज्य संख्याएँ हमेशा 2 से शुरू होती हैं (2, 3, 5, 7...)।","trap":"छात्र अक्सर 1 को सबसे छोटी अभाज्य संख्या मान लेते हैं, जो एक बहुत ही सामान्य गलती है। / Students often consider 1 as the smallest prime number, which is a very common mistake.","memoryTip":"2 एकमात्र ऐसी अभाज्य संख्या है जो सम (Even) भी है। बाकि सभी अभाज्य संख्याएँ विषम (Odd) होती हैं। / 2 is the only prime number which is also Even. All other prime numbers are Odd."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('fM62KducyzoGqi00FUogr', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', 'एक वृत्त (Circle) की त्रिज्या (Radius) 7 सेमी है। उसकी परिधि (Circumference) क्या होगी? (π = 22/7)', '"[\"1) 22 सेमी / 22 cm\",\"2) 44 सेमी / 44 cm\",\"3) 88 सेमी / 88 cm\",\"4) 154 सेमी / 154 cm\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 18, 'General', 'The radius of a circle is 7 cm. What will be its circumference? (π = 22/7)', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["वृत्त की त्रिज्या (r) = 7 सेमी।","वृत्त की परिधि का सूत्र = 2πr","मान रखने पर: 2 × (22 / 7) × 7","7 से 7 कट जाएगा।","परिधि = 2 × 22 = 44 सेमी।"],"stepsEn":["Radius of circle (r) = 7 cm.","Formula for circumference = 2πr","Putting values: 2 × (22 / 7) × 7","7 gets cancelled out with 7.","Circumference = 2 × 22 = 44 cm."],"shortcut":"सीधे सूत्र 2πr का उपयोग करें। 7 त्रिज्या होने पर परिधि हमेशा 44 होती है (यह स्टैंडर्ड डेटा है)।","trap":"छात्र πr² (क्षेत्रफल का सूत्र) लगाकर 154 उत्तर दे सकते हैं। / Students might use πr² (area formula) and answer 154.","memoryTip":"त्रिज्या (Radius) 7 होने पर: परिधि = 44, क्षेत्रफल = 154। इसे परीक्षा के लिए रट लें! / For radius 7: Circumference = 44, Area = 154. Memorize this for exams!"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('vg0FDUaBzpzTz6ClQ69mt', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', '30 लीटर मिश्रण में दूध और पानी 2:1 के अनुपात में हैं। इसमें दूध की मात्रा कितनी है?', '"[\"1) 10 लीटर / 10 L\",\"2) 15 लीटर / 15 L\",\"3) 20 लीटर / 20 L\",\"4) 25 लीटर / 25 L\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 19, 'General', 'In a 30 liter mixture, milk and water are in the ratio 2:1. What is the quantity of milk in it?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मिश्रण का अनुपात = दूध : पानी = 2 : 1","अनुपातों का कुल योग = 2 + 1 = 3 भाग।","3 भाग का कुल मान = 30 लीटर।","1 भाग = 30 / 3 = 10 लीटर।","दूध की मात्रा 2 भाग है, इसलिए = 2 × 10 = 20 लीटर।"],"stepsEn":["Ratio of mixture = Milk : Water = 2 : 1","Total sum of ratios = 2 + 1 = 3 parts.","Total value of 3 parts = 30 Liters.","1 part = 30 / 3 = 10 Liters.","Quantity of milk is 2 parts, so = 2 × 10 = 20 Liters."],"shortcut":"दूध = (दूध का अनुपात / कुल अनुपात) × कुल मिश्रण = (2 / 3) × 30 = 20 लीटर।","trap":"छात्र पानी की मात्रा (10 लीटर) निकाल कर उसे टिक कर सकते हैं। / Students might find the water quantity (10 liters) and tick it.","memoryTip":"कुल मिश्रण को हमेशा अनुपातों के योग (3) से विभाजित करें, फिर जो पूछा जाए उसके अनुपात से गुणा करें। / Always divide total mixture by sum of ratios, then multiply by the ratio of the asked quantity."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('iuPNEB_t7WKiS5eeP1czT', 'FYXDxkfQElQvBRXyv-YCH', '₹1000 पर 10% वार्षिक दर से 2 वर्ष का चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज (Compound Interest) कितना होगा?', '"[\"1) ₹200\",\"2) ₹210\",\"3) ₹220\",\"4) ₹250\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 20, 'General', 'What will be the Compound Interest (CI) on ₹1000 at 10% per annum for 2 years?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"math_quant","steps":["मूलधन (P) = ₹1000, दर (R) = 10%, समय (T) = 2 वर्ष।","चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज (CI) में पहले वर्ष का ब्याज = 1000 का 10% = ₹100।","दूसरे वर्ष का ब्याज = मूलधन पर ब्याज + पहले साल के ब्याज पर ब्याज।","दूसरे साल = ₹100 (मूलधन पर) + ₹10 (100 का 10%) = ₹110।","कुल CI = 100 + 110 = ₹210।"],"stepsEn":["Principal (P) = ₹1000, Rate (R) = 10%, Time (T) = 2 years.","In CI, 1st year interest = 10% of 1000 = ₹100.","2nd year interest = Interest on Principal + Interest on 1st year''s interest.","2nd year = ₹100 (on principal) + ₹10 (10% of 100) = ₹110.","Total CI = 100 + 110 = ₹210."],"shortcut":"2 साल के लिए 10% की दर से प्रभावी (Effective) CI 21% होता है। 1000 का 21% = ₹210।","trap":"छात्र इसे साधारण ब्याज (SI) समझकर 1000 का 20% (₹200) निकाल सकते हैं। / Students might treat it as Simple Interest (SI) and find 20% of 1000 (₹200).","memoryTip":"साधारण ब्याज में ब्याज पर ब्याज नहीं मिलता, लेकिन चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज में ''ब्याज पर भी ब्याज'' मिलता है। / In SI you don''t get interest on interest, but in CI you get ''interest on interest''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('g6bx4R-Z4i_gwA4wyKX1F', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'दी गई श्रृंखला में अगला पद ज्ञात कीजिए: 3, 8, 18, 33, 53, ?', '"[\"1) 78 / 78\",\"2) 75 / 75\",\"3) 80 / 80\",\"4) 73 / 73\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'Find the next term in the given series: 3, 8, 18, 33, 53, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["क्रमागत पदों के बीच का अंतर निकालें।","8 - 3 = 5","18 - 8 = 10","33 - 18 = 15","53 - 33 = 20","अंतर 5 के गुणज (multiples of 5) के रूप में बढ़ रहा है (5, 10, 15, 20)।","अगला अंतर 25 होगा।","53 + 25 = 78"],"chainEn":["Calculate the difference between consecutive terms.","8 - 3 = 5","18 - 8 = 10","33 - 18 = 15","53 - 33 = 20","The difference is increasing as multiples of 5 (5, 10, 15, 20).","The next difference will be 25.","53 + 25 = 78"],"pattern":"Difference of sequence is a multiple of 5 (+5, +10, +15, +20).","elimination":"The gap is strictly increasing by 5 each time. Adding 25 to 53 gives exactly 78.","memoryTip":"If a series grows steadily but not exponentially, always write down the single differences first. It usually reveals a basic multiplication table pattern."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('_XxbQU03dL_VjR-sRjP0u', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'यदि ''SUN'' को 54 लिखा जाता है, तो ''STAR'' को क्या लिखा जाएगा?', '"[\"1) 56 / 56\",\"2) 58 / 58\",\"3) 60 / 60\",\"4) 62 / 62\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'If ''SUN'' is written as 54, what will ''STAR'' be written as?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["शब्द के प्रत्येक अक्षर का अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला के अनुसार स्थानीय मान (Place value) लिखें और उन्हें जोड़ें।","S = 19, U = 21, N = 14","योग: 19 + 21 + 14 = 54","यही नियम ''STAR'' पर लागू करें:","S = 19, T = 20, A = 1, R = 18","योग: 19 + 20 + 1 + 18 = 58"],"chainEn":["Write the alphabetical positional value of each letter in the word and add them.","S = 19, U = 21, N = 14","Sum: 19 + 21 + 14 = 54","Apply the same rule to ''STAR'':","S = 19, T = 20, A = 1, R = 18","Sum: 19 + 20 + 1 + 18 = 58"],"pattern":"Direct Sum of Positional Values.","elimination":"The sum evaluates strictly to 58. Other numerical options are mathematically incorrect.","memoryTip":"Quick addition tip: Group numbers making 10s or 20s. (19+1=20), (20+20=40), (40+18=58)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('c-9yvAJRcO5POhZu1HZ_I', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'एक लड़के की ओर इशारा करते हुए, एक महिला ने कहा, ''इसकी माँ मेरी माँ की इकलौती बेटी है।'' महिला उस लड़के से किस प्रकार संबंधित है?', '"[\"1) माँ / Mother\",\"2) बुआ / Aunt\",\"3) बहन / Sister\",\"4) दादी / Grandmother\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'Pointing to a boy, a woman said, ''His mother is the only daughter of my mother.'' How is the woman related to the boy?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["महिला कह रही है: ''मेरी माँ की इकलौती बेटी'' (my mother''s only daughter)।","एक महिला के लिए, ''उसकी माँ की इकलौती बेटी'' वह स्वयं (herself) होती है।","अब वाक्य को सरल करें: ''इसकी माँ मैं स्वयं हूँ'' (His mother is me)।","अतः, वह महिला उस लड़के की माँ है।"],"chainEn":["The woman says: ''my mother''s only daughter''.","For a woman, ''the only daughter of her mother'' is she herself.","Now simplify the sentence: ''His mother is me''.","Therefore, the woman is the mother of the boy."],"pattern":"Self-referencing relationship puzzle.","elimination":"The ''only daughter'' specifies the speaker herself. So she is the mother of the boy, eliminating Aunt or Sister.","memoryTip":"If a female speaker says ''my mother''s only daughter'', instantly replace that entire phrase with ''ME''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('qioBzxPk0qoa_1rzTFcM_', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'मोहन उत्तर दिशा की ओर 12 मीटर चलता है। फिर वह दायीं ओर मुड़ता है और 5 मीटर चलता है। वह अपने प्रारंभिक बिंदु से न्यूनतम कितनी दूरी पर है?', '"[\"1) 17 मीटर / 17m\",\"2) 13 मीटर / 13m\",\"3) 15 मीटर / 15m\",\"4) 12 मीटर / 12m\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'Mohan walks 12m towards North. Then he turns right and walks 5m. What is the shortest distance from his starting point?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["यह एक समकोण त्रिभुज (Right-angled triangle) बनाता है।","उत्तर की ओर लंब (Perpendicular) = 12m","दायीं ओर (पूर्व) आधार (Base) = 5m","पाइथागोरस प्रमेय लागू करें: न्यूनतम दूरी (कर्ण)² = लंब² + आधार²","दूरी² = 12² + 5² = 144 + 25 = 169","न्यूनतम दूरी = √169 = 13 मीटर"],"chainEn":["This forms a right-angled triangle.","Perpendicular towards North = 12m","Base towards Right (East) = 5m","Apply Pythagoras Theorem: Shortest distance (Hypotenuse)² = Perpendicular² + Base²","Distance² = 12² + 5² = 144 + 25 = 169","Shortest Distance = √169 = 13 meters"],"pattern":"Pythagorean Triplet (5, 12, 13).","elimination":"17m is the total distance walked (12+5), not the shortest distance. 13m is the exact hypotenuse.","memoryTip":"Memorize the standard Pythagorean triplets: (3, 4, 5), (6, 8, 10), (5, 12, 13)."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Hd559NaDnkOzHEi-olVYr', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'कथन: 1. सभी लड़के छात्र हैं। 2. कुछ छात्र एथलीट हैं।
निष्कर्ष: I. कुछ लड़के एथलीट हैं। II. कुछ एथलीट छात्र हैं।', '"[\"1) केवल निष्कर्ष I सही है / Only conclusion I follows\",\"2) केवल निष्कर्ष II सही है / Only conclusion II follows\",\"3) दोनों सही हैं / Both follow\",\"4) कोई सही नहीं है / None follows\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'Statements: 1. All boys are students. 2. Some students are athletes.
Conclusions: I. Some boys are athletes. II. Some athletes are students.', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["लड़कों का वृत्त पूरी तरह से ''छात्र'' के वृत्त के अंदर है।","''एथलीट'' का वृत्त ''छात्र'' के वृत्त को काटता (intersect) है।","चूँकि एथलीट का वृत्त केवल छात्र को काटता है, यह निश्चित नहीं है कि यह अंदर जाकर ''लड़कों'' के वृत्त को भी छुएगा (निष्कर्ष I गलत है)।","कथन 2 कहता है कि ''कुछ छात्र एथलीट हैं'', तो इसका तार्किक उल्टा हमेशा सही होता है: ''कुछ एथलीट छात्र हैं'' (निष्कर्ष II सही है)।"],"chainEn":["The Boys circle is entirely inside the Students circle.","The Athletes circle intersects the Students circle.","Since the Athletes circle only intersects Students, it''s not guaranteed to reach inside and touch the Boys circle (Conclusion I is false).","Statement 2 says ''Some students are athletes'', its logical reverse is always true: ''Some athletes are students'' (Conclusion II is true)."],"pattern":"A + I Syllogism and Conversion logic.","elimination":"Without a direct link given between Boys and Athletes, positive conclusions about them are rejected.","memoryTip":"The conversion of ''Some A are B'' is always strictly ''Some B are A''."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('zJ87ucdc2Ey9b9SrFLip9', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'दी गई अक्षर श्रृंखला को पूरा करें: B, G, L, Q, ?', '"[\"1) U / U\",\"2) V / V\",\"3) W / W\",\"4) X / X\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'Complete the given alphabet series: B, G, L, Q, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["अक्षरों के स्थानीय मान लिखें: B=2, G=7, L=12, Q=17","अंतर निकालें: 7-2 = +5","12-7 = +5","17-12 = +5","यह एक समान अंतर (+5) की श्रृंखला है।","अगला अक्षर 17 + 5 = 22 होगा।","अंग्रेजी वर्णमाला का 22वाँ अक्षर ''V'' होता है।"],"chainEn":["Write the positional values: B=2, G=7, L=12, Q=17","Find the difference: 7-2 = +5","12-7 = +5","17-12 = +5","This is a uniform difference (+5) series.","The next letter will be 17 + 5 = 22.","The 22nd letter of the English alphabet is ''V''."],"pattern":"Uniform +5 forward shift.","elimination":"Counting strictly 5 letters forward from Q (R, S, T, U, V) gives V.","memoryTip":"Memorize the EJOTY pattern (5, 10, 15, 20, 25). B is E-3, G is J-3... so the last one is Y-3 = V."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('fO83g7yr6uuG0L0tbvHTh', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'आप रात में गश्त कर रहे हैं और देखते हैं कि एक दुकान का ताला टूटा हुआ है, लेकिन अंदर कोई दिखाई नहीं दे रहा है। एक पुलिसकर्मी के रूप में आपकी पहली कार्रवाई क्या होनी चाहिए?', '"[\"1) इसे नजरअंदाज करेंगे और आगे बढ़ जाएंगे / Ignore it and move ahead\",\"2) दुकान के अंदर जाएंगे और कुछ सामान अपने लिए ले लेंगे / Go inside the shop and take some items for yourself\",\"3) तुरंत नियंत्रण कक्ष को सूचित करेंगे, दुकान को सुरक्षित करेंगे और मालिक से संपर्क करने का प्रयास करेंगे / Immediately inform the control room, secure the shop, and try to contact the owner\",\"4) अपना ताला लगाकर वहां से चले जाएंगे / Put your own lock and walk away\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'You are on night patrol and notice a shop''s lock is broken, but no one is visible inside. As a police officer, what should be your first action?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["टूटा हुआ ताला एक संभावित अपराध (चोरी या सेंधमारी) का संकेत है।","एक पुलिसकर्मी का कर्तव्य संपत्ति की रक्षा करना और अपराधों की जांच करना है, इसे अनदेखा करना (विकल्प 1) कर्तव्य की अवहेलना है।","दुकान से सामान लेना (विकल्प 2) चोरी और भ्रष्टाचार है।","बिना जांच किए ताला लगाना (विकल्प 4) सबूतों से छेड़छाड़ हो सकती है।","सही प्रक्रिया नियंत्रण कक्ष को सूचित करना (बैकअप और रिकॉर्ड के लिए) और घटनास्थल को सुरक्षित करना है।"],"chainEn":["A broken lock is an indicator of a potential crime (theft or burglary).","A police officer''s duty is to protect property and investigate crimes; ignoring it (Option 1) is a dereliction of duty.","Taking items from the shop (Option 2) is theft and corruption.","Just locking it without checking (Option 4) could tamper with evidence or trap someone inside.","The correct procedure is to inform the control room (for backup and record) and secure the crime scene."],"pattern":"Property Protection / Crime Scene SOP SRT.","elimination":"Options 1, 2, and 4 range from illegal to highly negligent. Option 3 follows standard operating procedure.","memoryTip":"In ''Potential Crime Scene'' SRTs, the first steps are always: Inform Control Room -> Secure the Scene."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('VzYS24JOxWMQ4ik3PXfXR', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'एक ही पासे की दो स्थितियाँ दी गई हैं।
स्थिति 1: फलक 2, 3, 5
स्थिति 2: फलक 2, 3, 6
संख्या 5 के विपरीत कौन सी संख्या होगी?', '"[\"1) 1 / 1\",\"2) 4 / 4\",\"3) 6 / 6\",\"4) 2 / 2\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'Two positions of a single dice are given.
Position 1: Faces 2, 3, 5
Position 2: Faces 2, 3, 6
Which number will be opposite to 5?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["पासे का नियम: यदि दो पासों में दो फलक समान (common) हैं, तो शेष तीसरे फलक एक-दूसरे के ठीक विपरीत होते हैं।","स्थिति 1 (2, 3, 5) और स्थिति 2 (2, 3, 6) की तुलना करें।","यहाँ ''2 और 3'' दोनों स्थितियों में उभयनिष्ठ (common) हैं।","स्थिति 1 में ''5'' शेष है और स्थिति 2 में ''6'' शेष है।","अतः 5 के विपरीत 6 होगा।"],"chainEn":["Dice Rule: If two faces are common in two dice positions, the remaining third faces are exactly opposite to each other.","Compare Position 1 (2, 3, 5) and Position 2 (2, 3, 6).","Here ''2 and 3'' are common in both positions.","''5'' is remaining in position 1 and ''6'' is remaining in position 2.","Hence, 5 will be opposite to 6."],"pattern":"Two-Common Face Dice Rule.","elimination":"Since 2 and 3 maintain their presence, the face that changed (5 to 6) indicates the opposite sides of the dice.","memoryTip":"Cancel out the two numbers that look exactly the same in both pictures. The numbers left over are opposites."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('Vs-kKxdM_26SCApN_w2NU', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'यदि किसी निश्चित कूट भाषा में ''MILK'' को ''OKNM'' लिखा जाता है, तो उसी कूट भाषा में ''CURD'' को क्या लिखा जाएगा?', '"[\"1) EWFT / EWFT\",\"2) EWTF / EWTF\",\"3) DWTE / DWTE\",\"4) FWTG / FWTG\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'If in a certain code language ''MILK'' is written as ''OKNM'', then how will ''CURD'' be written in that language?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["शब्द के प्रत्येक अक्षर को वर्णमाला में 2 स्थान आगे खिसकाया गया है (+2)।","M(+2) = O, I(+2) = K, L(+2) = N, K(+2) = M","यही नियम ''CURD'' पर लागू करें:","C(+2) = E, U(+2) = W, R(+2) = T, D(+2) = F","परिणाम: EWTF"],"chainEn":["Each letter of the word is shifted forward by 2 places in the alphabet (+2).","M(+2) = O, I(+2) = K, L(+2) = N, K(+2) = M","Apply the same rule to ''CURD'':","C(+2) = E, U(+2) = W, R(+2) = T, D(+2) = F","Result: EWTF"],"pattern":"Uniform +2 Forward Shift.","elimination":"C+2 is E, eliminating options 3 and 4. R+2 is T, and D+2 is F, meaning it ends in TF, not FT. Option 2 is the exact match.","memoryTip":"Write out the shift for the first and last letters first (C->E, D->F). It usually eliminates 3 out of 4 options immediately."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('eYpwofHsZupNkqxLKqt2w', 'mYIqiyKwj4XVE5mYYYOWJ', 'दी गई मिश्रित श्रृंखला में प्रश्न चिह्न (?) के स्थान पर क्या आएगा: 10, 15, 12, 17, 14, 19, ?', '"[\"1) 16 / 16\",\"2) 21 / 21\",\"3) 15 / 15\",\"4) 20 / 20\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'What will come in place of the question mark (?) in the given mixed series: 10, 15, 12, 17, 14, 19, ?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"reasoning","chain":["यह एक मिश्रित (Alternate) श्रृंखला है जिसमें दो अलग-अलग अनुक्रम एक साथ चल रहे हैं।","विषम स्थानों (1st, 3rd, 5th...) की श्रृंखला: 10, 12, 14, ... (पैटर्न: +2)","सम स्थानों (2nd, 4th, 6th...) की श्रृंखला: 15, 17, 19, ... (पैटर्न: +2)","हमें 7वाँ पद (विषम स्थान) ज्ञात करना है।","विषम स्थानों की श्रृंखला का अगला पद: 14 + 2 = 16 होगा।"],"chainEn":["This is an Alternate series where two different sequences are running simultaneously.","Series at odd positions (1st, 3rd, 5th...): 10, 12, 14, ... (Pattern: +2)","Series at even positions (2nd, 4th, 6th...): 15, 17, 19, ... (Pattern: +2)","We need to find the 7th term, which falls in the odd position series.","Next term of the odd position series: 14 + 2 = 16."],"pattern":"Dual Intertwined Series (+2 / +2).","elimination":"Following the alternate pattern (10->12->14->16), the exact answer is 16. Option 2 (21) would be the answer for the 8th term.","memoryTip":"If a series goes up and down (e.g., 10 up to 15, down to 12, up to 17), it is almost always an intertwined alternate series."}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('juvETwLUH4GtC543WB8wx', '9YZzj61hPIg2AgtmQkE1e', 'प्रथम खो-खो विश्व कप के संदर्भ में, निम्नलिखित कथनों पर विचार कीजिए :
I. इस विश्व कप का आयोजन दिल्ली, भारत में हुआ।
II. भारतीय पुरुष फाइनल में नेपाल को 78-40 के स्कोर से हराकर पुरुष वर्ग में विश्व विजेता बने।
III. भारतीय महिलाएँ फाइनल में नेपाल को 54-36 के स्कोर से हराकर महिला वर्ग में विश्व विजेता बनीं।
उपर्युक्त कथनों में से कौन-सा/कौन-से सही है/हैं?', '"[\"केवल I\",\"केवल II और III\",\"केवल I और III\",\"I, II और III\"]"', '0.0', '1. ✅ Conceptual Core: पहला ''खो-खो विश्व कप'' जनवरी 2025 में नई दिल्ली के इंदिरा गांधी इंडोर स्टेडियम में आयोजित किया गया था (कथन I सही है)। भारत ने पुरुष और महिला दोनों श्रेणियों में जीत हासिल की, लेकिन फाइनल में भारत का मुकाबला इंग्लैंड (England) से हुआ था, न कि नेपाल से। अतः कथन II और III गलत हैं।
2. 🔄 Inter-disciplinary Link: इसे स्वदेशी खेलों के वैश्विक प्रसार और भारत की सांस्कृतिक कूटनीति से जोड़कर देखा जा सकता है।
3. 🧠 Veteran''s Wisdom: UPSC अब पारंपरिक भारतीय खेलों और उनके वैश्विक आयोजनों पर ध्यान केंद्रित कर रहा है।
4. ⚡ Tips & Elimination: चूंकि फाइनल में प्रतिद्वंद्वी इंग्लैंड था, इसलिए नेपाल वाले दोनों विकल्प आसानी से हटाए जा सकते हैं।', 2, 0, 100, 'Current Affairs | Sports', 'Consider the following statements in respect of the first Kho Kho World Cup:
I. The event was held in Delhi, India.
II. Indian men beat Nepal with a score of 78-40 in the final to become the World Champion in men category.
III. Indian women beat Nepal with a score of 54-36 in the final to become the World Champion in women category.
Which of the statements given above is/are correct?', '1. ✅ Conceptual Core: The first-ever Kho Kho World Cup was hosted at the Indira Gandhi Indoor Stadium, New Delhi, in January 2025 (Statement I is correct). While India won both titles, they defeated England in both the men''s and women''s finals, not Nepal. Thus, Statements II and III are incorrect.
2. 🔄 Inter-disciplinary Link: Relates to the global promotion of indigenous Indian sports and cultural diplomacy.
3. 🧠 Veteran''s Wisdom: Recent UPSC trends show a renewed interest in major sports events and traditional games being played on an international stage.
4. ⚡ Tips & Elimination: Knowing that England was the surprise finalist against India helps eliminate Statements II and III immediately.', 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '"{\"layoutType\":\"standard\",\"questionPrompt\":\"उपर्युक्त कथनों में से कौन-सा/कौन-से सही है/हैं?\",\"questionPromptEn\":\"Which of the statements given above is/are correct?\"}"', 'upsc');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('0x1JOSvY2fcdOiWO2DStF', 'PS0pMCOO4gOtoUTCMV_HH', '[2024-Q87]निम्नलिखित युग्मों पर विचार कीजिए :', '"[\"केवल एक युग्म\\nOnly one pair\",\"केवल दो युग्म\\nOnly two pairs\",\"सभी तीन युग्म\\nAll three pairs\",\"कोई युग्म नहीं\\nNone of the pairs\"]"', '1.0', '### 1. ✅ **Conceptual Core**
- **1. अर्जेंटीना (Argentina):** यह अपने इतिहास के **सबसे खराब आर्थिक संकट** (हाइपरइन्फ्लेशन, 200%+ मुद्रास्फीति दर, और गरीबी) का सामना कर रहा है। इसे लेकर वे पूरे वर्ष समाचारों में थे। (यह युग्म सही है)
- **2. सूडान (Sudan):** सूडान में देश की नियमित सेना (Sudanese Armed Forces) और एक शक्तिशाली अर्धसैनिक बल (Rapid Support Forces - RSF) के बीच **भयंकर युद्ध/गृहयुद्ध** चल रहा है, जिससे भारी मानवीय संकट पैदा हुआ है। (यह युग्म सही है)
- **3. तुर्की (Turkey):** तुर्की ने NATO की अपनी सदस्यता **निरस्त नहीं** की है। इसके विपरीत, वह नाटो का एक प्रमुख सदस्य बना हुआ है, और हाल ही में स्वीडन और फिनलैंड को नाटो में शामिल करने को लेकर अपनी वीटो पावर का उपयोग करने के कारण चर्चा में था। (यह युग्म गलत है)
अतः केवल दो युग्म (1 और 2) सही हैं।

### 2. 🔄 **Inter-disciplinary Link**
यह विशुद्ध रूप से अंतर्राष्ट्रीय संबंध (International Relations) और ''Places in News'' (भूगोल) का हिस्सा है।

### 3. 🧠 **Veteran''s Wisdom & Pattern**
UPSC हर साल ''देश और वे खबरों में क्यों थे'' (Countries and reasons for being in news) का एक मिलान (match) पूछता है। सूडान का संकट (जिसके कारण भारत को ''ऑपरेशन कावेरी'' चलाना पड़ा) और अर्जेंटीना की अर्थव्यवस्था बहुत प्रमुख अंतरराष्ट्रीय खबरें थीं।

### 4. ⚡ **Tips, Tricks & Elimination**
तुर्की नाटो की दूसरी सबसे बड़ी सेना है। यद्यपि वह अक्सर पश्चिमी देशों (विशेषकर अमेरिका) के साथ विवादों में रहता है, उसने नाटो कभी नहीं छोड़ा। नाटो छोड़ना एक भू-राजनीतिक भूकंप होता। यह स्पष्ट रूप से एक गलत कथन है। 1 और 2 की खबरे मुख्यधारा की मीडिया में बहुत आम थीं।', 2, 0, 101, 'Current Affairs', '[2024-Q87] Consider the following pairs:', '### 1. ✅ **Conceptual Core**
- **1. Argentina:** Correct. Argentina has been continuously in global headlines for battling its **worst economic crisis** in decades, with hyperinflation crossing 200%, severe currency devaluation, and the election of a radical libertarian president, Javier Milei.
- **2. Sudan:** Correct. Since April 2023, a brutal and devastating **armed conflict** erupted in Sudan between the country''s regular army (SAF) and the paramilitary Rapid Support Forces (RSF), leading to massive displacement (triggering India''s rescue mission, Operation Kaveri).
- **3. Turkey:** Incorrect. Turkey has **not** rescinded its NATO membership. It remains a crucial member of the alliance. It was in the news regarding NATO because it initially delayed and used its leverage to negotiate before finally approving the accession of Finland and Sweden to NATO.
Thus, exactly two pairs are correctly matched.

### 2. 🔄 **Inter-disciplinary Link**
This requires tracking major geopolitical shifts and humanitarian crises across the globe, integrating Current Affairs with International Relations.

### 3. 🧠 **Veteran''s Wisdom & Pattern**
UPSC''s "Places in News" questions always feature countries undergoing severe political instability, military coups, or extreme economic crises (like Sri Lanka or Argentina). 

### 4. ⚡ **Tips, Tricks & Elimination**
Turkey leaving NATO would be the biggest geopolitical news of the decade, shifting the entire balance of power in the Middle East and Europe. Since that obviously hasn''t happened, pair 3 is blatantly false. Argentina''s inflation and Sudan''s civil war were headline news throughout 2023-24.', 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '"{\"layoutType\":\"table\",\"questionPrompt\":\"उपर्युक्त युग्मों में से कितने सही सुमेलित हैं ?\",\"questionPromptEn\":\"How many of the pairs given above are correctly matched ?\",\"tableHeadersHi\":[\"देश\",\"समाचार में रहने का कारण\"],\"tableHeadersEn\":[\"Country\",\"Reason for being in the news\"],\"tableRowsHi\":[[\"अर्जेंटीना\",\"सबसे खराब आर्थिक संकट\"],[\"सूडान\",\"देश की नियमित सेना और अर्धसैनिक बलों के मध्य युद्ध\"],[\"तुर्की\",\"NATO की अपनी सदस्यता निरस्त कर दी\"]],\"tableRowsEn\":[[\"Argentina\",\"Worst economic crisis\"],[\"Sudan\",\"War between the country''s regular army and paramilitary forces\"],[\"Turkey\",\"Rescinded its membership of NATO\"]]}"', 'upsc');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('XHmYI0oH6QUdMHYKQxDAl', '9YZzj61hPIg2AgtmQkE1e', '[2025-Q21]निम्नलिखित युग्मों पर विचार कीजिए :
उपर्युक्त युग्मों में से कितने सही सुमेलित हैं?', '"[\"केवल एक\",\"केवल दो\",\"केवल तीन\",\"सभी चार\"]"', '2.0', '1. ✅ Conceptual Core: संयुक्त राष्ट्र (UN) के अंतर्राष्ट्रीय वर्ष:
I. महिला कृषक वर्ष: 2026 (सही)
II. सतत और समुत्थानशील पर्यटन वर्ष: 2027 (सही)
III. शांति और विश्वास वर्ष: 2025 के लिए नहीं (UN ने 2025 को ''सहकारिता का अंतर्राष्ट्रीय वर्ष'' और ''ग्लेशियर संरक्षण वर्ष'' घोषित किया है)। (गलत)
IV. क्षुद्रग्रह जागरूकता और ग्रहीय रक्षा वर्ष: 2029 (सही)
2. 🔄 Inter-disciplinary Link: यह वैश्विक शासन और अंतरराष्ट्रीय सहयोग के लक्ष्यों को दर्शाता है।
3. 🧠 Veteran''s Wisdom: महत्वपूर्ण वर्षों की सूची (जैसे 2023: बाजरा, 2024: कैमलिड्स) प्रारंभिक परीक्षा के लिए अनिवार्य है।
4. ⚡ Tips & Elimination: 2025 का मुख्य आकर्षण ''सहकारिता'' (Cooperatives) है, जिससे युग्म III गलत हो जाता है। अतः तीन युग्म सही हैं।', 2, 0, 101, 'International Relations | Current Affairs', 'Consider the following pairs:
How many of the pairs given above are correctly matched?', '1. ✅ Conceptual Core: UN International Years:
I. International Year of the Woman Farmer: 2026 (Correct)
II. International Year of Sustainable and Resilient Tourism: 2027 (Correct)
III. International Year of Peace and Trust: This is incorrect for 2025. The UN designated 2025 as the International Year of Cooperatives and Glacier Preservation. (Incorrect)
IV. International Year of Asteroid Awareness and Planetary Defence: 2029 (Correct)
2. 🔄 Inter-disciplinary Link: Connects UN General Assembly resolutions with global socio-economic and scientific agendas.
3. 🧠 Veteran''s Wisdom: Memorizing upcoming UN years is a standard part of Prelims preparation.
4. ⚡ Tips & Elimination: Recognizing 2025 as the ''Year of Cooperatives'' helps identify pair III as the misfit. Thus, three pairs match correctly.', 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '"{\"layoutType\":\"table\",\"questionPrompt\":\"उपर्युक्त युग्मों में से कितने सही सुमेलित हैं?\",\"questionPromptEn\":\"How many of the pairs given above are correctly matched?\",\"tableHeadersHi\":[\"युग्म\",\"वर्ष\"],\"tableHeadersEn\":[\"Pair\",\"Year\"],\"tableRowsHi\":[[\"I. अंतर्राष्ट्रीय महिला कृषक वर्ष\",\": 2026\"],[\"II. अंतर्राष्ट्रीय सतत और समुत्थानशील पर्यटन वर्ष\",\": 2027\"],[\"III. अंतर्राष्ट्रीय शांति और विश्वास वर्ष\",\": 2025\"],[\"IV. अंतर्राष्ट्रीय क्षुद्रग्रह जागरूकता और ग्रहीय रक्षा वर्ष\",\": 2029\"]],\"tableRowsEn\":[[\"I. International Year of the Woman Farmer\",\": 2026\"],[\"II. International Year of Sustainable and Resilient Tourism\",\": 2027\"],[\"III. International Year of Peace and Trust\",\": 2025\"],[\"IV. International Year of Asteroid Awareness and Planetary Defence\",\": 2029\"]]}"', 'upsc');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('6tT9LlkVHaP-WPmChNraR', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'मध्य प्रदेश का प्रसिद्ध ''गांधी सागर बांध'' (Gandhi Sagar Dam) किस जिले में स्थित है?', '"[\"1) मंदसौर / Mandsaur\",\"2) खंडवा / Khandwa\",\"3) रीवा / Rewa\",\"4) जबलपुर / Jabalpur\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 1, 'General', 'In which district is the famous ''Gandhi Sagar Dam'' of Madhya Pradesh located?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["गांधी सागर बांध मंदसौर और नीमच जिले की सीमा पर चंबल नदी पर स्थित है (मुख्यतः मंदसौर में गिना जाता है)।","यह चंबल घाटी परियोजना के तहत बनाया गया पहला बांध है।","इसकी आधारशिला 1954 में तत्कालीन प्रधानमंत्री जवाहरलाल नेहरू द्वारा रखी गई थी।"],"factsEn":["Gandhi Sagar Dam is located on the Chambal River on the border of Mandsaur and Neemuch districts (mainly counted in Mandsaur).","It is the first dam built under the Chambal Valley Project.","Its foundation stone was laid in 1954 by the then Prime Minister Jawaharlal Nehru."],"mnemonics":["Mandsaur ka Gandhi (M-G)"],"related":["राणा प्रताप सागर बांध (Rana Pratap Sagar Dam - Rajasthan)","चंबल नदी (Chambal River)"],"memoryTip":"गांधी जी हमेशा ''मंद'' (मुस्कुराते) रहते थे, इसलिए गांधी सागर ''मंदसौर'' में है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('apkEEHvWyioS2m3ot7ob7', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'प्राचीन काल में ''त्रिपुरी'' (Tripuri) किस राजवंश की राजधानी हुआ करती थी?', '"[\"1) चंदेल / Chandela\",\"2) कलचुरी / Kalachuri\",\"3) परमार / Parmara\",\"4) होलकर / Holkar\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 2, 'General', 'In ancient times, ''Tripuri'' used to be the capital of which dynasty?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["त्रिपुरी (जो वर्तमान जबलपुर के पास तेवर गाँव है) प्राचीन काल में कलचुरी राजवंश की राजधानी थी।","इस वंश के संस्थापक कोकल्ल प्रथम (Kokalla I) थे।","1939 में भारतीय राष्ट्रीय कांग्रेस का प्रसिद्ध ''त्रिपुरी अधिवेशन'' (Tripuri Session) भी यहीं हुआ था।"],"factsEn":["Tripuri (which is the present-day Tewar village near Jabalpur) was the capital of the Kalachuri dynasty in ancient times.","The founder of this dynasty was Kokalla I.","The famous ''Tripuri Session'' of the Indian National Congress in 1939 also took place here."],"mnemonics":["Tripuri ke Kalachuri (T-K)"],"related":["जबलपुर (Jabalpur)","सुभाष चंद्र बोस (Subhas Chandra Bose - Won Tripuri election)"],"memoryTip":"कल (Kalachuri) त्रिपुरी (Tripuri) में जाऊंगा।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ajCHpSp2BiGjIcsLVOnnh', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'प्रसिद्ध ''कालिदास समारोह'' (Kalidas Samaroh) मध्य प्रदेश में प्रतिवर्ष कहाँ आयोजित किया जाता है?', '"[\"1) खजुराहो / Khajuraho\",\"2) उज्जैन / Ujjain\",\"3) ग्वालियर / Gwalior\",\"4) भोपाल / Bhopal\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 3, 'General', 'Where is the famous ''Kalidas Samaroh'' organized every year in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["कालिदास समारोह प्रतिवर्ष उज्जैन में आयोजित किया जाता है।","यह समारोह कालिदास अकादमी द्वारा मध्य प्रदेश संस्कृति परिषद के सहयोग से आयोजित होता है।","इसमें संस्कृत नाटक, शास्त्रीय नृत्य और संगीत की प्रस्तुतियां दी जाती हैं।"],"factsEn":["Kalidas Samaroh is organized every year in Ujjain.","This festival is organized by Kalidas Academy in collaboration with the MP Culture Council.","Sanskrit plays, classical dance, and music performances are held in it."],"mnemonics":["Kalidas ki Nagari Ujjain"],"related":["कालिदास अकादमी (Kalidas Academy - 1978)","कालिदास सम्मान (Kalidas Samman)"],"memoryTip":"महाकवि कालिदास राजा विक्रमादित्य के नवरत्नों में से थे, जो उज्जैन के राजा थे।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('rd1MoLK57hteht_TKQkDX', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'भारत सरकार की अफीम और एल्कलॉइड फैक्ट्री (Opium and Alkaloid Factory) मध्य प्रदेश के किस जिले में स्थित है?', '"[\"1) नीमच / Neemuch\",\"2) मंदसौर / Mandsaur\",\"3) रतलाम / Ratlam\",\"4) उज्जैन / Ujjain\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 4, 'General', 'Where is the Government of India''s Opium and Alkaloid Factory located in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["भारत सरकार की अफीम (Opium) और एल्कलॉइड फैक्ट्री मध्य प्रदेश के नीमच जिले में स्थित है।","यह भारत में स्थित दो ऐसी फैक्ट्रियों में से एक है (दूसरी गाजीपुर, यूपी में है)।","मंदसौर अफीम का सबसे बड़ा उत्पादक जिला है, लेकिन सरकारी फैक्ट्री नीमच में है।"],"factsEn":["The Government of India''s Opium and Alkaloid Factory is located in the Neemuch district of MP.","It is one of the two such factories in India (the other is in Ghazipur, UP).","Mandsaur is the largest producer of opium, but the government factory is in Neemuch."],"mnemonics":["Neemuch ki Afeem (Neemuch - Factory)"],"related":["मंदसौर (Mandsaur - Largest Opium Producer)","गाजीपुर (Ghazipur - UP)"],"memoryTip":"अफीम कड़वी होती है, जैसे ''नीम'' (नीमच)।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('rdPdPCqTJNfd7_5f1gpmB', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'मध्य प्रदेश उच्च न्यायालय के प्रथम मुख्य न्यायाधीश (First Chief Justice) कौन थे?', '"[\"1) पी. वी. दीक्षित / P. V. Dixit\",\"2) एम. हिदायतुल्लाह / M. Hidayatullah\",\"3) जी. पी. सिंह / G. P. Singh\",\"4) ए. के. माथुर / A. K. Mathur\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 5, 'General', 'Who was the first Chief Justice of the Madhya Pradesh High Court?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["न्यायमूर्ति मोहम्मद हिदायतुल्लाह (M. Hidayatullah) मध्य प्रदेश उच्च न्यायालय के पहले मुख्य न्यायाधीश थे (1956)।","वे बाद में भारत के मुख्य न्यायाधीश (CJI) भी बने।","उन्हें भारत के कार्यवाहक राष्ट्रपति (Acting President) के रूप में भी कार्य करने का गौरव प्राप्त है।"],"factsEn":["Justice Mohammad Hidayatullah was the first Chief Justice of the MP High Court (1956).","He later also became the Chief Justice of India (CJI).","He also holds the distinction of serving as the Acting President of India."],"mnemonics":["High Court ki Hidayat (Hidayatullah)"],"related":["मुख्य पीठ (Principal Seat - Jabalpur)","प्रथम महिला न्यायाधीश (First Woman Judge - Sarojini Saksena)"],"memoryTip":"न्याय हमेशा ''हिदायत'' (Hidayatullah) के साथ दिया जाता है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('ge_i5dSQ3ibNenx1zVkwF', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'मध्य प्रदेश के किस राष्ट्रीय उद्यान को ''मोगली लैंड'' (Mowgli Land) के नाम से भी जाना जाता है?', '"[\"1) पन्ना / Panna\",\"2) माधव / Madhav\",\"3) पेंच / Pench\",\"4) कान्हा / Kanha\"]"', '3', NULL, 1, 0, 6, 'General', 'Which National Park of Madhya Pradesh is also known as ''Mowgli Land''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["पेंच राष्ट्रीय उद्यान (Pench National Park) को ''मोगली लैंड'' कहा जाता है।","यह उद्यान मुख्य रूप से सिवनी और छिंदवाड़ा जिलों में फैला हुआ है।","रुडयार्ड किपलिंग (Rudyard Kipling) की प्रसिद्ध पुस्तक ''द जंगल बुक'' (The Jungle Book) इसी क्षेत्र से प्रेरित थी।"],"factsEn":["Pench National Park is called ''Mowgli Land''.","This park is mainly spread over Seoni and Chhindwara districts.","Rudyard Kipling''s famous book ''The Jungle Book'' was inspired by this region."],"mnemonics":["Mowgli ka Pench (Pench - Mowgli)"],"related":["रुडयार्ड किपलिंग (Rudyard Kipling)","इंदिरा प्रियदर्शिनी पेंच (Indira Priyadarshini Pench - Another name)"],"memoryTip":"जंगल बुक के मोगली ने बाघ (शेरखान) के साथ ''पेंच'' लड़ाए थे।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('kZZ44-TFDmvT_QoDaXVu2', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'प्रसिद्ध ''चटकोरा नृत्य'' (Chatkora Dance) मध्य प्रदेश की किस जनजाति का प्रमुख नृत्य है?', '"[\"1) कोरकू / Korku\",\"2) सहरिया / Sahariya\",\"3) बैगा / Baiga\",\"4) भील / Bhil\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 7, 'General', 'The famous ''Chatkora Dance'' is the main dance of which tribe of Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["चटकोरा नृत्य मुख्य रूप से कोरकू (Korku) जनजाति द्वारा किया जाता है।","इस नृत्य में ''चटकोरा'' नामक एक वाद्य यंत्र (Instrument) का उपयोग किया जाता है जो लकड़ी से बना होता है।","कोरकू जनजाति मुख्य रूप से दक्षिणी मध्य प्रदेश (बैतूल, होशंगाबाद, हरदा) में पाई जाती है।"],"factsEn":["Chatkora dance is mainly performed by the Korku tribe.","An instrument called ''Chatkora'', made of wood, is used in this dance.","The Korku tribe is mainly found in southern MP (Betul, Hoshangabad, Harda)."],"mnemonics":["Korku ka Chatkora (K-C)"],"related":["कोरकू जनजाति (Korku Tribe)","थापटी नृत्य (Thapti Dance - Also Korku)"],"memoryTip":"चटकोरा की ''चटक'' आवाज़ कोरकू जनजाति को पसंद है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('g_x58tB89kiE0c7MVkR_p', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'सिंधिया राजवंश की भव्य छतरियाँ (Cenotaphs) मध्य प्रदेश के किस शहर में स्थित हैं?', '"[\"1) ग्वालियर / Gwalior\",\"2) शिवपुरी / Shivpuri\",\"3) इंदौर / Indore\",\"4) उज्जैन / Ujjain\"]"', '2', NULL, 1, 0, 8, 'General', 'Where are the grand Chhatris (Cenotaphs) of the Scindia dynasty located in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["सिंधिया राजवंश के पूर्वजों की छतरियाँ (समाधि स्थल) शिवपुरी में स्थित हैं।","यहाँ मुख्य रूप से माधवराव सिंधिया (प्रथम) और उनकी माता महारानी साख्या राजे सिंधिया की अत्यंत सुंदर छतरियाँ बनी हुई हैं।","शिवपुरी सिंधिया राजवंश की ग्रीष्मकालीन राजधानी (Summer Capital) हुआ करती थी।"],"factsEn":["The Chhatris (cenotaphs) of the ancestors of the Scindia dynasty are located in Shivpuri.","The extremely beautiful chhatris of Madhavrao Scindia (First) and his mother Maharani Sakhya Raje Scindia are mainly built here.","Shivpuri used to be the summer capital of the Scindia dynasty."],"mnemonics":["Scindia ki Shivpuri (Summer Capital)"],"related":["माधव राष्ट्रीय उद्यान (Madhav National Park - Shivpuri)","साख्या सागर झील (Sakhya Sagar Lake)"],"memoryTip":"ग्वालियर मुख्य राजधानी थी, लेकिन छतरियाँ और छुट्टियां मनाने की जगह शिवपुरी थी।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('eMF4AjQEbWLcVX0Oi3yXC', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'मध्य प्रदेश के किस शहर को ''चूना पत्थर नगरी'' (Limestone City) के नाम से जाना जाता है?', '"[\"1) कटनी / Katni\",\"2) सतना / Satna\",\"3) रीवा / Rewa\",\"4) पन्ना / Panna\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 9, 'General', 'Which city of Madhya Pradesh is known as the ''Limestone City''?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["कटनी (Katni) को मध्य प्रदेश की ''चूना पत्थर नगरी'' (Limestone City) कहा जाता है।","यहाँ चूना पत्थर के प्रचुर भंडार हैं और यह शहर सीमेंट और मार्बल उद्योगों के लिए प्रसिद्ध है।","कटनी को ''मुड़वारा'' (Mudwara) के नाम से भी जाना जाता है।"],"factsEn":["Katni is known as the ''Limestone City'' of Madhya Pradesh.","It has abundant reserves of limestone and the city is famous for cement and marble industries.","Katni is also known as ''Mudwara''."],"mnemonics":["Katni ka Chuna (K-C)"],"related":["सीमेंट उद्योग (Cement Industry)","मुड़वारा (Mudwara - Old name)"],"memoryTip":"चूना पत्थर को ''काटकर'' (कटनी) निकाला जाता है।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions" ("id", "test_id", "question_text", "options", "correct_answer", "explanation", "marks", "negative_marks", "order", "subject", "question_text_en", "explanation_en", "ideal_time", "type", "match_pairs", "deleted_at", "extended_data", "exam_type") VALUES ('BmRfGWlI13id9ej5VlYnJ', 'FkAgDNdhOlVxonk8d1g3J', 'विश्व की पहली ''व्हाइट टाइगर सफारी'' (White Tiger Safari) मध्य प्रदेश में कहाँ शुरू की गई है?', '"[\"1) मुकुंदपुर (सतना) / Mukundpur (Satna)\",\"2) बांधवगढ़ (उमरिया) / Bandhavgarh (Umaria)\",\"3) कान्हा (मंडला) / Kanha (Mandla)\",\"4) पन्ना राष्ट्रीय उद्यान / Panna National Park\"]"', '1', NULL, 1, 0, 10, 'General', 'Where was the world''s first ''White Tiger Safari'' started in Madhya Pradesh?', NULL, 60, 'standard', NULL, NULL, '{"explanation":{"stream":"gk_science","facts":["विश्व की पहली ''व्हाइट टाइगर सफारी'' (महाराजा मार्तंड सिंह जूदेव व्हाइट टाइगर सफारी) मुकुंदपुर में शुरू की गई है, जो सतना जिले में स्थित है (रीवा के बहुत करीब)।","1951 में रीवा के महाराजा मार्तंड सिंह ने सीधी के जंगलों से दुनिया का पहला सफेद बाघ पकड़ा था, जिसका नाम ''मोहन'' रखा गया था।","दुनिया के सभी सफेद बाघ इसी ''मोहन'' के वंशज माने जाते हैं।"],"factsEn":["The world''s first ''White Tiger Safari'' (Maharaja Martand Singh Judeo White Tiger Safari) was started in Mukundpur, which is in the Satna district (very close to Rewa).","In 1951, the Maharaja of Rewa, Martand Singh, caught the world''s first white tiger from the forests of Sidhi, which was named ''Mohan''.","All white tigers in the world are considered descendants of this ''Mohan''."],"mnemonics":["Mohan at Mukundpur (M-M)"],"related":["सफेद बाघ मोहन (White Tiger Mohan)","महाराजा मार्तंड सिंह (Maharaja Martand Singh)"],"memoryTip":"सफेद बाघ के मुख (Mukundpur) को देखने के लिए लोग दूर-दूर से आते हैं।"}}', 'mppolice');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('fIK6NfRPhvYWVGECyc3BJ', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'प्राचीन भारतीय दर्शन (षड्दर्शन) और उनके संस्थापकों के संदर्भ में निम्नलिखित युग्मों को सुमेलित करें:

सूची-I (दर्शन)        सूची-II (संस्थापक)
1. सांख्य             A. जैमिनी
2. वैशेषिक            B. कपिल मुनि
3. मीमांसा             C. कणाद
4. न्याय              D. गौतम मुनि Match the following pairs regarding Ancient Indian Philosophy (Shaddarshan) and their founders:

List-I (Philosophy)    List-II (Founder)
1. Sankhya            A. Jaimini
2. Vaisheshika        B. Kapila Muni
3. Mimamsa            C. Kanada
4. Nyaya              D. Gautama Muni');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('m-PqRDDsCr22baKyMAoC2', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'मौर्य प्रशासन के संदर्भ में निम्नलिखित कथनों पर विचार करें:
1. ''समाहर्ता'' (Samaharta) मुख्य कोषाध्यक्ष (Treasurer) होता था।
2. ''सन्निधाता'' (Sannidhata) राजस्व संग्रहकर्ता (Revenue Collector) होता था।
सही कथन चुनें: Consider the following statements regarding Mauryan Administration:
1. ''Samaharta'' was the Chief Treasurer.
2. ''Sannidhata'' was the Revenue Collector.
Select the correct statement:');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('c-3UknC91I0rwKtxwLYFC', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', '1857 की क्रांति के प्रमुख नेताओं और उनके केंद्रों को सुमेलित करें:

सूची-I (नेता)          सूची-II (केंद्र)
1. बेगम हज़रत महल      A. बिहार (जगदीशपुर)
2. कुंवर सिंह           B. लखनऊ
3. मौलवी अहमदुल्लाह     C. फैजाबाद
4. खान बहादुर खान       D. बरेली Match the leaders of the 1857 Revolt with their centers:

List-I (Leader)        List-II (Center)
1. Begum Hazrat Mahal  A. Bihar (Jagdishpur)
2. Kunwar Singh        B. Lucknow
3. Maulvi Ahmadullah   C. Faizabad
4. Khan Bahadur Khan   D. Bareilly');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('2FrL44XpKxzR87_oUbM5l', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'मुगल कालीन प्रशासनिक व्यवस्था में ''जात'' (Zat) और ''सवार'' (Sawar) का क्या अर्थ था? What did ''Zat'' and ''Sawar'' signify in the Mughal administrative system?');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('aWZD2yVaODR5OfRbUTark', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'स्वतंत्रता के बाद भारत में राज्यों के पुनर्गठन से संबंधित समितियों का सही कालानुक्रम (Chronology) क्या है?
1. जे.वी.पी. समिति (JVP Committee)
2. फजल अली आयोग (Fazl Ali Commission)
3. धर आयोग (Dhar Commission) What is the correct chronology of committees related to the Reorganization of States in India after Independence?
1. JVP Committee
2. Fazl Ali Commission
3. Dhar Commission');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('cmSVUq8ygOtmvokjmM1b2', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'निम्नलिखित में से कौन सा युग्म **गलत** सुमेलित है? (समाज सुधार आंदोलन और संस्थापक) Which of the following pairs is **INCORRECTLY** matched? (Social Reform Movement & Founder)');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('sH_dpGq4pqqTjsep0J57B', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'कांग्रेस के किस अधिवेशन में ''पूर्ण स्वराज'' (Complete Independence) का प्रस्ताव पारित किया गया था? In which session of the Congress was the resolution of ''Purna Swaraj'' (Complete Independence) passed?');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('iBn_GnDqH0PIfvmKajz-P', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'वैदिक साहित्य में ''श्रुति'' (Shruti) के अंतर्गत निम्नलिखित में से कौन शामिल नहीं है? Which of the following is NOT included under ''Shruti'' in Vedic literature?');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('T_hxCnQ6vLOmZTWrAyFU5', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'गदर पार्टी (1913) की स्थापना के संदर्भ में निम्नलिखित कथनों पर विचार करें:
1. इसका मुख्यालय सैन फ्रांसिस्को में ''युगांतर आश्रम'' में था।
2. लाला हरदयाल इसके संस्थापक सदस्यों में से एक थे।
3. ''गदर'' नामक साप्ताहिक पत्र केवल गुरुमुखी लिपि में छपता था।
सही कथन चुनें: Consider the following statements regarding the Ghadar Party (1913):
1. Its headquarters was at ''Yugantar Ashram'' in San Francisco.
2. Lala Hardayal was one of its founding members.
3. The weekly paper ''Ghadar'' was published only in Gurumukhi script.
Select the correct statements:');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('KAG0houFXFlQOUhm8ZDCN', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'मध्यकालीन भारत में ''दीवान-ए-अर्ज'' (Diwan-i-Arz) विभाग की स्थापना किसने की थी और यह किससे संबंधित था? Who established the ''Diwan-i-Arz'' department in Medieval India and what was it related to?');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('B147GY67exwkq4QrZqdw9', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'निम्नलिखित अधिनियमों और उनकी विशेषताओं को सुमेलित करें:

सूची-I (अधिनियम)             सूची-II (विशेषता)
1. भारत सरकार अधिनियम, 1919    A. प्रांतीय स्वायत्तता (Provincial Autonomy)
2. भारत सरकार अधिनियम, 1935    B. प्रांतों में द्वैध शासन (Dyarchy in Provinces)
3. मार्ले-मिंटो सुधार, 1909      C. सांप्रदायिक निर्वाचन (Communal Electorate) Match the following Acts with their features:

List-I (Act)                  List-II (Feature)
1. GoI Act, 1919              A. Provincial Autonomy
2. GoI Act, 1935              B. Dyarchy in Provinces
3. Morley-Minto Reforms, 1909 C. Communal Electorate');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('W72pL_NJdMA304M1c38oG', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'प्राचीन भारत में ''श्रेणी'' (Shreni) व्यवस्था के संदर्भ में क्या सत्य है?
1. यह व्यापारियों और कारीगरों का संगठन (Guild) था।
2. इसके पास अपने सदस्यों पर न्यायिक अधिकार भी थे।
3. श्रेणी अपने सिक्के जारी नहीं कर सकती थी। What is true regarding the ''Shreni'' system in Ancient India?
1. It was a guild of merchants and artisans.
2. It had judicial powers over its members.
3. Shrenis could not issue their own coins.');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('BKdBwQ-tkCp0KTyYWVixF', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'निम्नलिखित में से किसने ''मित्र मेला'' (Mitra Mela) संगठन की स्थापना की थी, जो बाद में ''अभिनव भारत'' बन गया? Who among the following founded the ''Mitra Mela'' organization, which later became ''Abhinav Bharat''?');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('zjWwdlWHmN9TwcLpfoNpz', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'विजयनगर साम्राज्य के शासक कृष्णदेव राय के दरबार में ''अष्टदिग्गज'' (Ashtadiggajas) कौन थे? Who were the ''Ashtadiggajas'' in the court of Vijayanagar ruler Krishnadevaraya?');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('kS6SwvjVus9javpCTc55M', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'गांधीजी के आंदोलनों का सही कालानुक्रम (Chronology) क्या है?
1. खेड़ा सत्याग्रह
2. अहमदाबाद मिल हड़ताल
3. चंपारण सत्याग्रह
4. रोलेट सत्याग्रह What is the correct chronology of Gandhiji''s movements?
1. Kheda Satyagraha
2. Ahmedabad Mill Strike
3. Champaran Satyagraha
4. Rowlatt Satyagraha');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('UFAsaoYAxLrlI2yiYtvHE', '3SEOYPPX_FgSKOTt1GN0U', 'वेदों के ब्राह्मण ग्रंथों को सुमेलित करें:

सूची-I (वेद)          सूची-II (ब्राह्मण)
1. ऋग्वेद             A. शतपथ
2. यजुर्वेद             B. ऐतरेय
3. सामवेद             C. गोपथ
4. अथर्ववेद            D. पंचविश Match the Brahmanas of the Vedas:

List-I (Veda)         List-II (Brahmana)
1. Rigveda            A. Shatapatha
2. Yajurveda          B. Aitareya
