Reason (R): They called the Indus river ''Indos''.
Select the correct option:');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('e04b4cc9-05a8-4638-a4d1-7d3ebff0d720', '33465b70-011e-45d7-92f3-5081351cc436', 'मध्यकाल के दौरान ''हिन्दुस्तान'' शब्द का प्रयोग किन भौगोलिक सीमाओं के लिए किया गया था? During the medieval period, for which geographical boundaries was the term ''Hindustan'' used?');
