Select the correct option:');
INSERT INTO "questions_fts" ("id", "testId", "questionText") VALUES ('a3ba6d04-52d2-4457-842b-26ed299d9201', '7e0f0608-37d8-4b62-9f32-be594f782ccd', 'षड्दर्शन और उनके प्रवर्तकों को सुमेलित करें (Match the Shaddarshans with their founders): Match the Shaddarshans with their founders:');
